msgid ""
"Get familiar with terms and expressions used in our work and privacy "
"enhancing technologies in general."
msgstr ""
"Bekanta dig med termer och uttryck som används i vårt arbete och inom "
"integritetsförbättrande teknik i allmänhet."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/contents.lr:section.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/
msgid "Circumventing censorship with little-t tor."
msgstr "Kringgå censur med little-t tor."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/contents.lr:section.title
#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/contents.lr:section.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/
msgid "Circumvention"
msgstr "Kringgå censur"

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"When direct access to the Tor network is blocked, you can configure little-t "
"tor to use bridges like obfs4, Snowflake, or WebTunnel to bypass censorship."
msgstr ""
"När direktåtkomst till Tor-nätverket blockeras kan du konfigurera little-t "
"tor att använda broar som obfs4, Snowflake eller WebTunnel för att kringgå "
"censuren."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "How to circumvent censorship with little-t tor?"
msgstr "Hur kringgår jag censur med little-t tor?"

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Using Bridges"
msgstr "Använda broar"

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"**Attention**: These instructions are meant for using pluggable transports "
"with tor, the network daemon i.e. little-t tor."
msgstr ""
"**Observera**: Anvisningarna gäller användning av pluggbara transporter med "
"nätverksdemonen tor, det vill säga little-t tor."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"1. Download and [install](../../getting-started/installing) `tor` or the "
"[Tor Expert Bundle](https://www.torproject.org/download/tor/) for Linux."
msgstr ""
"1. Hämta och [installera](../../getting-started/installing) `tor` eller [Tor "
"Expert Bundle](https://www.torproject.org/download/tor/) för Linux."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"1. Download and [install](../../getting-started/installing/#macos) `tor` or "
"the [Tor Expert Bundle](https://www.torproject.org/download/tor/) for macOS."
msgstr ""
"1. Hämta och [installera](../../getting-started/installing/#macos) `tor` "
"eller [Tor Expert Bundle](https://www.torproject.org/download/tor/) för "
"macOS."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"1. Download and [install](../../getting-started/installing/#source) `tor` or "
"the [Tor Expert Bundle](https://www.torproject.org/download/tor/) for "
"Windows."
msgstr ""
"1. Hämta och [installera](../../getting-started/installing/#source) `tor` "
"eller [Tor Expert Bundle](https://www.torproject.org/download/tor/) för "
"Windows."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"2. If you have `tor` installed, the pluggable transport binary, lyrebird, "
"can be downloaded as part of the [Tor Expert Bundle](https://"
"www.torproject.org/download/tor/)."
msgstr ""
"2. Om `tor` är installerat kan binärfilen för den pluggbara transporten, "
"lyrebird, hämtas som en del av [Tor Expert Bundle](https://"
"www.torproject.org/download/tor/)."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "3. Extract the Tor Expert Bundle to a directory of your choice."
msgstr "3. Packa upp Tor Expert Bundle i valfri mapp."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"4. For pluggable transports, obfs4 and WebTunnel, obtain bridges from the "
"[bridges website](https://bridges.torproject.org/options), via [Email]"
"(mailto:bridges@torproject.org) or via [Telegram](https://t.me/"
"GetBridgesBot)."
msgstr ""
"4. Hämta broar för de pluggbara transporterna obfs4 och WebTunnel från "
"[webbplatsen för broar](https://bridges.torproject.org/options), via [e-post]"
"(mailto:bridges@torproject.org) eller [Telegram](https://t.me/GetBridgesBot)."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "5. Modify Tor's configuration file, i.e. torrc."
msgstr "5. Ändra Tors konfigurationsfil, det vill säga torrc."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "6. Copy and modify the following sample `torrc`."
msgstr "6. Kopiera och ändra följande exempel på `torrc`."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"After exhausting these common troubleshooting steps, if the connection still "
"fails, the bridges you received may be offline or blocked."
msgstr ""
"Om anslutningen fortfarande misslyckas efter dessa vanliga felsökningssteg "
"kan broarna du fick vara frånkopplade eller blockerade."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"Bridge obfs4 <IP ADDRESS>:<PORT> <FINGERPRINT> cert=<CERTIFICATE> iat-mode=0"
msgstr ""
"Bridge obfs4 <IP ADDRESS>:<PORT> <FINGERPRINT> cert=<CERTIFICATE> iat-mode=0"

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Bridge webtunnel <IP ADDRESS>:<PORT> <FINGERPRINT> url=<URL> ver=0.0.1"
msgstr "Bridge webtunnel <IP ADDRESS>:<PORT> <FINGERPRINT> url=<URL> ver=0.0.1"

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Check the Tor logs for errors."
msgstr "Kontrollera om Tor-loggarna innehåller fel."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Configuring `tor` to use obfs4, Snowflake or WebTunnel"
msgstr "Konfigurera `tor` för obfs4, Snowflake eller WebTunnel"

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Direct access to the Tor network may sometimes be blocked."
msgstr "Direktåtkomst till Tor-nätverket kan ibland vara blockerad."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"For instructions on using pluggable transports with Tor Browser, refer to "
"the [Tor Browser user manual](../../../tor-browser/circumvention/)."
msgstr ""
"Anvisningar för att använda pluggbara transporter med Tor Browser finns i "
"[Tor Browsers användarhandbok](../../../tor-browser/circumvention/)."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"If Tor fails to connect, check that the `torrc` file is correctly formatted."
msgstr ""
"Om Tor inte kan ansluta kontrollerar du att filen `torrc` är korrekt "
"formaterad."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"If `tor` is installed from the Tor Expert Bundle ensure the `torrc` file is "
"in the same folder as the `tor` binary."
msgstr ""
"Om `tor` har installerats från Tor Expert Bundle kontrollerar du att filen "
"`torrc` finns i samma mapp som binärfilen `tor`."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"If access to the Tor Project website is blocked, use an official Tor Project "
"mirror."
msgstr ""
"Om åtkomsten till The Tor Projects webbplats är blockerad använder du en "
"officiell Tor-spegel."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"If you have [installed](../../getting-started/installing/) little-t tor on "
"Linux via your package manager, you will have to modify the default `torrc`."
msgstr ""
"Om du har [installerat](../../getting-started/installing/) little-t tor på "
"Linux med pakethanteraren måste du ändra standardfilen `torrc`."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"Note: If you have [installed](../../getting-started/installing/) little-t-"
"tor on Linux via your package manager and modified the default `torrc`, you "
"will have to restart the daemon for the changes to take effect."
msgstr ""
"Obs! Om du har [installerat](../../getting-started/installing/) little-t tor "
"på Linux med pakethanteraren och ändrat standardfilen `torrc` måste du "
"starta om demonen för att ändringarna ska börja gälla."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Now save the `torrc` file and run from the command line:"
msgstr "Spara nu filen `torrc` och kör följande från kommandoraden:"

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"Obtain new set of bridges from the [bridges website](https://"
"bridges.torproject.org/options), via [Email](mailto:bridges@torproject.org) "
"or via [Telegram](https://t.me/GetBridgesBot)."
msgstr ""
"Hämta en ny uppsättning broar från [webbplatsen för broar](https://"
"bridges.torproject.org/options), via [e-post](mailto:bridges@torproject.org) "
"eller [Telegram](https://t.me/GetBridgesBot)."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Please review the path to the pluggable transport executable"
msgstr "Kontrollera sökvägen till den pluggbara transportens körbara fil"

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"Steps to configure `tor` to use pluggable transports for different operating "
"systems are as follows."
msgstr ""
"Stegen för att konfigurera `tor` att använda pluggbara transporter på olika "
"operativsystem är följande."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"Tor can be configured to use pluggable transports by modifying Tor's "
"configuration file i.e. torrc."
msgstr ""
"Tor kan konfigureras för pluggbara transporter genom att ändra Tors "
"konfigurationsfil torrc."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"Tor can be used with circumvention tools, known as pluggable transports, for "
"getting around these blocks."
msgstr ""
"Tor kan använda verktyg för censurkringgående, så kallade pluggbara "
"transporter, för att ta sig förbi blockeringar."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Uncomment the line below depending to the type of bridge your are using"
msgstr ""
"Ta bort kommentarmarkeringen från raden nedan beroende på vilken typ av bro "
"du använder"

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"`lyrebird` implements several pluggable transport protocols, including "
"obfs4, Snowflake and WebTunnel."
msgstr ""
"`lyrebird` implementerar flera protokoll för pluggbara transporter, "
"däribland obfs4, Snowflake och WebTunnel."

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "`torrc` example:"
msgstr "Exempel på `torrc`:"

#: content/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"obfs4, Snowflake and WebTunnel are some pluggable transports available to "
"use with Tor."
msgstr ""
"obfs4, Snowflake och WebTunnel är några av de pluggbara transporter som kan "
"användas med Tor."

