#: content/little-t-tor/contents.lr:product.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/
msgid ""
"Little-t tor is the core software that powers the Tor network, routing your "
"traffic through volunteer relays to protect your privacy, anonymity, and "
"help you bypass censorship."
msgstr ""
"Little-t tor är kärnprogramvaran som driver Tor-nätverket och leder trafiken "
"genom reläer som drivs av volontärer för att skydda din integritet och "
"anonymitet och hjälpa dig att kringgå censur."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/
msgid ""
"Learn how to configure Apt to use Tor, ensuring your package downloads from "
"deb.torproject.org remain private and resistant to censorship."
msgstr ""
"Läs om hur Apt konfigureras för Tor så att pakethämtningar från "
"deb.torproject.org förblir privata och motståndskraftiga mot censur."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/
msgid "How to fetch Tor Debian packages over Tor"
msgstr "Så hämtar du Tor-paket för Debian över Tor"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/
msgid "Configuring Apt over Tor"
msgstr "Konfigurera Apt över Tor"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/
msgid ""
"For onion services run by the Debian project, please refer to their "
"[official documentation](https://onion.debian.org/)."
msgstr ""
"Information om onion-tjänster som drivs av Debian-projektet finns i dess "
"[officiella dokumentation](https://onion.debian.org/)."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/
msgid "For the stable version."
msgstr "För den stabila versionen."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/
msgid "For the unstable version."
msgstr "För den instabila versionen."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/
msgid ""
"Replace `<DISTRIBUTION>` with your Operating System codename. Run "
"`lsb_release -c` or `cat /etc/debian_version` to check the Operating System "
"version."
msgstr ""
"Ersätt `<DISTRIBUTION>` med operativsystemets kodnamn. Kör `lsb_release -c` "
"eller `cat /etc/debian_version` för att kontrollera operativsystemets "
"version."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/
msgid "Since Debian bookworm you can also use the more modern deb822-style:"
msgstr ""
"Från och med Debian Bookworm kan du även använda det modernare formatet "
"deb822:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/
msgid ""
"The Tor Project maintains an official Debian package repository "
"`deb.torproject.org`, which is also served through via an Onion Service: "
"http://apow7mjfryruh65chtdydfmqfpj5btws7nbocgtaovhvezgccyjazpqd.onion/"
msgstr ""
"The Tor Project underhåller det officiella Debian-paketarkivet "
"`deb.torproject.org`, som även tillhandahålls via en onion-tjänst: http://"
"apow7mjfryruh65chtdydfmqfpj5btws7nbocgtaovhvezgccyjazpqd.onion/"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/
msgid ""
"Then you need to add the following entries to `/etc/apt/sources.list` or a "
"new file in `/etc/apt/sources.list.d/`:"
msgstr ""
"Lägg sedan till följande poster i `/etc/apt/sources.list` eller i en ny fil "
"under `/etc/apt/sources.list.d/`:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/
msgid "To use Apt over Tor, the apt transport needs to be installed:"
msgstr "För att använda Apt över Tor måste Apt-transporten installeras:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/apt-over-tor/
msgid "Apt over Tor"
msgstr "Apt över Tor"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/contents.lr:section.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/
msgid "Understand the basics of Tor, the network program."
msgstr "Förstå grunderna i nätverksprogrammet Tor."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/contents.lr:section.title
#: content/relays/getting-started/contents.lr:section.title
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/contents.lr:section.title
