#: https://support.torproject.org/relays/getting-started/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/
msgid "Getting started"
msgstr "Kom igång"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "**Do not use the packages in Ubuntu's universe**."
msgstr "**Använd inte paketen i Ubuntus universe-arkiv**."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"**Note:** The `tor.sources` file shown above uses the deb822 format, which "
"is supported by APT 1.1 and later. If you're using an older version of APT "
"(typically found on older Debian or Ubuntu releases), this format may not be "
"supported. In that case, you can instead add the following to a `tor.list` "
"file in `/etc/apt/sources.list.d/` to achieve the same result."
msgstr ""
"**Obs!** Filen `tor.sources` ovan använder formatet deb822, som stöds av APT "
"1.1 och senare. Om du använder en äldre APT-version, vanligtvis i äldre "
"Debian- eller Ubuntu-utgåvor, kanske formatet inte stöds. Lägg då i stället "
"till följande i filen `tor.list` under `/etc/apt/sources.list.d/` för att "
"uppnå samma resultat."

