#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "3. Install GnuPG if not already installed:"
msgstr "3. Installera GnuPG om det inte redan är installerat:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "3. Install the Tor package"
msgstr "3. Installera Tor-paketet"

