msgid ""
"After applying all these changes, we update the packages list again and try "
"to check if there's already a new update to apply:"
msgstr ""
"När alla ändringar har tillämpats uppdaterar vi paketlistan igen och "
"kontrollerar om det finns någon ny uppdatering att installera:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Bootstrap `pkg`"
msgstr "Initiera `pkg`"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"DragonFlyBSD's daily snapshots and releases (starting with 3.4) come with "
"`pkg` already installed. Upgrades from earlier releases, however, will not "
"have it. If `pkg` is missing on the system for any reason, it can be quickly "
"bootstrapped without having to build it from source or even having "
"**DPorts** installed:"
msgstr ""
"DragonFlyBSD:s dagliga ögonblicksbilder och utgåvor från och med 3.4 "
"levereras med `pkg` installerat. Uppgraderingar från tidigare utgåvor saknar "
"det dock. Om `pkg` av någon anledning saknas kan det snabbt initieras utan "
"att byggas från källkod eller ens kräva att **DPorts** är installerat:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "DragonflyBSD has 2 packages repositories:"
msgstr "DragonFly BSD har två paketarkiv:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "For CentOS or RHEL:"
msgstr "För CentOS eller RHEL:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "For Fedora:"
msgstr "För Fedora:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"For fresh installations, the file `/usr/local/etc/pkg/repos/df-"
"latest.conf.sample` is copied to `/usr/local/etc/pkg/repos/df-latest`. The "
"files ending in the \".sample\" extension are ignored; pkg(8) only reads "
"files that end in \".conf\" and it will read as many as it finds."
msgstr ""
"Vid nya installationer kopieras filen `/usr/local/etc/pkg/repos/df-"
"latest.conf.sample` till `/usr/local/etc/pkg/repos/df-latest`. Filer med "
"ändelsen ”.sample” ignoreras. pkg(8) läser endast filer som slutar "
"på ”.conf” och läser alla sådana filer som hittas."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "For nightly builds, add the following:"
msgstr "Lägg till följande för nattliga byggen:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"Here's how you can enable Tor Package Repository for both CentOS and RHEL "
"and Fedora:"
msgstr "Så aktiverar du Tors paketarkiv för CentOS, RHEL och Fedora:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"Here's how you can enable Tor Package Repository in Debian based "
"distributions:"
msgstr "Så aktiverar du Tors paketarkiv i Debian-baserade distributioner:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"Here, it will be similar to what we have on a **FreeBSD** system, and we are "
"going to use HTTPS to fetch our packages, and updates - so here we also need "
"an extra package to help us out (`ca_root_nss`)."
msgstr ""
"Det fungerar ungefär som på ett **FreeBSD**-system. Vi använder HTTPS för "
"att hämta paket och uppdateringar, så även här behövs ett extra paket "
"(`ca_root_nss`)."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"If you add multiple entries to your file, make sure to add at least one "
"empty line between each entry."
msgstr ""
"Om du lägger till flera poster i filen ska det finnas minst en tom rad "
"mellan varje post."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"If you want to try experimental packages, add this stanza **in addition** to "
"the lines above:"
msgstr ""
"Om du vill prova experimentella paket lägger du till detta stycke **utöver** "
"raderna ovan:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "In the past they have not reliably been updated."
msgstr "Tidigare har de inte uppdaterats på ett tillförlitligt sätt."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Install `tor` NetBSD's package:"
msgstr "Installera NetBSD-paketet `tor`:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Install the `tor` package:"
msgstr "Installera paketet `tor`:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Installing the `ca_root_nss` package:"
msgstr "Installera paketet `ca_root_nss`:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Is this ok [y/N]: y"
msgstr "Är detta OK [y/N]: y"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"It should output either `amd64` or `arm64`. The repository does not support "
"other CPU architectures."
msgstr ""
"Utdata ska vara antingen `amd64` eller `arm64`. Arkivet stöder inga andra "
"processorarkitekturer."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"Modern versions of the NetBSD operating system can be set to use `pkgin`, "
"which is a piece of software aimed to be like `apt` or `yum` for managing "
"pkgsrc binary packages. We are not convering its setup here, and opt to use "
"plain `pkg_add` instead."
msgstr ""
"Moderna versioner av NetBSD kan konfigureras för att använda `pkgin`, ett "
"program som liknar `apt` och `yum` för hantering av binära pkgsrc-paket. Vi "
"beskriver inte konfigureringen här utan använder vanliga `pkg_add`."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Package installation"
msgstr "Paketinstallation"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Prerequisite: Verify the CPU architecture"
msgstr "Förutsättning: kontrollera processorarkitekturen"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Recommended steps to setup `pkg`"
msgstr "Rekommenderade steg för att konfigurera `pkg`"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"Replace `<DISTRIBUTION>` with your operating system's codename. You can run "
"`lsb_release -c` or check `/etc/os-release` to find it."
msgstr ""
"Ersätt `<DISTRIBUTION>` med operativsystemets kodnamn. Kör `lsb_release -c` "
"eller kontrollera `/etc/os-release` för att hitta det."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Setup `pkg_add`"
msgstr "Konfigurera `pkg_add`"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Suites: tor-nightly-main-<DISTRIBUTION>"
msgstr "Suites: tor-nightly-main-<DISTRIBUTION>"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "That means you could be missing stability and security fixes."
msgstr ""
"Det innebär att du kan gå miste om stabilitets- och säkerhetskorrigeringar."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"The Tor Project maintains its own [Debian package repository](https://"
"deb.torproject.org). Since Debian provides the LTS version of Tor, this "
"might not always give you the latest stable Tor version. Therefore, it's "
"recommended to install `tor` from our repository."
msgstr ""
"The Tor Project underhåller ett eget [Debian-paketarkiv](https://"
"deb.torproject.org). Eftersom Debian tillhandahåller LTS-versionen av Tor är "
"det inte säkert att du alltid får den senaste stabila Tor-versionen. Därför "
"rekommenderas att `tor` installeras från vårt arkiv."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"The Tor Project maintains its own [RPM package repository](https://"
"rpm.torproject.org) for CentOS and RHEL and Fedora."
msgstr ""
"The Tor Project underhåller ett eget [RPM-paketarkiv](https://"
"rpm.torproject.org) för CentOS, RHEL och Fedora."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"The package repository offers `amd64` and `arm64` binaries. Verify your "
"operating system is capable of running the binary by inspecting the output "
"of the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Paketarkivet erbjuder binärfiler för `amd64` och `arm64`. Kontrollera att "
"operativsystemet kan köra binärfilen genom att granska utdata från följande "
"kommando:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Then you can install the latest Tor package."
msgstr "Sedan kan du installera det senaste Tor-paketet."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"To enable all package managers using the libapt-pkg library to access "
"metadata and packages available in sources accessible over https (Hypertext "
"Transfer Protocol Secure)."
msgstr ""
"För att låta alla pakethanterare som använder biblioteket libapt-pkg komma "
"åt metadata och paket från källor som är tillgängliga över HTTPS (Hypertext "
"Transfer Protocol Secure)."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "To install the `tor` package on Arch Linux, run:"
