msgstr "Kör följande för att installera paketet `tor` på Void Linux:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"Unfortunately we're unable to provide packages for older releases including "
"Ubuntu versions covered by Ubuntu Pro / ESM contracts."
msgstr ""
"Tyvärr kan vi inte tillhandahålla paket för äldre utgåvor, däribland Ubuntu-"
"versioner som omfattas av Ubuntu Pro-/ESM-avtal."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"Using it for the first time, you will have to import the GPG public key."
msgstr "Första gången måste du importera den offentliga GPG-nyckeln."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"We can simply edit the **URL** used to point out the repositories on `/usr/"
"local/etc/pkg/repos/df-latest` and that's it! Remember to use **pkg+https://"
"** for Avalon."
msgstr ""
"Du behöver bara redigera den **URL** som pekar på arkiven i `/usr/local/etc/"
"pkg/repos/df-latest`. Kom ihåg att använda **pkg+https://** för Avalon."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"We provide a Debian package to help you keep our signing key current. It is "
"recommended you use it. Install it with the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Vi tillhandahåller ett Debian-paket som hjälper dig att hålla "
"signeringsnyckeln aktuell. Vi rekommenderar att du använder det. Installera "
"paketet med följande kommandon:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:accordion_item.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"We publish packages for current Debian and Ubuntu releases, up until the end "
"of their respective LTS support cycles."
msgstr ""
"Vi publicerar paket för aktuella Debian- och Ubuntu-utgåvor fram till slutet "
"av respektive LTS-stödperiod."

