msgstr ""
"Anvisningar för installation av Tor Browser finns i [Tor Browsers "
"användarhandbok](../../../tor-browser/getting-started/installing/)."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"These instructions are meant for installing tor the network daemon i.e. "
"little-t tor."
msgstr ""
"Anvisningarna gäller installation av nätverksdemonen tor, det vill säga "
"little-t tor."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "How to install Tor"
msgstr "Så installerar du Tor"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"**Replace `<version>` with the latest version of `tor`, for example, "
"`tor-0.4.8.12`**"
msgstr ""
"**Ersätt `<version>` med den senaste versionen av `tor`, exempelvis "
"`tor-0.4.8.12`**"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Download latest release and dependencies"
msgstr "Hämta den senaste utgåvan och beroendena"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "If you are using Homebrew in a Terminal window, run:"
msgstr "Om du använder Homebrew i ett terminalfönster kör du:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "If you are using Macports in a Terminal window, run:"
msgstr "Om du använder MacPorts i ett terminalfönster kör du:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"If you're building from source, first install [libevent](https://"
"libevent.org/), and make sure you have openssl and zlib (including the "
"-devel packages if applicable)."
msgstr ""
"Om du bygger från källkod installerar du först [libevent](https://"
"libevent.org/) och ser till att OpenSSL och zlib finns installerade, "
"inklusive -devel-paketen när det är tillämpligt."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Install `tor`"
msgstr "Installera `tor`"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Install a package manager"
msgstr "Installera en pakethanterare"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"Now you can run tor as `src/app/tor` (0.4.3.x and later), or you can run "
"`make install` (as root if necessary) to install it into `/usr/local/`, and "
"then you can start it just by running tor."
msgstr ""
"Du kan nu köra tor som `src/app/tor` (version 0.4.3.x och senare), eller "
"köra `make install` (som root om det behövs) för att installera det i `/usr/"
"local/` och sedan starta det genom att köra tor."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"The latest release of Tor can be found on the [download](https://"
"www.torproject.org/download/tor/) page."
msgstr ""
"Den senaste Tor-utgåvan finns på [hämtningssidan](https://www.torproject.org/"
"download/tor/)."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "There are two package managers on OS X: Homebrew and Macports."
msgstr "Det finns två pakethanterare för OS X: Homebrew och MacPorts."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"To install Homebrew follow the instructions on [brew.sh](https://brew.sh/)."
msgstr ""
"Installera Homebrew genom att följa anvisningarna på [brew.sh](https://"
"brew.sh/)."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"To install Macports follow the instructions on [macports.org](https://"
"www.macports.org/install.php)."
msgstr ""
"Installera MacPorts genom att följa anvisningarna på [macports.org](https://"
"www.macports.org/install.php)."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "You can use the package manager of your choice."
msgstr "Du kan använda valfri pakethanterare."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Source"
msgstr "Källkod"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/
msgid ""
"You can expose your Tor client to other machines on your LAN by binding it "
"to additional addresses in torrc."
msgstr ""
"Du kan göra Tor-klienten tillgänglig för andra datorer i det lokala "
"nätverket genom att binda den till ytterligare adresser i torrc."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/
msgid "Configure one Tor client as a LAN gateway for multiple hosts"
msgstr "Konfigurera en Tor-klient som lokal nätverksgateway för flera värdar"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/
msgid "Running Tor on a central server"
msgstr "Köra Tor på en central server"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/
msgid ""
"After this, your clients on their respective networks/subnets would specify "
"a socks proxy with the address and port you specified SocksListenAddress to "
"be."
msgstr ""
"Därefter anger klienterna i respektive nätverk eller undernät en SOCKS-proxy "
"med adressen och porten som du angav med SocksListenAddress."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/
msgid ""
"Because of this, if you are the controller of your domain and you know "
"everything's locked down, you will be OK, but this configuration may not be "
"suitable for large private networks where security is key all around."
msgstr ""
"Om du styr domänen och vet att allt är ordentligt skyddat bör detta fungera, "
"men konfigurationen är kanske inte lämplig för stora privata nätverk där "
"säkerhet är avgörande i alla delar."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/
msgid "By default Tor only accepts SOCKS connections from localhost."
msgstr "Som standard tar Tor endast emot SOCKS-anslutningar från localhost."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/
msgid ""
"Configuration is simple, editing your torrc file's `SocksListenAddress` "
"according to the following examples:"
msgstr ""
"Konfigurationen är enkel: redigera `SocksListenAddress` i torrc enligt "
"följande exempel:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/
msgid ""
"However, be forewarned that with this configuration, anyone within your "
"private network (existing between you and the Tor client/relay) can see what "
"traffic you are sending in clear text."
msgstr ""
"Observera dock att med denna konfiguration kan alla i det privata nätverket "
"mellan dig och Tor-klienten eller Tor-reläet se trafiken som skickas i "
"klartext."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/
msgid ""
"If you are interested in forcing all outgoing data through the central Tor "
"client/relay, instead of the server only being an optional proxy, you may "
"find the program iptables (for *nix) useful."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill tvinga all utgående data genom den centrala Tor-klienten eller "
"det centrala reläet, i stället för att servern endast fungerar som valfri "
"proxy, kan programmet iptables (för *nix) vara användbart."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/
msgid ""
"Please note that the SocksPort configuration option gives the port ONLY for "
"localhost (127.0.0.1)."
msgstr ""
"Observera att konfigurationsalternativet SocksPort ENDAST anger porten för "
"localhost (127.0.0.1)."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/
msgid "The anonymity doesn't start until you get to the Tor relay."
msgstr "Anonymiteten börjar inte förrän trafiken når Tor-reläet."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/
msgid ""
"This is most useful in an environment where many computers want a gateway of "
"anonymity to the rest of the world."
msgstr ""
"Detta är mest användbart i en miljö där många datorer behöver en "
"anonymitetsgateway till omvärlden."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/
msgid ""
"Tor can be configured as a client or a relay on another machine, and allow "
"other machines to be able to connect to it for anonymity."
msgstr ""
"Tor kan konfigureras som klient eller relä på en annan dator och låta andra "
"datorer ansluta genom den för anonymitet."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/
msgid ""
"When setting up your SocksListenAddress(es), you need to give the port with "
"the address, as shown above."
msgstr ""
"När du konfigurerar en eller flera SocksListenAddress måste porten anges "
"tillsammans med adressen, som i exemplet ovan."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/
msgid ""
"You can state multiple listen addresses, in the case that you are part of "
"several networks or subnets."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ange flera lyssningsadresser om du ingår i flera nätverk eller "
"undernät."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/tor-client-central-server/
msgid "Tor client"
msgstr "Tor-klient"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid ""
"A digital signature is a process that ensures the tor source code you "
"download was created by Tor developers and has not been tampered with."
msgstr ""
"En digital signatur säkerställer att källkoden till tor som du hämtar "
"skapades av Tor-utvecklarna och inte har manipulerats."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid ""
"Below we explain why it is important and how to verify that the Tor you "
"download is the one we created and has not been modified by an attacker."
msgstr ""
"Nedan förklarar vi varför detta är viktigt och hur du verifierar att den Tor-"
"version du hämtar är den vi skapade och inte har ändrats av en angripare."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid "How to verify tor source code"
msgstr "Så verifierar du källkoden till tor"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid "Verifying tor signature"
msgstr "Verifiera tor-signaturen"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid "**Attention: These instructions are to verify the tor source code.**"
msgstr ""
"**Observera: Dessa anvisningar gäller verifiering av källkoden till tor.**"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid ""
"**Please follow the right instructions to verify [Tor Browser's signature]"
"(../../../tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser).**"
msgstr ""
"**Följ rätt anvisningar för att verifiera [Tor Browsers signatur](../../../"
"tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser).**"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"After importing the key, you can save it to a file (identifying it by its "
"fingerprint here):"
msgstr ""
"När du har importerat nyckeln kan du spara den i en fil genom att "
"identifiera den med fingeravtrycket:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"As long as you have verified the signature you should not worry that the "
"reported date may vary."
msgstr ""
"Så länge signaturen har verifierats behöver du inte oroa dig för att det "
"angivna datumet kan variera."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid "Downloading the signature files"
msgstr "Hämta signaturfilerna"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid "Fetching the Tor Developers key"
msgstr "Hämta Tor-utvecklarnas nyckel"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"First of all you need to have GnuPG installed before you can verify "
"signatures."
msgstr "GnuPG måste vara installerat innan du kan verifiera signaturer."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid ""
"For example, `tor-0.4.6.7.tar.gz` is accompanied by "
"`tor-0.4.6.7.tar.gz.sha256sum.asc`."
msgstr ""
"Exempelvis åtföljs `tor-0.4.6.7.tar.gz` av "
"`tor-0.4.6.7.tar.gz.sha256sum.asc`."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid "For macOS users:"
msgstr "För macOS-användare:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid "How to do this will vary depending on your distribution."
msgstr "Hur detta görs varierar mellan distributioner."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"If `./tor.keyring` doesn't exist after running this command, something has "
"gone wrong and you cannot continue until you've figured out why this didn't "
"work."
msgstr ""
"Om `./tor.keyring` inte finns efter att kommandot har körts har något gått "
"fel. Fortsätt inte förrän du har tagit reda på varför det inte fungerade."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"If you are using GNU/Linux, then you probably already have GnuPG in your "
"system, as most GNU/Linux distributions come with it preinstalled."
msgstr ""
"Om du använder GNU/Linux finns GnuPG förmodligen redan i systemet, eftersom "
"det är förinstallerat i de flesta GNU/Linux-distributioner."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"If you are using macOS, you can [install GPGTools](https://gpgtools.org)."
msgstr ""
"Om du använder macOS kan du [installera GPGTools](https://gpgtools.org)."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid ""
"If you get an error message, something has gone wrong and you cannot "
"continue until you've figured out why this didn't work."
msgstr ""
"Om du får ett felmeddelande har något gått fel och du kan inte fortsätta "
"förrän du har listat ut varför det inte fungerade."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"If you get error messages containing 'No such file or directory', either "
"something went wrong with one of the previous steps, or you forgot that "
"these commands use example file names and yours will be a little different."
msgstr ""
"Om du får felmeddelanden med ”No such file or directory” har något gått fel "
"i ett tidigare steg, eller så har du glömt att kommandona använder "
"exempelfilnamn och att dina filnamn skiljer sig något."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"If you run Windows, [download Gpg4win](https://gpg4win.org/download.html) "
"and run its installer."
msgstr ""
"Om du använder Windows [hämtar du Gpg4win](https://gpg4win.org/"
"download.html) och kör installationsprogrammet."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid ""
"In order to verify the signature you will need to type a few commands in a "
"terminal window."
msgstr ""
"För att verifiera signaturen måste du skriva några kommandon i ett "
"terminalfönster."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"In order to verify the signature you will need to type a few commands in "
"windows command-line, `cmd.exe`."
msgstr ""
"För att verifiera signaturen måste du skriva några kommandon på Windows-"
"kommandoraden, `cmd.exe`."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid "Installing GnuPG"
msgstr "Installera GnuPG"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid ""
"Note that these commands use example file names and yours will be different: "
"you will have downloaded a different version than 9.0 and you may not have "
"chosen the English (en-US) version."
msgstr ""
"Observera att kommandona använder exempelfilnamn och att dina kommer att "
"skilja sig: du har hämtat en annan version än 9.0 och kanske inte valde den "
"engelska versionen (en-US)."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid ""
"Now that we validated the signatures of the checksum, we need to verify the "
"integrity of the package."
msgstr ""
"När kontrollsummans signatur har verifierats måste paketets integritet "
"kontrolleras."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"Please notice that a signature is dated the moment the package has been "
"signed."
msgstr "Observera att en signatur dateras när paketet signeras."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid ""
"The Tor source files on our [download page](https://www.torproject.org/"
"download/tor) are accompanied by two files which are labelled \"checksum\" "
"and \"sig\" with the same name as the package and the extension "
"\".sha256sum\" and \".sha256sum.asc\" respectively."
msgstr ""
"Tor-källfilerna på vår [hämtningssida](https://www.torproject.org/download/"
"tor) åtföljs av två filer med beteckningarna ”checksum” och ”sig”, med samma "
"namn som paketet och filändelserna ”.sha256sum” respektive ”.sha256sum.asc”."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid ""
"The `.asc` file will verify that the `.sha256sum` file (containing the "
"checksum of the package) has not been tampered with. Once the signature has "
"been validated (see below on how to do it), the package integrity can be "
"validated with:"
msgstr ""
"Filen `.asc` verifierar att filen `.sha256sum`, som innehåller paketets "
"kontrollsumma, inte har manipulerats. När signaturen har verifierats enligt "
"anvisningarna nedan kan paketets integritet kontrolleras med:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"The examples below assume that you downloaded these two files to your "
"\"Downloads\" folder."
msgstr ""
"I exemplen nedan förutsätts att du hämtade de två filerna till mappen "
"”Hämtningar”."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid ""
"The following keys can sign the tarball. Don't expect them all, it can vary "
"depending on who is available to make the release."
msgstr ""
"Följande nycklar kan signera tar-arkivet. Förvänta dig inte att alla "
"används; det varierar beroende på vem som är tillgänglig för att skapa "
"utgåvan."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid ""
"The result of the command should produce something like this (depending on "
"which key signed it):"
msgstr ""
"Kommandot bör ge ett resultat som liknar detta, beroende på vilken nyckel "
"som signerade filen:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"Therefore every time a new file is uploaded a new signature is generated "
"with a different date."
msgstr ""
"Varje gång en ny fil överförs skapas därför en ny signatur med ett annat "
"datum."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"These are example file names and will not exactly match the file names that "
"you download."
msgstr ""
"Detta är exempelfilnamn och de motsvarar inte exakt filnamnen du hämtar."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid ""
"These files allow you to verify the file you've downloaded is exactly the "
"one that we intended you to get."
msgstr ""
"Med dessa filer kan du verifiera att den hämtade filen är exakt den fil vi "
"avsåg att du skulle få."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"This command results in the key being saved to a file found at the path `./"
"tor.keyring`, i.e. in the current directory."
msgstr ""
"Kommandot sparar nyckeln i filen `./tor.keyring`, det vill säga i den "
"aktuella mappen."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid "This should show you something like (for nickm):"
msgstr "Det bör visa ungefär följande (för nickm):"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid ""
"This will vary by web browser, but generally you can download this file by "
"right-clicking the \"sig\" and \"checksum\" link and selecting the \"save "
"file as\" option."
msgstr ""
"Detta varierar mellan webbläsare, men normalt kan du hämta filen genom att "
"högerklicka på länken ”sig” eller ”checksum” och välja ”Spara fil som”."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid ""
"To verify the signature of the package you downloaded, you will need to "
"download the corresponding `.sha256sum.asc` signature file and the "
"`.sha256sum` file itself, and verify it with a command that asks GnuPG to "
"verify the file that you downloaded."
msgstr ""
"För att verifiera signaturen för det hämtade paketet måste du hämta "
"motsvarande signaturfil `.sha256sum.asc` och själva filen `.sha256sum` och "
"sedan använda ett kommando som ber GnuPG verifiera den hämtade filen."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid "Verifying checksum"
msgstr "Verifiera kontrollsumman"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid "Verifying the signature"
msgstr "Verifiera signaturen"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid "You can fetch the key with the links provided above or with:"
msgstr "Du kan hämta nyckeln via länkarna ovan eller med:"

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"You may also want to [learn more about GnuPG](https://www.gnupg.org/"
"documentation/)."
msgstr ""
"Du kanske också vill [läsa mer om GnuPG](https://www.gnupg.org/"
"documentation/)."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid ""
"You might be able to import the key using the **Workaround (using a public "
"key)** section instead."
msgstr ""
"Du kan eventuellt importera nyckeln med avsnittet **Tillfällig lösning (med "
"offentlig nyckel)**."

#: content/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/getting-started/verifying/
msgid "BSD/Linux"
msgstr "BSD/Linux"

#: content/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/
msgid ""
"Even if an application uses Tor's SOCKS proxy, it can still reveal "
"destination hostnames."
msgstr ""
"Även om ett program använder Tors SOCKS-proxy kan det fortfarande avslöja "
"destinationens värdnamn."

#: content/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/
msgid ""
"This article explains how to test your app for DNS leaks using Tor's built-"
"in options and how to block unsafe connections."
msgstr ""
"Artikeln förklarar hur du testar ett program efter DNS-läckor med Tors "
"inbyggda alternativ och hur osäkra anslutningar blockeras."

#: content/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/
msgid ""
"How to verify whether your SOCKS-using application is leaking DNS requests "
"over Tor"
msgstr ""
"Så kontrollerar du om ett program som använder SOCKS läcker DNS-"
"förfrågningar över Tor"

#: content/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/
msgid "Checking for DNS leaks with SOCKS and Tor"
msgstr "Kontrollera DNS-läckor med SOCKS och Tor"

#: content/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/
msgid "1. Add `TestSocks 1` to your torrc file."
msgstr "1. Lägg till `TestSocks 1` i filen torrc."

#: content/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/
msgid ""
"1. Start Tor, and point your program's SOCKS proxy settings to Tor's SOCKS5 "
"server (`socks5://127.0.0.1:9050` by default)."
msgstr ""
"1. Starta Tor och ange Tors SOCKS5-server som programmets SOCKS-proxy "
"(`socks5://127.0.0.1:9050` som standard)."

#: content/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/
msgid ""
"1. Watch your logs as you use your application. For each socks connection, "
"Tor will log a `notice` for safe connections, and a `warn` for connections "
"leaking DNS requests."
msgstr ""
"1. Övervaka loggarna när du använder programmet. För varje SOCKS-anslutning "
"loggar Tor `notice` för säkra anslutningar och `warn` för anslutningar som "
"läcker DNS-förfrågningar."

#: content/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/
msgid ""
"Even if your application is using the correct variant of the SOCKS protocol, "
"there is still a risk that it could be leaking DNS queries."
msgstr ""
"Även om programmet använder rätt variant av SOCKS-protokollet finns det en "
"risk att det läcker DNS-förfrågningar."

#: content/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/
msgid ""
"If you suspect your application might behave like this, follow the "
"instructions below to check."
msgstr ""
"Följ anvisningarna nedan om du misstänker att programmet beter sig på detta "
"sätt."

#: content/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/
msgid ""
"If you want to automatically disable all connections leaking DNS requests, "
"set `SafeSocks 1` in your torrc file."
msgstr ""
"Ange `SafeSocks 1` i filen torrc om du automatiskt vill inaktivera alla "
"anslutningar som läcker DNS-förfrågningar."

#: content/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/check-for-leaks/
msgid ""
"This problem happens in Firefox extensions that resolve the destination "
"hostname themselves, for example to show you its IP address, what country "
"it's in, etc."
msgstr ""
"Problemet förekommer i Firefox-tillägg som själva slår upp destinationens "
"värdnamn, till exempel för att visa IP-adressen, landet och liknande."

#: content/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/contents.lr:section.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/little-t-tor/troubleshooting/
msgid "Troubleshooting little-t tor."
msgstr "Felsöka little-t tor."

#: content/mullvad-browser/contents.lr:product.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/mullvad-browser/
msgid ""
"It benefits from all the privacy features of Tor Browser and can be used "
"with a trusted VPN."
msgstr ""
"Mullvad Browser har alla Tor Browsers integritetsfunktioner och kan användas "
"med en betrodd VPN-tjänst."

#: content/mullvad-browser/contents.lr:product.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/mullvad-browser/
msgid "Mullvad Browser is Tor Browser without the Tor network."
msgstr "Mullvad Browser är Tor Browser utan Tor-nätverket."

#: content/mullvad-browser/faqs/contents.lr:section.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/mullvad-browser/faqs/
