#: content/mullvad-browser/faqs/does-mullvad-store-collect-data/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/mullvad-browser/faqs/does-mullvad-store-collect-data/
msgid "No."
msgstr "Nej."

#: content/mullvad-browser/faqs/does-mullvad-store-collect-data/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: content/mullvad-browser/faqs/does-mullvad-store-collect-data/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/mullvad-browser/faqs/does-mullvad-store-collect-data/contents.lr:tab.title
