#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid "Desktop"
msgstr "Skrivbord"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/
msgid ""
"Most antivirus or malware protection allows the user to \"allowlist\" "
"certain processes that would otherwise be blocked."
msgstr ""
"De flesta antivirus- och skadeprogramsskydd låter användaren lägga till "
"processer i en tillåtelselista om de annars skulle blockeras."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/
msgid ""
"My antivirus or malware protection is blocking me from accessing Tor Browser."
msgstr ""
"Mitt antivirus- eller skadeprogramsskydd hindrar mig från att använda Tor "
"Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/
msgid "Antivirus blocking Tor Browser"
msgstr "Antivirus blockerar Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/
msgid "Allowing Tor Browser processes"
msgstr "Tillåt Tor Browser-processer"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/
msgid "Finally, restart Tor Browser."
msgstr "Starta slutligen om Tor Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/
msgid "For Windows"
msgstr "För Windows"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/
msgid "For macOS"
msgstr "För macOS"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/
msgid ""
"If you downloaded Tor Browser from [our main website](https://"
"www.torproject.org/download/) or used [GetTor](../../getting-started/"
"downloading), and [verified it](../../getting-started/verifying-tor-"
"browser/), these are false positives and you have nothing to worry about."
msgstr ""
"Om du hämtade Tor Browser från [vår huvudwebbplats](https://"
"www.torproject.org/download/) eller använde [GetTor](../../getting-started/"
"downloading) och [verifierade programmet](../../getting-started/verifying-"
"tor-browser/) är varningarna falska positiva resultat och inget att oroa sig "
"för."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/
msgid "Next, include the following processes:"
msgstr "Lägg sedan till följande processer:"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/
msgid ""
"Please note that some antivirus clients, like Kaspersky, may also be "
"blocking Tor at the firewall level."
msgstr ""
"Observera att vissa antivirusprogram, exempelvis Kaspersky, även kan "
"blockera Tor på brandväggsnivå."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/
msgid ""
"Please open your antivirus or malware protection software and look in the "
"settings for an \"allowlist\" or something similar."
msgstr ""
"Öppna antivirus- eller skadeprogramsskyddet och leta i inställningarna efter "
"en ”tillåtelselista” eller motsvarande."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/
msgid ""
"Some antivirus software will pop up malware and/or vulnerability warnings "
"when Tor Browser is launched."
msgstr ""
"Vissa antivirusprogram visar varningar om skadeprogram och/eller sårbarheter "
"när Tor Browser startas."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/
msgid ""
"Some antiviruses consider that files that have not been seen by a lot of "
"users as suspicious."
msgstr ""
"Vissa antivirusprogram betraktar filer som inte har använts av många "
"personer som misstänkta."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/
msgid "This should fix the issues you're experiencing."
msgstr "Det bör lösa problemen."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/
msgid ""
"To make sure that the Tor program you download is the one we have created "
"and has not been modified by some attacker, you can [verify Tor Browser's "
"signature](../../getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/)."
msgstr ""
"För att säkerställa att Tor-programmet som du hämtar är det som vi har "
"skapat och inte har ändrats av en angripare kan du [verifiera Tor Browsers "
"signatur](../../getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/)."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/
msgid ""
"You may also want to permit certain processes to prevent antiviruses from "
"blocking access to Tor Browser."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också behöva tillåta vissa processer för att förhindra att "
"antivirusprogram blockerar Tor Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/antivirus/
msgid "lyrebird"
msgstr "lyrebird"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid ""
"Some websites require Tor users to solve CAPTCHAs or display warnings about "
"unusual activity."
msgstr ""
"Vissa webbplatser kräver att Tor-användare löser CAPTCHA-test eller visar "
"varningar om ovanlig aktivitet."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid ""
"This happens because many people share the same Tor exit relays, not because "
"Tor itself is unsafe."
msgstr ""
"Det beror på att många personer delar samma Tor-utgångsreläer, inte på att "
"Tor i sig är osäkert."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid ""
"Why do websites make me solve CAPTCHAs or warn me about spyware when using "
"Tor?"
msgstr ""
"Varför kräver webbplatser CAPTCHA-test eller varnar för spionprogram när jag "
"använder Tor?"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid "CAPTCHAs and warning messages"
msgstr "CAPTCHA-test och varningsmeddelanden"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid ""
"**Try a new circuit:** In Tor Browser, choose **\"New Circuit for this "
"Site\"** to get a different exit relay (and therefore a different IP "
"address)."
msgstr ""
"**Prova en ny krets:** Välj **”Ny krets för den här webbplatsen”** i Tor "
"Browser för att få ett annat utgångsrelä och därmed en annan IP-adress."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid ""
"**Use alternative services:** Some search engines and websites (like "
"[DuckDuckGo](https://duckduckgo.com)) are friendlier to Tor users and rarely "
"trigger CAPTCHAs."
msgstr ""
"**Använd alternativa tjänster:** Vissa sökmotorer och webbplatser, "
"exempelvis [DuckDuckGo](https://duckduckgo.com), är mer välvilligt inställda "
"till Tor-användare och visar sällan CAPTCHA-test."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid ""
"**Wait and try later:** These warnings are often temporary, and usually "
"clear up when traffic levels at a relay return to normal."
msgstr ""
"**Vänta och försök senare:** Varningarna är ofta tillfälliga och försvinner "
"vanligtvis när trafiknivån på reläet återgår till det normala."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid ""
"As a result, some sites present CAPTCHAs, temporary blocks, or even display "
"warnings about “suspicious” or “infected” traffic."
msgstr ""
"Därför kan vissa webbplatser visa CAPTCHA-test, tillfälliga blockeringar "
"eller varningar om ”misstänkt” eller ”infekterad” trafik."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid "Important to know"
msgstr "Viktigt att känna till"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid "Many automated requests or logins from a single IP address."
msgstr ""
"Många automatiserade begäranden eller inloggningar från en och samma IP-"
"adress."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid ""
"These warnings do **not** mean Tor Browser is spyware or that your device is "
"infected."
msgstr ""
"Varningarna innebär **inte** att Tor Browser är spionprogram eller att "
"enheten är infekterad."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid ""
"Thousands of users around the world may be using the same relay IP address "
"at the same time."
msgstr ""
"Tusentals användare runt om i världen kan använda samma relä-IP-adress "
"samtidigt."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid ""
"To our knowledge, most large websites are not specifically trying to block "
"Tor - their automated abuse detection systems simply can't tell Tor traffic "
"apart from suspicious traffic."
msgstr ""
"Såvitt vi vet försöker de flesta stora webbplatser inte uttryckligen "
"blockera Tor. Deras automatiserade system för missbruksidentifiering kan "
"helt enkelt inte skilja Tor-trafik från misstänkt trafik."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid "Traffic patterns that resemble bots, crawlers, or malware."
msgstr "Trafikmönster som liknar botar, webbrobotar eller skadeprogram."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid ""
"Websites are responding to the **shared nature of exit relays**, not your "
"individual activity."
msgstr ""
"Webbplatserna reagerar på **utgångsreläernas delade karaktär**, inte på din "
"enskilda aktivitet."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid "Websites often interpret this as unusual activity, for example:"
msgstr "Webbplatser tolkar ofta detta som ovanlig aktivitet, exempelvis:"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid "What you can do"
msgstr "Det här kan du göra"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid ""
"When you use Tor Browser, your traffic exits through **shared Tor exit "
"relays**."
msgstr ""
"När du använder Tor Browser lämnar trafiken nätverket genom **delade Tor-"
"utgångsreläer**."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/captchas/
msgid "Captchas"
msgstr "CAPTCHA-test"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/contents.lr:section.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/
msgid "Troubleshooting Tor Browser"
msgstr "Felsöka Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/contents.lr:section.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/
msgid "Encountering issues"
msgstr "Problem som kan uppstå"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid ""
"The `torrc` file contains Tor’s configuration options. Most users should not "
"edit it, since unsafe changes can compromise your privacy and security."
msgstr ""
"Filen `torrc` innehåller Tors konfigurationsalternativ. De flesta användare "
"bör inte redigera den eftersom osäkra ändringar kan äventyra integriteten "
"och säkerheten."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid "I'm supposed to \"edit my torrc\". What does that mean?"
msgstr "Jag uppmanas att ”redigera min torrc”. Vad betyder det?"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid "Editing the torrc file"
msgstr "Redigera torrc-filen"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid "1. Click on the **Go** menu."
msgstr "1. Klicka på menyn **Gå**."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid "2. Select **Go to Folder…**."
msgstr "2. Välj **Gå till mapp…**."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid "3. Enter: `~/Library/Application Support/`"
msgstr "3. Ange: `~/Library/Application Support/`"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid "Close Tor Browser before editing."
msgstr "Stäng Tor Browser före redigeringen."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid "Close Tor Browser before making any edits."
msgstr "Stäng Tor Browser innan du gör några ändringar."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid ""
"For other configuration options you can use, see the [Tor manual page]"
"(https://2019.www.torproject.org/docs/tor-manual.html.en)."
msgstr ""
"Andra konfigurationsalternativ finns på [Tors manualsida](https://"
"2019.www.torproject.org/docs/tor-manual.html.en)."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid ""
"Have a look at the [sample `torrc`](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/core/"
"tor/-/blob/HEAD/src/config/torrc.sample.in) file for hints on common "
"configurations."
msgstr ""
"Se [exempelfilen `torrc`](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/core/tor/-/blob/"
"HEAD/src/config/torrc.sample.in) för tips om vanliga konfigurationer."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid ""
"Make sure to **close Tor Browser** before editing the file, or your changes "
"may be overwritten."
msgstr ""
"Se till att **stänga Tor Browser** innan du redigerar filen, annars kan "
"ändringarna skrivas över."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid ""
"Malicious or incorrect configurations can weaken your security and anonymity."
msgstr ""
"Skadliga eller felaktiga konfigurationer kan försvaga säkerheten och "
"anonymiteten."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid ""
"Many options won't work because Tor Browser overrides them with command-line "
"settings."
msgstr ""
"Många alternativ fungerar inte eftersom Tor Browser åsidosätter dem med "
"kommandoradsinställningar."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid ""
"On **Linux**, the `torrc` file is located here: `Browser/TorBrowser/Data/Tor/"
"torrc`."
msgstr ""
"I **Linux** finns filen `torrc` här: `Browser/TorBrowser/Data/Tor/torrc`."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid ""
"On **Windows**, the `torrc` file is located here: "
"`Browser\\TorBrowser\\Data\\Tor\\torrc`."
msgstr ""
"I **Windows** finns filen `torrc` här: "
"`Browser\\TorBrowser\\Data\\Tor\\torrc`."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid ""
"On **macOS**, the `torrc` file is found here: `~/Library/Application Support/"
"TorBrowser-Data/Tor/torrc`"
msgstr ""
"I **macOS** finns filen `torrc` här: `~/Library/Application Support/"
"TorBrowser-Data/Tor/torrc`"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid ""
"Remember, all lines beginning with `#` in torrc are treated as comments and "
"have no effect on Tor's configuration."
msgstr ""
"Kom ihåg att alla rader som börjar med `#` i torrc behandlas som kommentarer "
"och inte påverkar Tors konfiguration."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid ""
"The default `torrc` provided with Tor Browser is safe and should work for "
"most users."
msgstr ""
"Den förvalda `torrc` som följer med Tor Browser är säker och bör fungera för "
"de flesta användare."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid "To navigate there in Finder:"
msgstr "Så navigerar du dit i Finder:"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser applies its own safe defaults, so most `torrc` edits will either "
"have **no effect** or **reduce your safety**."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser använder egna säkra standardvärden, så de flesta ändringar i "
"`torrc` har antingen **ingen effekt** eller **försämrar säkerheten**."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid ""
"`torrc` is a plain-text configuration file that tells Tor how to behave."
msgstr ""
"`torrc` är en konfigurationsfil i klartext som styr hur Tor ska fungera."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid ""
"⚠️ **Warning:** Do not follow random advice telling you to edit your `torrc`."
msgstr ""
"⚠️ **Varning:** Följ inte godtyckliga råd som säger att du ska redigera "
"`torrc`."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
msgid "📌 Note: The `Library` folder is hidden on newer macOS versions."
msgstr "📌 Obs! Mappen `Library` är dold i nyare versioner av macOS."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/contents.lr:tab.title
#: content/tor-browser/general/contents.lr:section.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/editing-torrc/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/
msgid "General"
msgstr "Allmänt"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/
msgid ""
"This is usually a false alarm caused by Tor's exit relays, but you should "
"still take steps to secure your account."
msgstr ""
"Det är vanligen ett falsklarm som orsakas av Tors utgångsreläer, men du bör "
"ändå vidta åtgärder för att skydda kontot."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/
msgid ""
"When you log into Gmail with Tor Browser, Google may warn you that your "
"account was accessed from unusual locations."
msgstr ""
"När du loggar in på Gmail med Tor Browser kan Google varna för att kontot "
"har använts från ovanliga platser."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/
msgid "Gmail warns me that my account may have been compromised"
msgstr "Gmail varnar för att mitt konto kan ha utsatts för intrång"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/
msgid "Gmail account warning"
msgstr "Varning om Gmail-konto"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/
msgid ""
"And if somebody did steal your Google cookie, they might end up logging in "
"from unusual places (though of course they also might not). So the summary "
"is that since you're using Tor Browser, this security measure that Google "
"uses isn't so useful for you, because it's full of false positives. You'll "
"have to use other approaches, like seeing if anything looks weird on the "
"account, or looking at the timestamps for recent logins and wondering if you "
"actually logged in at those times."
msgstr ""
"Om någon har stulit din Google-kaka kan personen dessutom logga in från "
"ovanliga platser, även om det inte är säkert att det sker. Eftersom du "
"använder Tor Browser är Googles säkerhetsåtgärd mindre användbar för dig på "
"grund av alla falska positiva resultat. Du behöver använda andra metoder, "
"exempelvis kontrollera om något ser märkligt ut på kontot eller jämföra "
"tidsstämplarna för de senaste inloggningarna med när du själv loggade in."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/
msgid ""
"Cookie hijacking is possible by either physical access to your computer or "
"by watching your network traffic."
msgstr ""
"Kakkapning kan ske genom fysisk åtkomst till datorn eller genom avlyssning "
"av nätverkstrafiken."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/
msgid ""
"Even though this may be a byproduct of using the service via Tor, that "
"doesn't mean you can entirely ignore the warning."
msgstr ""
"Även om varningen kan bero på att tjänsten används via Tor bör du inte "
"ignorera den helt."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/
msgid ""
"In general, this is a false alarm: Google saw a bunch of logins from "
"different places, as a result of running the service via Tor, and decided it "
"was a good idea to confirm the account was being accessed by its rightful "
"owner."
msgstr ""
"I allmänhet är det ett falsklarm: Google såg många inloggningar från olika "
"platser eftersom tjänsten användes via Tor och ville därför bekräfta att den "
"rättmätiga ägaren använde kontot."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/
msgid ""
"In practice, alas, it's [way more complex than that](https://web.archive.org/"
"web/20200404010719/https://fscked.org/blog/fully-automated-active-https-"
"cookie-hijacking)."
msgstr ""
"I praktiken är det tyvärr [mycket mer komplicerat än så](https://"
"web.archive.org/web/20200404010719/https://fscked.org/blog/fully-automated-"
"active-https-cookie-hijacking)."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/
msgid ""
"In theory, only physical access should compromise your system because Gmail "
"and similar services should only send the cookie over an SSL link."
msgstr ""
"I teorin borde bara fysisk åtkomst kunna äventyra systemet, eftersom Gmail "
"och liknande tjänster endast ska skicka kakan via en SSL-anslutning."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/
msgid ""
"It is probably a false positive, but it might not be since it is possible "
"for someone to hijack your Google cookie."
msgstr ""
"Det är förmodligen ett falskt positivt resultat, men behöver inte vara det "
"eftersom någon kan kapa din Google-kaka."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/
msgid ""
"More recently, Gmail users can turn on [2-Step Verification](https://"
"support.google.com/accounts/answer/185839) on their accounts to add an extra "
"layer of security."
msgstr ""
"Gmail-användare kan numera aktivera [tvåstegsverifiering](https://"
"support.google.com/accounts/answer/185839) för ett extra säkerhetslager."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/
msgid ""
"Sometimes, after you've used Gmail over Tor, Google presents a pop-up "
"notification that your account may have been compromised."
msgstr ""
"När du har använt Gmail via Tor visar Google ibland ett popupmeddelande om "
"att kontot kan ha utsatts för intrång."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/
msgid ""
"The notification window lists a series of IP addresses and locations "
"throughout the world recently used to access your account."
msgstr ""
"Meddelandefönstret visar en rad IP-adresser och platser runt om i världen "
"som nyligen har använts för att komma åt kontot."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/gmail-account-warning/
msgid "Gmail"
msgstr "Gmail"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid "These are common issues that can prevent Tor Browser from working."
msgstr ""
"Det här är vanliga problem som kan hindra Tor Browser från att fungera."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid "Known issues and limitations in Tor Browser"
msgstr "Kända problem och begränsningar i Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Known issues"
msgstr "Kända problem"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"'New Identity' feature is not available on Tor Browser for Android. [#28800]"
"(https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/applications/tor-browser/-/work_items/"
"28800)"
msgstr ""
"Funktionen \"Ny identitet\" är inte tillgänglig i Tor Browser för Android. "
"[#28800](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/applications/tor-browser/-/"
"work_items/28800)"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"'[Onion-Location](../../../glossary/#onion-location)' feature is not "
"available on Tor Browser for Android. [#151](https://gitlab.torproject.org/"
"tpo/ux/design/-/work_items/151)"
msgstr ""
"Funktionen [Onion-Location](../../../glossary/#onion-location) finns inte i "
"Tor Browser för Android. [#151](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/ux/"
"design/-/work_items/151)"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid "A reboot of your system, in that case, will solve the issue."
msgstr "En omstart av systemet löser i så fall problemet."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"Antivirus or malware protection blocking users from accessing Tor Browser."
msgstr ""
"Antivirus- eller skadlig kod som blockerar användares åtkomst till Tor "
"Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"At the moment, there are some features which are not available in Tor "
"Browser for Android, but are currently available in Tor Browser for desktop."
msgstr ""
"För närvarande finns det vissa funktioner som inte är tillgängliga i Tor "
"Browser för Android, men som för närvarande är tillgängliga i Tor Browser "
"för skrivbordet."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid "Avast Antivirus"
msgstr "Avast Antivirus"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"BitTorrent [is not anonymous over Tor](https://blog.torproject.org/"
"bittorrent-over-tor-isnt-good-idea)."
msgstr ""
"BitTorrent [är inte anonym över Tor](https://blog.torproject.org/bittorrent-"
"over-tor-isnt-good-idea)."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"Check the [Tor Browser issue tracker](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/"
"applications/tor-browser/-/work_items/)."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollera [Tor Browsers ärendehanterare](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/"
"applications/tor-browser/-/work_items/)."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid "Flash is disabled for security reasons."
msgstr "Flash är inaktiverat av säkerhetsskäl."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"If Tor Browser was working before and is not working now (especially after a "
"re-install or an update), your system may have been hibernating."
msgstr ""
"Om Tor Browser fungerade tidigare och inte fungerar nu (särskilt efter en "
"ominstallation eller en uppdatering) kan ditt system ha gått i viloläge."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"If it hasn't been reported, please open a [GitLab issue](https://"
"anonticket.torproject.org) describing what you're experiencing."
msgstr ""
"Om problemet inte har rapporterats öppnar du ett [GitLab-ärende](https://"
"anonticket.torproject.org) och beskriver vad du upplever."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"If you started experiencing problems after an update, check "
"[blog.torproject.org](https://blog.torproject.org) for the post about the "
"latest stable release."
msgstr ""
"Om problemen började efter en uppdatering kontrollerar du inlägget om den "
"senaste stabila utgåvan på [blog.torproject.org](https://"
"blog.torproject.org)."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid "If your issue isn't listed there:"
msgstr "Om problemet inte finns med där:"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"Images uploaded on Tor Browser (Desktop and Android) are [randomized]"
"(https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/applications/tor-browser/-/work_items/"
"40558)."
msgstr ""
"Bilder som laddats upp till Tor Browser (skrivbord och Android) är "
"[slumpmässigt sorterade](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/applications/tor-"
"browser/-/work_items/40558)."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid "Issues in the latest stable release"
msgstr "Problem i den senaste stabila utgåvan"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid "Issues with making Tor Browser your default browser."
msgstr "Problem med att göra Tor Browser till standardwebbläsare."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"On many platforms this may not work as expected and can cause errors or "
"unexpected behavior."
msgstr ""
"På många plattformar fungerar detta kanske inte som förväntat och kan orsaka "
"fel eller oväntat beteende."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"Running multiple instances of Tor Browser at the same time is not "
"recommended."
msgstr ""
"Det rekommenderas inte att köra flera instanser av Tor Browser samtidigt."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"Sometimes these also pop up with [false positives regarding malware and/or "
"vulnerabilities](../antivirus/)."
msgstr ""
"Ibland visas även [falska positiva varningar om skadeprogram och/eller "
"sårbarheter](../antivirus/)."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"The following antivirus and firewall software have been known to interfere "
"with Tor and may need to be temporarily disabled:"
msgstr ""
"Följande antivirus- och brandväggsprogram har varit kända för att störa Tor "
"och kan behöva inaktiveras tillfälligt:"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"There are methods for setting Tor Browser as your default browser, but those "
"methods may not work always or in every operating system."
msgstr ""
"Det finns metoder för att ange Tor Browser som standardwebbläsare, men de "
"fungerar inte alltid eller i alla operativsystem."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"This means sometimes a website would load in Tor Browser, and sometimes it "
"would load in another browser. This type of behavior can be dangerous and "
"break anonymity."
msgstr ""
"Det innebär att en webbplats ibland öppnas i Tor Browser och ibland i en "
"annan webbläsare. Ett sådant beteende kan vara farligt och bryta "
"anonymiteten."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser for Android does not connect when moved to the SD Card. [#31814]"
"(https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/applications/tor-browser/-/work_items/"
"31814)"
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser för Android ansluter inte när den flyttas till SD-kortet. "
"[#31814](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/applications/tor-browser/-/"
"work_items/31814)"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser works hard to isolate itself from the rest of your system, and "
"the steps for making it the default browser are unreliable."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser arbetar aktivt för att isolera sig från resten av systemet, och "
"metoderna för att göra den till standardwebbläsare är otillförlitliga."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid "Tor can not use a bridge if a proxy is set."
msgstr "Tor kan inte använda en bro om en proxy används."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"Tor needs your system clock (and your time zone) set to the correct time."
msgstr "Tor behöver din systemklocka (och din tidszon) inställd på rätt tid."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"Tor won't start on Windows when the [folder path contains non-ascii "
"characters](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/core/tor/-/work_items/10416)."
msgstr ""
"Tor startar inte i Windows när [mappsökvägen innehåller tecken som inte är "
"ASCII](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/core/tor/-/work_items/10416)."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid "VPNs also tend to interfere with Tor and need to be disabled."
msgstr "VPN-tjänster tenderar också att störa Tor och måste inaktiveras."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid "Videos that require Adobe Flash are unavailable."
msgstr "Videor som kräver Adobe Flash är inte tillgängliga."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"We also do not recommend using VPN and Tor together unless you're an "
"advanced user who knows how to configure both in a way that doesn't "
"compromise your privacy."
msgstr ""
"Vi rekommenderar inte heller att använda VPN och Tor tillsammans om du inte "
"är en avancerad användare som vet hur man konfigurerar båda på ett sätt som "
"inte äventyrar din integritet."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"Whenever we release a new stable version of Tor Browser, we publish a blog "
"post that details new features and known issues."
msgstr ""
"Varje gång vi ger ut en ny stabil version av Tor Browser publicerar vi ett "
"blogginlägg med nya funktioner och kända problem."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"You can find more detailed information about Tor + VPN at our [wiki](https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/legacy/trac/-/wikis/doc/TorPlusVPN)."
msgstr ""
"Du hittar mer detaljerad information om Tor + VPN på vår [wiki](https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/legacy/trac/-/wikis/doc/TorPlusVPN)."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"You can't open onion addresses that requires Client Authorization [#201]"
"(https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/ux/design/-/work_items/201)"
msgstr ""
"Du kan inte öppna onion-adresser som kräver klientauktorisering [#201]"
"(https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/ux/design/-/work_items/201)"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"You can't see your Tor circuit. [#200](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/ux/"
"design/-/work_items/200)"
msgstr ""
"Du kan inte se din Tor-krets. [#200](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/ux/"
"design/-/work_items/200)"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/known-issues/
msgid ""
"[Web Authentication](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/applications/tor-"
"browser/-/work_items/26614) (WebAuthn) and [Universal 2nd Factor](https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/applications/tor-browser/-/work_items/34193) (U2F) "
"(i.e. YubiKey) support is disabled in Tor Browser."
msgstr ""
"Stöd för [Webbautentisering](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/applications/"
"tor-browser/-/work_items/26614) (WebAuthn) och [Universal 2nd Factor]"
"(https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/applications/tor-browser/-/work_items/"
"34193) (U2F) (dvs. YubiKey) är inaktiverat i Tor Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/
msgid ""
"This article lists common causes and steps you can take to resolve the issue "
"before contacting Tor support."
msgstr ""
"Den här artikeln beskriver vanliga orsaker och åtgärder du kan prova innan "
"du kontaktar Tors support."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/
msgid ""
"This error can appear for several reasons, from antivirus interference to "
"incorrect ports or a corrupted installation."
msgstr ""
"Felet kan uppstå av flera orsaker, från störningar från antivirusprogram och "
"felaktiga portar till en skadad installation."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/
msgid ""
"How to fix the \"Proxy Server Is Refusing Connection\" error in Tor Browser"
msgstr "Så åtgärdar du felet ”Proxyservern nekar anslutningen” i Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/
msgid "\"Proxy server is refusing connection\" error"
msgstr "Felet ”Proxyservern nekar anslutningen”"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/
msgid ""
"If the error persists, please [get in touch](../../../get-in-touch/bug-or-"
"feedback/) with us."
msgstr ""
"Om felet kvarstår kan du [kontakta oss](../../../get-in-touch/bug-or-"
"feedback/)."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/
msgid "If you did this, revert the change."
msgstr "Återställ ändringen om du har gjort den."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/
msgid ""
"If you have an antivirus, it may be interfering with the Tor service. "
"Disable the antivirus and restart the browser."
msgstr ""
"Ett antivirusprogram kan störa Tor-tjänsten. Inaktivera antivirusprogrammet "
"och starta om webbläsaren."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/
msgid "Proxy server errors can occur for a variety of reasons."
msgstr "Fel med proxyservern kan ha många olika orsaker."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/
msgid ""
"When all else fails, reinstall the browser. This time, make sure to install "
"Tor Browser in a new directory, not over a previously installed browser."
msgstr ""
"Om inget annat fungerar installerar du om webbläsaren. Installera då Tor "
"Browser i en ny mapp och inte ovanpå en tidigare installation."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/
msgid ""
"You may try one or more of the following activities in case you encounter "
"this error:"
msgstr "Prova en eller flera av följande åtgärder om felet uppstår:"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/
msgid ""
"You should also check the port that you are connecting with. Try a different "
"port from the one currently in use, such as 9050 or 9150."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollera även vilken port du ansluter genom. Prova en annan port än den "
"som används, exempelvis 9050 eller 9150."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/
msgid ""
"You should not move the Tor Browser folder from its original location to a "
"different location."
msgstr "Flytta inte Tor Browser-mappen från den ursprungliga platsen."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/proxy-errors/
msgid "Proxy server error"
msgstr "Fel med proxyservern"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid ""
"This article explains common log errors and how to fix them, such as "
"adjusting proxy settings, correcting your system clock, or using bridges on "
"censored networks."
msgstr ""
"Artikeln förklarar vanliga loggfel och hur de åtgärdas, exempelvis genom att "
"ändra proxyinställningar, rätta systemklockan eller använda broar i "
"censurerade nätverk."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid "Tor logs can help diagnose connection problems."
msgstr "Tor-loggar kan hjälpa till att diagnostisera anslutningsproblem."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid "How to read and troubleshoot common Tor log errors"
msgstr "Så läser och felsöker du vanliga fel i Tor-loggar"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid "Reading Tor log errors"
msgstr "Läsa fel i Tor-loggar"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid ""
"Alternatively, if your Tor log shows lines like these, it may also indicate "
"a failure to connect to a SOCKS proxy."
msgstr ""
"Om Tor-loggen i stället visar rader som dessa kan det också tyda på att "
"anslutningen till en SOCKS-proxy misslyckades."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid "Common log error #1: Proxy connection failure"
msgstr "Vanligt loggfel 1: Proxyanslutningen misslyckades"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid "Common log error #2: Can't reach guard relays"
msgstr "Vanligt loggfel 2: Vaktreläerna kan inte nås"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid "Common log error #3: Failed to complete TLS handshake"
msgstr "Vanligt loggfel 3: TLS-handskakningen kunde inte slutföras"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid "Common log error #4: Clock skew"
msgstr "Vanligt loggfel 4: Felaktig systemtid"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid ""
"If a SOCKS proxy is not required, or you're not sure, please try connecting "
"to the Tor network without a SOCKS proxy."
msgstr ""
"Om en SOCKS-proxy inte krävs, eller om du är osäker, försöker du ansluta "
"till Tor-nätverket utan SOCKS-proxy."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid ""
"If a SOCKS proxy is required for your network setup, then please make sure "
"you've entered your proxy details correctly."
msgstr ""
"Om nätverkskonfigurationen kräver en SOCKS-proxy kontrollerar du att "
"proxyuppgifterna är korrekt angivna."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid ""
"If you see lines like these in your Tor log, it means your Tor failed to "
"connect to the first node in the Tor circuit."
msgstr ""
"Om Tor-loggen innehåller rader som dessa kunde Tor inte ansluta till den "
"första noden i Tor-kretsen."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid ""
"If you see lines like this in your Tor log, it means that Tor failed to "
"complete a TLS handshake with the directory authorities."
msgstr ""
"Om Tor-loggen innehåller rader som denna kunde Tor inte slutföra TLS-"
"handskakningen med katalogauktoriteterna."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid ""
"If you see lines like this in your Tor log, it means your system clock is "
"incorrect."
msgstr "Om Tor-loggen innehåller rader som denna är systemklockan felaktig."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"If you're having trouble connecting, an error message may appear and you can "
"select the option to \"copy Tor log to clipboard\"."
msgstr ""
"Om du har problem med att ansluta kan ett felmeddelande visas och du kan "
"välja alternativet att ”Kopiera Tor-logg till urklipp”."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid ""
"In some cases, the Tor bridge you are using may be offline or blocked by a "
"censor, which can also trigger this error."
msgstr ""
"I vissa fall kan Tor-bron som används vara frånkopplad eller blockerad av en "
"censuraktör, vilket också kan utlösa felet."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid ""
"Please make sure your clock is set accurately, including the correct "
"timezone. Then restart Tor."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollera att klockan och tidszonen är korrekt inställda. Starta sedan om "
"Tor."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid "Please try connecting with bridges, and that should fix the problem."
msgstr "Prova att ansluta med broar. Det bör lösa problemet."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid ""
"Request new bridges and update your configuration if the issue persists."
msgstr "Begär nya broar och uppdatera konfigurationen om problemet kvarstår."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Then paste the Tor log into a text file or other document."
msgstr "Klistra sedan in Tor-loggen i en textfil eller annat dokument."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid "This could mean that you're on a network that's censored."
msgstr "Det kan innebära att nätverket censureras."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid "Using bridges will likely fix this."
msgstr "Broar löser sannolikt problemet."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/reading-tor-logs/
msgid "Tor logs"
msgstr "Tor-loggar"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/
msgid ""
"If an onion site won't load, first double-check the 56-character address - "
"even a single typo will prevent Tor Browser from connecting."
msgstr ""
"Om en onion-webbplats inte läses in kontrollerar du först den 56 tecken "
"långa adressen noggrant. Ett enda skrivfel hindrar Tor Browser från att "
"ansluta."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/
msgid ""
"Sometimes onion services go offline temporarily or permanently, so trying "
"again later or testing another known onion site can help you determine if "
"the problem is on your end."
msgstr ""
"Onion-tjänster kan ibland vara tillfälligt eller permanent frånkopplade. "
"Försök senare eller testa en annan känd onion-webbplats för att avgöra om "
"problemet finns hos dig."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/
msgid "What to do if you can't reach an onion site"
msgstr "Det här gör du om en onion-webbplats inte går att nå"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/
msgid "Problem reaching an onion site"
msgstr "Problem med att nå en onion-webbplats"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/
msgid ""
"If the address you have is shorter than 56 characters, it belongs to the "
"older v2 onion format, which is no longer supported by the Tor network and "
"the site is effectively gone."
msgstr ""
"Om adressen är kortare än 56 tecken tillhör den det äldre onion-formatet v2, "
"som Tor-nätverket inte längre stöder. Webbplatsen är i praktiken borta."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/
msgid ""
"If you are still unable to connect to the onion service, please try again "
"later."
msgstr ""
"Försök igen senare om du fortfarande inte kan ansluta till onion-tjänsten."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/
msgid ""
"If you cannot reach the onion service you desire, make sure that you have "
"entered the 56-character onion address correctly; even a small mistake will "
"stop Tor Browser from being able to reach the site."
msgstr ""
"Om den önskade onion-tjänsten inte går att nå kontrollerar du att den 56 "
"tecken långa onion-adressen har skrivits korrekt. Även ett litet fel hindrar "
"Tor Browser från att nå webbplatsen."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/
msgid ""
"There may be a temporary connection issue, or the site operators may have "
"allowed it to go offline without warning."
msgstr ""
"Det kan vara ett tillfälligt anslutningsproblem, eller så kan webbplatsens "
"operatörer ha låtit tjänsten gå ned utan förvarning."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/
msgid ""
"You can also ensure that you're able to access other onion services by "
"connecting to [DuckDuckGo's onion service](https://"
"duckduckgogg42xjoc72x3sjasowoarfbgcmvfimaftt6twagswzczad.onion/) or [Tor "
"Project's onion service](http://"
"2gzyxa5ihm7nsggfxnu52rck2vv4rvmdlkiu3zzui5du4xyclen53wid.onion)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan kontrollera att andra onion-tjänster går att nå genom att ansluta "
"till [DuckDuckGos onion-tjänst](https://"
"duckduckgogg42xjoc72x3sjasowoarfbgcmvfimaftt6twagswzczad.onion/) eller [Tor-"
"projektets onion-tjänst](http://"
"2gzyxa5ihm7nsggfxnu52rck2vv4rvmdlkiu3zzui5du4xyclen53wid.onion)."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"It is important to know what version of Tor Browser you have installed and "
"to fetch the Tor Logs in order to troubleshoot a problem with the browser."
msgstr ""
"För att felsöka problem med webbläsaren är det viktigt att känna till "
"installerad version av Tor Browser och hämta Tor-loggarna."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"These are important information to share when raising a [support](../../../"
"get-in-touch/user-support/) ticket or filing a [bug report](../../../get-in-"
"touch/bug-or-feedback/)."
msgstr ""
"Det här är viktig information att dela när du skapar ett [supportärende]"
"(../../../get-in-touch/user-support/) eller en [felrapport](../../../get-in-"
"touch/bug-or-feedback/)."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Troubleshooting connection and usage issues in Tor Browser"
msgstr "Felsöka anslutnings- och användningsproblem i Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "A reboot of your system will solve the issue."
msgstr "En omstart av ditt system kommer lösa problemet."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"Alternatively, on GNU/Linux, to view the logs right in the terminal, "
"navigate to the Tor Browser directory and launch Tor Browser from the "
"command line by running:"
msgstr ""
"Alternativt, på GNU/Linux, för att visa loggarna direkt i terminalen, "
"navigera till Tor Browser-katalogen och starta Tor Browser från "
"kommandoraden genom att köra:"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Check browser version"
msgstr "Kontrollera webbläsarversionen"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Check your Internet Connection if it says 'Offline'."
msgstr "Kontrollera din internetanslutning om det står \"Offline\"."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Delete Tor Browser and install it again."
msgstr "Ta bort Tor Browser och installera det igen."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Find 'Tor Browser' from the list of apps."
msgstr "Hitta 'Tor Browser' i listan över appar."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "From Android menu:"
msgstr "Från Android-menyn:"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "From the app:"
msgstr "Från appen:"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "If Tor Browser doesn't connect, there may be a simple solution."
msgstr "Om Tor Browser inte ansluter kan det finnas en enkel lösning."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"If Tor Browser was working before and is not working now your system may "
"have been hibernating."
msgstr ""
"Om Tor Browser fungerade tidigare och inte fungerar nu kan ditt system ha "
"varit i viloläge."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"If updating, do not just overwrite your previous Tor Browser files; ensure "
"they are fully deleted beforehand."
msgstr ""
"Om du uppdaterar, skriv inte bara över dina tidigare Tor Browser-filer; se "
"till att de är helt raderade i förväg."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"If you don't see this option and you have Tor Browser open, you can navigate "
"to the hamburger menu (\"≡\"), then click on \"Settings\", and finally on "
"\"Connection\" in the side bar."
msgstr ""
"Om du inte ser det här alternativet och du har Tor Browser öppen kan du "
"navigera till hamburgermenyn (\"≡\"), sedan klicka på \"Inställningar\" och "
"slutligen på \"Anslutning\" i sidofältet."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"If you still can't connect, your Internet Service Provider might be "
"censoring connections to the Tor network."
msgstr ""
"Om du fortfarande inte kan ansluta kan din internetleverantör censurera "
"anslutningar till Tor-nätverket."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "If you're not sure if Tor Browser is running, restart your computer."
msgstr "Om du inte är säker på om Tor Browser körs, starta om din dator."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"If your connection to the Tor Network is not established and it reads 'Not "
"Connected' the following steps can be helpful."
msgstr ""
"Om din anslutning till Tor-nätverket inte är upprättad och det står \"Inte "
"ansluten\" kan följande steg vara till hjälp."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"In most cases, taking a look at the Tor logs can be helpful in diagnosing "
"the issue."
msgstr ""
"I de flesta fall kan en titt på Tor-loggarna vara till hjälp för att "
"diagnostisera problemet."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Is your connection censored?"
msgstr "Är anslutningen censurerad?"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"It is often important to know what version of Tor Browser you are using, to "
"help you troubleshoot a problem or just to know if Tor Browser is up to date."
msgstr ""
"Det är ofta viktigt att veta vilken version av Tor Browser du använder, både "
"för felsökning och för att kontrollera om programmet är uppdaterat."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"Make sure another Tor Browser or instance of 'Tor' is not already running on "
"your system."
msgstr ""
"Se till att en annan Tor Browser eller instans av 'Tor' inte redan körs på "
"ditt system."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"Make sure that any antivirus program you have installed is not preventing "
"Tor from running."
msgstr ""
"Se till att eventuella antivirusprogram du har installerat inte hindrar Tor "
"från att köras."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Navigate to Android's Settings."
msgstr "Gå till Androids inställningar."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Navigate to the \"Connection\" section of the Settings."
msgstr "Gå till avsnittet \"Anslutning\" i inställningarna."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Or to save the logs to a file (default: tor-browser.log):"
msgstr "Eller för att spara loggar till en fil (standard: tor-browser.log):"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"Please check the [Known Issues](../known-issues) page to see if the problem "
"you are experiencing is already listed there."
msgstr ""
"Kolla in sidan [Known Issues](../known-issues) för att se om problemet du "
"upplever redan finns med där."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"Please refer to '[Reading Tor log errors](../reading-tor-logs/)' in order to "
"troubleshoot common errors from the Tor logs."
msgstr ""
"Se [Läsa fel i Tor-loggar](../reading-tor-logs/) för att felsöka vanliga fel "
"i Tor-loggarna."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Quick fixes"
msgstr "Snabba lösningar"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"Read the [Circumvention](../../circumvention) section for possible solutions."
msgstr ""
"Läs avsnittet [Kringgå censur](../../circumvention) för möjliga lösningar."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"Scroll down to the \"Tor Browser Updates\" section where the version number "
"is listed."
msgstr ""
"Rulla ned till avsnittet ”Tor Browser-uppdateringar”, där versionsnumret "
"visas."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"Scroll down to the very bottom of the page where the version number will be "
"listed."
msgstr "Scrolla ner till botten av sidan där versionsnumret listas."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Scroll to the bottom of the page."
msgstr "Scrolla ner till sidans botten."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Tap on \"Tor Logs\"."
msgstr "Tryck på \"Tor-loggar\"."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Tap on 'About Tor Browser'."
msgstr "Tryck på \"Om Tor Browser\"."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Tap on 'Apps' to open the list of apps installed on your device."
msgstr ""
"Tryck på \"Appar\" för att öppna listan över appar som är installerade på "
"din enhet."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Tap on 'Tor Browser'."
msgstr "Tryck på \"Tor Browser\"."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"Tap on the settings icon or \"Configure connection\" when on the \"Connect "
"to Tor\" screen."
msgstr ""
"Tryck på inställningsikonen eller \"Konfigurera anslutning\" när du är på "
"skärmen \"Anslut till Tor\"."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Temporarily disable your firewall."
msgstr "Inaktivera din brandvägg tillfälligt."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"The Connection Assist informs you about the state of your Internet "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"Anslutningshjälpen informerar dig om statusen för din internetanslutning."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "The version number should be listed on this page."
msgstr "Versionsnumret ska anges på den här sidan."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "This is important information to share when raising a support ticket."
msgstr "Det är viktig information att dela när du skapar ett supportärende."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"To copy the Tor logs to the clipboard, tap on the \"Copy\" button at the "
"bottom of the screen."
msgstr ""
"För att kopiera Tor-loggarna till urklipp, tryck på knappen \"Kopiera\" "
"längst ner på skärmen."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser is under constant development, and some issues are known about "
"but not yet fixed."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser är under ständig utveckling, och vissa problem är kända men ännu "
"inte åtgärdade."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Try each of the following:"
msgstr "Prova vart och ett av följande:"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "View Tor Logs"
msgstr "Visa Tor-loggar"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "View Tor logs"
msgstr "Visa Tor-loggar"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "When you have Tor Browser for Android running, tap on 'Settings'."
msgstr ""
"När du har Tor Browser för Android igång trycker du på \"Inställningar\"."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"When you have Tor Browser running, click on \"Settings\" in the hamburger "
"menu (≡)."
msgstr ""
"När Tor Browser körs klickar du på ”Inställningar” i hamburgermenyn (≡)."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"You may need to consult the documentation for your antivirus software if you "
"do not know how to do this."
msgstr ""
"Du kan behöva läsa dokumentationen för ditt antivirusprogram om du inte vet "
"hur man gör detta."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"You should be able to start browsing the web using Tor Browser shortly after "
"running the program, and clicking the \"Connect\" button if you are using it "
"for the first time."
msgstr ""
"Du bör kunna börja surfa på webben med Tor Browser strax efter att ha kört "
"programmet och klicka på knappen \"Anslut\" om du använder den för första "
"gången."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"Your computer's system clock must be set correctly, or Tor will not be able "
"to connect."
msgstr ""
"Din dators systemklocka måste vara korrekt inställd, annars kommer Tor inte "
"att kunna ansluta."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:figure.text
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Click 'Connect' to connect to Tor"
msgstr "Klicka på ”Anslut” för att ansluta till Tor"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Connection Assist Test"
msgstr "Test av anslutningshjälpen"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Connection Assist offline error"
msgstr "Anslutningshjälpens fel för frånkopplat läge"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "View Tor logs on Tor Browser for Android"
msgstr "Visa Tor-loggar i Tor Browser för Android"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/website-lockout/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/website-lockout/
msgid ""
"Some websites interpret Tor connections as suspicious logins and may lock "
"accounts. Recovery usually requires following the site’s procedure, but "
"enabling two-factor authentication can help reduce future lockouts."
msgstr ""
"Vissa webbplatser tolkar Tor-anslutningar som misstänkta inloggningar och "
"kan låsa konton. Återställning kräver vanligtvis att du följer webbplatsens "
"procedur, men tvåfaktorsautentisering kan minska framtida utlåsningar."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/website-lockout/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/website-lockout/
msgid ""
"A website (bank, email provider, etc.) locks me out whenever I use Tor. What "
"can I do?"
msgstr ""
"En webbplats, exempelvis en bank eller e-postleverantör, låser mig ute när "
"jag använder Tor. Vad kan jag göra?"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/website-lockout/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/website-lockout/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/website-lockout/
msgid "Website account lockouts"
msgstr "Utlåsning från webbplatskonton"

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/website-lockout/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/website-lockout/
msgid "Contact your provider and ask them if they provide 2FA."
msgstr ""
"Kontakta leverantören och fråga om den erbjuder tvåfaktorsautentisering."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/website-lockout/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/website-lockout/
msgid ""
"Some websites, such as banks or email providers, might interpret this as a "
"sign that your account has been compromised, and lock you out."
msgstr ""
"Vissa webbplatser, exempelvis banker och e-postleverantörer, kan tolka detta "
"som att kontot har utsatts för intrång och låsa dig ute."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/website-lockout/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/website-lockout/
msgid ""
"The only way to resolve this is by following the site's recommended "
"procedure for account recovery, or contacting the operators and explaining "
"the situation."
msgstr ""
"Det enda sättet att lösa problemet är att följa webbplatsens rekommenderade "
"kontoåterställning eller kontakta operatörerna och förklara situationen."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/website-lockout/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/website-lockout/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser often makes your connection appear as though it is coming from "
"an entirely different part of the world."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser får ofta anslutningen att se ut att komma från en helt annan del "
"av världen."

#: content/tor-browser/encountering-issues/website-lockout/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/encountering-issues/website-lockout/
msgid ""
"You may be able to avoid this scenario if your provider offers 2-factor "
"authentication, which is a much better security option than IP-based "
"reputations."
msgstr ""
"Du kan kanske undvika detta om leverantören erbjuder "
"tvåfaktorsautentisering, vilket är betydligt säkrare än anseende baserat på "
"IP-adresser."

#: content/tor-browser/features/contents.lr:section.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/
msgid "Explore Tor Browser private browsing."
msgstr "Utforska privat surfning i Tor Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/features/contents.lr:section.title
#: content/tor-vpn/features/contents.lr:section.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/
msgid "Features"
msgstr "Funktioner"

#: content/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser uses DuckDuckGo as its default search engine because it does not "
"log or share personal information, making it better aligned with Tor's "
"privacy goals."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser använder DuckDuckGo som standardsökmotor eftersom tjänsten "
"varken loggar eller delar personuppgifter och därför bättre överensstämmer "
"med Tors integritetsmål."

#: content/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/
msgid "Why is DuckDuckGo the default search engine in Tor Browser?"
msgstr "Varför är DuckDuckGo standardsökmotor i Tor Browser?"

#: content/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/
msgid "Default search engine"
msgstr "Standardsökmotor"

#: content/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/
msgid ""
"DuckDuckGo also operates an [onion service](https://"
"duckduckgogg42xjoc72x3sjasowoarfbgcmvfimaftt6twagswzczad.onion/) for private "
"search over Tor."
msgstr ""
"DuckDuckGo driver även en [onion-tjänst](https://"
"duckduckgogg42xjoc72x3sjasowoarfbgcmvfimaftt6twagswzczad.onion/) för privata "
"sökningar via Tor."

#: content/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/
msgid ""
"DuckDuckGo does not log, collect or share the user's personal information or "
"their search history, and therefore is best positioned to protect your "
"privacy."
msgstr ""
"DuckDuckGo loggar, samlar inte in eller delar användarens personuppgifter "
"eller sökhistorik och har därför goda förutsättningar att skydda "
"integriteten."

#: content/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/
msgid "DuckDuckGo onion service"
msgstr "DuckDuckGos onion-tjänst"

#: content/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/
msgid ""
"If you're having a problem with DuckDuckGo, please see the [DuckDuckGo "
"support portal](https://duck.co/help)."
msgstr ""
"Om du har problem med DuckDuckGo kan du läsa [DuckDuckGos supportportal]"
"(https://duck.co/help)."

#: content/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/
msgid ""
"In Tor Browser, clicking the **“Onionize”** option in DuckDuckGo will "
"automatically switch you to the onion version of their search engine."
msgstr ""
"När du klickar på alternativet **”Onionize”** i DuckDuckGo i Tor Browser "
"byter sökmotorn automatiskt till onion-versionen."

#: content/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/
msgid ""
"Most other search engines store your searches along with other information "
"such as the timestamp, your IP address, and your account information if you "
"are logged in."
msgstr ""
"De flesta andra sökmotorer lagrar sökningarna tillsammans med annan "
"information, exempelvis tidsstämpel, IP-adress och kontouppgifter om du är "
"inloggad."

#: content/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/
msgid ""
"Previously, Tor Browser used Disconnect, a meta search engine that let users "
"choose between providers. But when Disconnect lost access to Google's "
"results, it fell back to Bing, which provided lower-quality results."
msgstr ""
"Tidigare använde Tor Browser metasökmotorn Disconnect, där användaren kunde "
"välja leverantör. När Disconnect förlorade åtkomsten till Googles resultat "
"gick tjänsten över till Bing, som gav resultat av lägre kvalitet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/
msgid ""
"Starting with Tor Browser 6.0.6, **DuckDuckGo** became the default search "
"engine."
msgstr "Från och med Tor Browser 6.0.6 blev **DuckDuckGo** standardsökmotor."

#: content/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/default-search-engine/
msgid "DuckDuckGo"
msgstr "DuckDuckGo"

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser includes multiple defenses - like letterboxing, user-agent "
"spoofing, and first-party isolation - that make it harder to identify you "
"online."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser innehåller flera skydd, exempelvis letterboxing, förfalskning av "
"användaragenten och förstapartsisolering, som gör det svårare att "
"identifiera dig på nätet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid "Websites can use browser fingerprinting to track users without cookies."
msgstr ""
"Webbplatser kan använda webbläsarfingeravtryck för att spåra användare utan "
"kakor."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid "How Tor Browser protects you against browser fingerprinting"
msgstr "Så skyddar Tor Browser dig mot webbläsarfingeravtryck"

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid "Fingerprinting protections"
msgstr "Skydd mot fingeravtryck"

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid "All Android as Android 10."
msgstr "Alla Android som Android 10."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid "All Windows appear as Windows 10."
msgstr "Alla Windows visas som Windows 10."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid "All macOS appear as OS X 10.15."
msgstr "Alla macOS visas som OS X 10.15."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"All other systems like all Linux distributions (including Tails and Qubes), "
"*BSD and other operating systems are grouped together and reported as "
"\"Linux running X11\"."
msgstr ""
"Alla andra system, som alla Linux-distributioner (inklusive Tails och "
"Qubes), *BSD och andra operativsystem grupperas tillsammans och rapporteras "
"som \"Linux som kör X11\"."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"All the other details (such as the architecture) are also normalized per-"
"platform."
msgstr ""
"Alla andra detaljer (som arkitekturen) är också normaliserade per plattform."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid "Anti-fingerprinting features in Tor Browser"
msgstr "Anti-fingeravtrycksfunktioner i Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"Any script running in the browser can silently build a fingerprint of the "
"device without users even knowing about it."
msgstr ""
"Alla skript som körs i webbläsaren kan i tysthet bygga ett fingeravtryck av "
"enheten utan att användarna ens vet om det."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"Browser fingerprinting is the systematic collection of information about the "
"web browser to make educated guesses about its identity or characteristics."
msgstr ""
"Webbläsarfingeravtryck är den systematiska insamlingen av information om "
"webbläsaren för att göra välgrundade gissningar om dess identitet eller "
"egenskaper."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"Certain attributes, like the operating system and language, are necessary "
"for functionality and cannot be completely hidden or spoofed."
msgstr ""
"Vissa attribut, som operativsystem och språk, är nödvändiga för "
"funktionalitet och kan inte helt döljas eller förfalskas."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid "Each browser's settings and features create a \"browser fingerprint\"."
msgstr ""
"Varje webbläsares inställningar och funktioner skapar ett "
"\"webbläsarfingeravtryck\"."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"First, there is no need to ask for permissions from the user to collect this "
"information."
msgstr ""
"För det första finns det ingen anledning att be om tillstånd från användaren "
"för att samla in denna information."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"For a complete list of features, please read the [Tor Browser design and "
"implementation document](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/applications/"
"wiki/-/wikis/Design-Documents/Tor-Browser-Design-Doc)."
msgstr ""
"En fullständig funktionslista finns i [dokumentet om Tor Browsers utformning "
"och implementering](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/applications/wiki/-/"
"wikis/Design-Documents/Tor-Browser-Design-Doc)."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"For example, it limits font enumeration and applies character fallback, "
"standardizes screen and window sizes using letterboxing, and restricts the "
"variety of requested languages to a small, predefined set."
msgstr ""
"Till exempel begränsar den teckensnittsuppräkningen och tillämpar "
"reservtecken, standardiserar skärm- och fönsterstorlekar med hjälp av "
"letterboxing och begränsar mängden begärda språk till en liten, "
"fördefinierad uppsättning."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"For more in-depth information on browser fingerprinting, refer to these "
"articles on the Tor Blog: [Browser Fingerprinting: An Introduction and the "
"Challenges Ahead](https://blog.torproject.org/browser-fingerprinting-"
"introduction-and-challenges-ahead/) and [Tor Browser: a legacy of advancing "
"private browsing innovation](https://blog.torproject.org/tor-browser-"
"advancing-privacy-innovation/)."
msgstr ""
"Mer ingående information om webbläsarfingeravtryck finns i artiklarna "
"[Browser Fingerprinting: An Introduction and the Challenges Ahead](https://"
"blog.torproject.org/browser-fingerprinting-introduction-and-challenges-"
"ahead/) och [Tor Browser: ett arv av innovation inom privat surfning]"
"(https://blog.torproject.org/tor-browser-advancing-privacy-innovation/) på "
"Tor-bloggen."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid "How Tor Browser mitigates fingerprinting"
msgstr "Hur Tor Browser minskar fingeravtryck"

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"However, perfectly spoofing across all browser contexts is not possible and "
"active fingerprinting methods (using fonts, features, behavior, with or "
"without JavaScript, etc.) can often be used to infer aspects of the hardware "
"or operating system."
msgstr ""
"Det är dock inte möjligt att förfalska data perfekt i alla "
"webbläsarkontexter, och aktiva fingeravtrycksmetoder (med hjälp av "
"teckensnitt, funktioner, beteenden, med eller utan JavaScript etc.) kan ofta "
"användas för att utläsa aspekter av hårdvaran eller operativsystemet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"In addition to letterboxing, Tor Browser employs many other features to "
"mitigate browser fingerprinting and protect user privacy."
msgstr ""
"Förutom letterboxing använder Tor Browser många andra funktioner för att "
"minska webbläsarfingeravtryck och skydda användarnas integritet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"In simple words, this technique makes groups of users of certain screen "
"sizes and this makes it harder to single out users on basis of screen size, "
"as many users will have same screen size."
msgstr ""
"Enkelt uttryckt skapar den här tekniken grupper av användare med vissa "
"skärmstorlekar, vilket gör det svårare att peka ut användare utifrån "
"skärmstorlek, eftersom många användare har samma skärmstorlek."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"In this case, the fingerprint resistance strategy in Tor Browser is to "
"protect real values of the User-Agent by spoofing, but also have a large "
"enough user set."
msgstr ""
"I det här fallet är fingeravtrycksmotståndsstrategin i Tor Browser att "
"skydda användaragentens verkliga värden genom förfalskning, men också att ha "
"en tillräckligt stor användaruppsättning."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"Inconsistencies in these values can trigger anti-bot and anti-fraud systems "
"into categorizing Tor users as a bot, and deny their requests, which in turn "
"affects usability for Tor Browser users."
msgstr ""
"Inkonsekvenser i dessa värden kan utlösa att antibot- och "
"bedrägeribekämpningssystem kategoriserar Tor-användare som botar och nekar "
"deras förfrågningar, vilket i sin tur påverkar användbarheten för Tor "
"Browser-användare."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"Instead, Tor Browser [standardizes User-Agent values](https://searchfox.org/"
"firefox-main/rev/e831a170e65addac6fd3a8598d87dd794791a53f/toolkit/components/"
"resistfingerprinting/nsRFPService.h#29-66) to reduce uniqueness and avoid "
"creating a false sense of privacy:"
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser [standardiserar i stället värden för User-Agent](https://"
"searchfox.org/firefox-main/rev/e831a170e65addac6fd3a8598d87dd794791a53f/"
"toolkit/components/resistfingerprinting/nsRFPService.h#29-66) för att minska "
"unikheten och undvika en falsk känsla av integritet:"

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"Instead, Tor Browser limits the variety within these attributes to reduce "
"distinctiveness."
msgstr ""
"Istället begränsar Tor Browser variationen inom dessa attribut för att "
"minska särskiljningsförmågan."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"It works by adding margins to a browser window so that the window is as "
"close as possible to the desired size while users are still in a couple of "
"screen size buckets that prevent singling them out with the help of screen "
"dimensions."
msgstr ""
"Det fungerar genom att lägga till marginaler i ett webbläsarfönster så att "
"fönstret kommer så nära den önskade storleken som möjligt medan användarna "
"fortfarande befinner sig i ett par skärmstorleksgrupper som gör att de inte "
"kan pekas ut med hjälp av skärmdimensionerna."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid "Letterboxing"
msgstr "Letterboxing"

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"Most browsers inadvertently create a unique fingerprint for each user, which "
"can be tracked across the internet."
msgstr ""
"De flesta webbläsare skapar oavsiktligt ett unikt fingeravtryck för varje "
"användare, som kan spåras över hela Internet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid "Other anti-fingerprinting features"
msgstr "Andra funktioner mot fingeravtryck"

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"Second, if one attribute of the browser fingerprint is unique or if the "
"combination of several attributes is unique, the device can be identified "
"and tracked online."
msgstr ""
"För det andra, om ett attribut i webbläsarens fingeravtryck är unikt eller "
"om kombinationen av flera attribut är unik, kan enheten identifieras och "
"spåras online."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"Since this information can reveal which OS or device a user is using, it has "
"been a vector for browser fingerprinting, allowing websites or trackers to "
"potentially single out users."
msgstr ""
"Eftersom denna information kan avslöja vilket operativsystem eller vilken "
"enhet en användare använder har den varit en vektor för "
"webbläsarfingeravtryck, vilket gör det möjligt för webbplatser eller spårare "
"att potentiellt identifiera användare."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"Some privacy tools or users suggest that making all users appear as Windows "
"would offer the best cover."
msgstr ""
"Vissa sekretessverktyg eller användare föreslår att det bästa skyddet skulle "
"vara att få alla användare att visas som Windows."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"That works so far until users start to resize their windows (e.g. by "
"maximizing them or going into fullscreen mode)."
msgstr ""
"Det fungerar än så länge tills användare börjar ändra storlek på sina "
"fönster (t.ex. genom att maximera dem eller gå in i helskärmsläge)."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"The User-Agent string is a value websites can use to identify details about "
"your browser, operating system (OS), CPU architecture, vendor, and version."
msgstr ""
"User-Agent-strängen är ett värde som webbplatser kan använda för att "
"identifiera information om din webbläsare, operativsystem (OS), CPU-"
"arkitektur, leverantör och version."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"The key goal of Tor Browser's anti-fingerprinting protections is to make it "
"significantly more challenging to gather enough information to uniquely "
"identify users, thereby enhancing privacy without compromising necessary "
"functionality."
msgstr ""
"Huvudsyftet med Tor Browsers skydd mot fingeravtryck är att göra det "
"betydligt svårare att samla in tillräckligt med uppgifter för att unikt "
"identifiera användare och därmed stärka integriteten utan att förlora "
"nödvändig funktionalitet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"The small set of standardized options is key to keeping users blended "
"together, maximizing privacy for everyone."
msgstr ""
"Den lilla uppsättningen standardiserade alternativ är nyckeln till att hålla "
"användarna blandade och maximera integriteten för alla."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"The strategy here is to put all users in a couple of buckets to make it "
"harder to single them out."
msgstr ""
"Strategin här är att placera alla användare i ett par olika fack för att "
"göra det svårare att välja ut dem."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"These features include Canvas image extraction blocking, NoScript "
"integration, and first-party isolation."
msgstr ""
"Dessa funktioner inkluderar blockering av Canvas-bildextrahering, NoScript-"
"integrering och förstapartsisolering."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid "This approach makes it harder to track individual users effectively."
msgstr ""
"Detta tillvägagångssätt gör det svårare att spåra enskilda användare på ett "
"effektivt sätt."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"This is intentional: any option to choose would only make users more unique "
"and thus easier to fingerprint."
msgstr ""
"Det är avsiktligt: alla valmöjligheter skulle göra användarna mer unika och "
"därmed lättare att identifiera med fingeravtryck."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"This means that even without [cookies](../../../glossary/#cookie), a device "
"can be tracked using its fingerprint."
msgstr ""
"Det innebär att en enhet kan spåras med sitt fingeravtryck även utan [kakor]"
"(../../../glossary/#cookie)."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"To prevent fingerprinting based on screen dimensions, Tor Browser starts "
"with a content window rounded to a multiple of 200px x 100px."
msgstr ""
"För att motverka fingeravtryck utifrån skärmens mått startar Tor Browser med "
"ett innehållsfönster vars mått avrundas till multiplar av 200 × 100 "
"bildpunkter."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser addresses this by spoofing the User-Agent. Users cannot choose a "
"specific operating system or attempt to imitate every possible platform."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser åtgärdar detta genom att förfalska användaragenten. Användare "
"kan inte välja ett specifikt operativsystem eller försöka imitera alla "
"möjliga plattformar."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid "Tor Browser does not let users select which OS they appear to be."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser låter inte användare välja vilket operativsystem de verkar vara."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser is specifically engineered to minimize the uniqueness of each "
"user's fingerprint across various metrics."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser är särskilt utvecklad för att minimera det unika i varje "
"användares fingeravtryck i olika mätvärden."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser ships with a fingerprinting defense for those scenarios as well, "
"which is called [Letterboxing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
"Letterboxing_%28filming%29), a technique developed by Mozilla and [presented "
"in 2019](https://www.zdnet.com/article/firefox-to-add-tor-browser-anti-"
"fingerprinting-technique-called-letterboxing/)."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser har även ett skydd för sådana situationer som kallas "
"[letterboxing](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Letterboxing_%28filming%29), en "
"teknik som utvecklades av Mozilla och [presenterades 2019](https://"
"www.zdnet.com/article/firefox-to-add-tor-browser-anti-fingerprinting-"
"technique-called-letterboxing/)."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid "Understanding browser fingerprinting"
msgstr "Förstå webbläsarens fingeravtryck"

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid "User-Agent and Operating System spoofing"
msgstr "Förfalskning av User-Agent och operativsystem"

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"User-Agent is sent to websites as an HTTP header, and it is available to "
"JavaScript as `navigator.userAgent`."
msgstr ""
"En användaragent skickas till webbplatser som en HTTP-header och är "
"tillgänglig för JavaScript som `navigator.userAgent`."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid ""
"While it is practically impossible to make all Tor Browser users identical, "
"the goal is to reduce the number of distinguishable \"buckets\" for each "
"metric."
msgstr ""
"Det är praktiskt taget omöjligt att göra alla Tor Browser-användare "
"identiska, men målet är att minska antalet urskiljbara ”grupper” för varje "
"mätvärde."

#: content/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/fingerprinting-protections/
msgid "Why browser fingerprinting threatens online privacy?"
msgstr "Varför hotar webbläsarfingeravtryck integritet på nätet?"

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"When you connect to a website, it is not only the operators of that website "
"who can record information about your visit. Most websites now use numerous "
"third-party services, including social networking \"Like\" buttons, "
"analytics trackers, and advertising beacons, all of which can link your "
"activity across different sites."
msgstr ""
"När du ansluter till en webbplats är det inte bara webbplatsens operatörer "
"som kan registrera uppgifter om besöket. De flesta webbplatser använder "
"numera många tredjepartstjänster, däribland gilla-knappar för sociala "
"nätverk, analysspårare och annonspixlar, som kan koppla samman din aktivitet "
"på olika webbplatser."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid "Managing identities and preventing linkability in Tor Browser"
msgstr "Hantera identiteter och förhindra länkbarhet i Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid "Managing identities"
msgstr "Hantera identiteter"

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"Although Tor Browser is designed to enable total user anonymity on the web, "
"there may be situations in which it makes sense to use Tor with websites "
"that require usernames, passwords, or other identifying information."
msgstr ""
"Även om Tor Browser är utformad för att möjliggöra total användaranonymitet "
"på webben kan det finnas situationer där det är vettigt att använda Tor med "
"webbplatser som kräver användarnamn, lösenord eller annan identifierande "
"information."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"Any other application on your system (including other browsers) will not "
"have their connections routed over the Tor network, and will not be "
"protected."
msgstr ""
"Anslutningar från andra program i systemet, inklusive andra webbläsare, leds "
"inte genom Tor-nätverket och skyddas inte."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid "Can I pick which country I'm exiting from?"
msgstr "Kan jag välja vilket land utgången ska finnas i?"

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid "Changing identities and circuits"
msgstr "Byta identiteter och kretsar"

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid "Does using Tor Browser protect other applications on my computer?"
msgstr "Skyddar Tor Browser andra program på datorn?"

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid "FAQ"
msgstr "Frågor och svar"

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"If the outcome you want is simply to be able to access resources that are "
"only available in one country, you may want to consider using a VPN instead "
"of using Tor."
msgstr ""
"Om du bara vill komma åt resurser som endast är tillgängliga i ett visst "
"land kan en VPN-tjänst vara lämpligare än Tor."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"If you log into a website using a regular browser, you also reveal your IP "
"address and geographical location in the process. The same is often true "
"when you send an email. Logging into your social networking or email "
"accounts using Tor Browser allows you to choose exactly which information "
"you reveal to the websites you browse. Logging in using Tor Browser is also "
"useful if the website you are trying to reach is censored on your network."
msgstr ""
"När du loggar in på en webbplats med en vanlig webbläsare avslöjar du "
"samtidigt IP-adressen och den geografiska platsen. Detsamma gäller ofta när "
"du skickar e-post. Om du loggar in på sociala nätverk eller e-postkonton med "
"Tor Browser kan du själv välja vilka uppgifter som avslöjas för "
"webbplatserna. Det är också användbart om webbplatsen är censurerad i "
"nätverket."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"If you need to be sure that all traffic will go through the Tor network, "
"take a look at the [Tails live operating system](https://tails.net/) which "
"you can start on almost any computer from a USB stick or a DVD."
msgstr ""
"Om all trafik måste gå genom Tor-nätverket kan du använda "
"[liveoperativsystemet Tails](https://tails.net/), som kan startas på nästan "
"vilken dator som helst från ett USB-minne eller en DVD."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"In the circuit, the Guard or entry node is the first node and it's "
"automatically and randomly selected by Tor. But it is different from the "
"other nodes in the circuit. In order to avoid profiling attacks, the Guard "
"node changes only after 2-3 months, unlike the other nodes, which change "
"with every new domain. For more information about Guards, consult the "
"[Understanding guard relays](../../security/guard-relay) article."
msgstr ""
"Vakten eller ingångsnoden är kretsens första nod och väljs automatiskt och "
"slumpmässigt av Tor. Den skiljer sig från kretsens övriga noder. För att "
"motverka profileringsattacker byts vaktnoden bara efter två till tre "
"månader, till skillnad från övriga noder som byts för varje ny domän. Mer "
"information finns i artikeln [Förstå vaktreläer](../../security/guard-relay)."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid "Logging in over Tor"
msgstr "Logga in via Tor"

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"Modifying the way that Tor creates its circuits is strongly discouraged."
msgstr "Det avråds starkt från att ändra hur Tor skapar sina kretsar."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid "New Tor circuit for this site"
msgstr "Ny Tor-krets för denna webbplats"

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid "New identity"
msgstr "Ny identitet"

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"On the other hand, all connections to a single website address will be made "
"over the same Tor circuit, meaning you can browse different pages of a "
"single website in separate tabs or windows, without any loss of "
"functionality."
msgstr ""
"Alla anslutningar till en och samma webbplatsadress går däremot genom samma "
"Tor-krets. Du kan därför besöka olika sidor på webbplatsen i separata flikar "
"eller fönster utan funktionsförlust."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid "Only Tor Browser's traffic will be routed over the Tor network."
msgstr "Endast Tor Browsers trafik leds genom Tor-nätverket."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"Please note that VPNs do not have the same privacy properties as Tor, but "
"they will help solve some geolocation restriction issues."
msgstr ""
"Observera att VPN-tjänster inte har samma integritetsegenskaper som Tor, men "
"de kan lösa vissa problem med geografiska begränsningar."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"See the [Secure Connections](../secure-connections) page for important "
"information on how to secure your connection when logging in."
msgstr ""
"Viktig information om hur du skyddar anslutningen vid inloggning finns på "
"sidan [Säkra anslutningar](../secure-connections)."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid "The URL bar"
msgstr "URL-fältet"

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid "They need to be configured separately to use Tor."
msgstr "De måste konfigureras separat för att använda Tor."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"This option is useful if the exit relay you are using is unable to connect "
"to the website you require, or is not loading it properly. Selecting it will "
"cause the currently-active tab or window to be reloaded over a new Tor "
"circuit. Other open tabs and windows from the same website will use the new "
"circuit as well once they are reloaded. This option does not clear any "
"private information or unlink your activity, nor does it affect your current "
"connections to other websites."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet är användbart om utgångsreläet inte kan ansluta till den "
"önskade webbplatsen eller inte läser in den korrekt. Den aktiva fliken eller "
"fönstret läses då in igen via en ny Tor-krets. Andra öppna flikar och "
"fönster från samma webbplats använder också den nya kretsen när de läses in "
"igen. Alternativet rensar inte privata uppgifter, kopplar inte bort din "
"aktivitet och påverkar inte aktuella anslutningar till andra webbplatser."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"This option is useful if you want to prevent your subsequent browser "
"activity from being linkable to what you were doing before. Selecting it "
"will close all your open tabs and windows, clear all private information "
"such as cookies and browsing history, and use new Tor circuits for all "
"connections. Tor Browser will warn you that all activity and downloads will "
"be stopped, so take this into account before clicking \"New Identity\"."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet hindrar efterföljande surfaktivitet från att kunna kopplas till "
"det du gjorde tidigare. Alla öppna flikar och fönster stängs, privata "
"uppgifter som kakor och surfhistorik rensas och nya Tor-kretsar används för "
"alla anslutningar. Tor Browser varnar för att all aktivitet och alla "
"hämtningar stoppas, så tänk på det innan du klickar på ”Ny identitet”."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"To use this option, you just need to click on 'New Identity' in Tor "
"Browser's toolbar."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på ”Ny identitet” i Tor Browsers verktygsfält för att använda "
"alternativet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser centers your web experience around your relationship with the "
"website in the URL bar. Even if you connect to two different sites that use "
"the same third-party tracking service, Tor Browser will force the content to "
"be served over two different Tor circuits, so the tracker will not know that "
"both connections originate from your browser."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser utgår från relationen mellan dig och webbplatsen i URL-fältet. "
"Om två olika webbplatser använder samma spårningstjänst från tredje part "
"tvingar Tor Browser innehållet att gå genom två olika Tor-kretsar, så "
"spåraren kan inte se att båda anslutningarna kommer från din webbläsare."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser features \"New Identity\" and \"New Tor Circuit for this Site\" "
"options. They are also located in the hamburger or main menu (≡)."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser har alternativen \"Ny identitet\" och \"Ny Tor-krets för den här "
"webbplatsen\". De finns också i hamburgarmenyn eller huvudmenyn (≡)."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser often makes your connection appear as though it is coming from "
"an entirely different part of the world. Some websites, such as banks or "
"email providers, might interpret this as a sign that your account has been "
"hacked or compromised, and lock you out. The only way to resolve this is by "
"following the site's recommended procedure for account recovery, or "
"contacting the operators and explaining the situation."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser gör ofta att din anslutning visas som om den kommer från en helt "
"annan del av världen. Vissa webbplatser, som banker eller e-"
"postleverantörer, kan tolka detta som ett tecken på att ditt konto har "
"hackats eller äventyrats och låser ut dig. Det enda sättet att lösa detta är "
"genom att följa webbplatsens rekommenderade förfarande för "
"kontoåterställning, eller kontakta operatörerna och förklara situationen."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"Using the Tor network stops observers from being able to discover your exact "
"location and IP address, but even without this information they might be "
"able to link different areas of your activity together. For this reason, Tor "
"Browser includes some additional features that help you control what "
"information can be tied to your identity."
msgstr ""
"Med hjälp av Tor-nätverket hindras observatörer från att kunna upptäcka din "
"exakta plats och IP-adress, men även utan denna information kan de "
"eventuellt länka olika delar av din verksamhet tillsammans. Av denna "
"anledning innehåller Tor Browser några ytterligare funktioner som hjälper "
"dig att styra vilken information som kan kopplas till din identitet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"When you log in to a website over Tor, there are several points you should "
"bear in mind:"
msgstr ""
"När du loggar in på en webbplats över Tor finns det flera punkter du bör "
"tänka på:"

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"You can also access this option in the new circuit display, in the site "
"information menu, in the URL bar."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också komma åt det här alternativet i den nya kretsvisningen, i "
"webbplatsinformationsmenyn, i URL-fältet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"You can see a diagram of the circuit that Tor Browser is using for the "
"current tab in the site information menu, in the URL bar."
msgstr ""
"Du kan se ett diagram över kretsen som Tor Browser använder för den aktuella "
"fliken i webbplatsinformationsmenyn i URL-fältet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid ""
"You get the best security that Tor can provide when you leave the route "
"selection to Tor; overriding the entry/exit nodes can compromise your "
"anonymity."
msgstr ""
"Du får bästa möjliga säkerhet från Tor om du låter Tor välja färdväg. Om du "
"åsidosätter ingångs- eller utgångsnoderna kan anonymiteten äventyras."

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid "Display circuit diagram under the site information menu"
msgstr "Visa kretsdiagrammet under menyn med webbplatsinformation"

#: content/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/managing-identities/
msgid "New Identity and New Tor Circuit options under main menu"
msgstr "Alternativen Ny identitet och Ny Tor-krets i huvudmenyn"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"Onion services (formerly known as \"hidden services\") are services, like "
"websites, that are only accessible through the Tor network."
msgstr ""
"Onion-tjänster (tidigare kända som \"dolda tjänster\") är tjänster, som "
"webbplatser, som endast är tillgängliga via Tor-nätverket."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "Understanding and using onion services in Tor Browser"
msgstr "Förstå och använda onion-tjänster i Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"All traffic between Tor users and onion services is end-to-end encrypted, so "
"you do not need to worry about [connecting over HTTPS](../secure-"
"connections)."
msgstr ""
"All trafik mellan Tor-användare och onion-tjänster är totalsträckskrypterad, "
"så du behöver inte oroa dig för att [ansluta via HTTPS](../secure-"
"connections)."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"An authenticated onion service is a service like an onion site that requires "
"the client to provide an authentication token before accessing the service."
msgstr ""
"En autentiserad Onion-tjänst är en tjänst som liknar en Onion-webbplats som "
"kräver att klienten anger en autentiseringstoken innan den får åtkomst till "
"tjänsten."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "An onion means either that:"
msgstr "En onion-ikon innebär antingen att:"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "An onion with a caution sign means:"
msgstr "En onion-ikon med varningstecken innebär:"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "An onion with a red slash means:"
msgstr "En överstruken röd onion-ikon innebär:"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"Another way to learn about an onion site is if the website administrator has "
"implemented a feature called Onion-Location."
msgstr ""
"Ett annat sätt att lära sig mer om en Onion-webbplats är om "
"webbplatsadministratören har implementerat en funktion som heter Onion-"
"Location."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "As a Tor user, you may authenticate yourself directly in Tor Browser."
msgstr "Som Tor-användare kan du autentisera dig direkt i Tor Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"Because of the cryptography involved, the .onion URL lets Tor ensure that it "
"is connecting to the right location and that the connection is not being "
"tampered with."
msgstr ""
"På grund av kryptografin som är inblandad låter .onion-URL:en Tor "
"säkerställa att den ansluter till rätt plats och att anslutningen inte "
"manipuleras."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "Enter your valid private key into the input field."
msgstr "Ange din giltiga privata nyckel i inmatningsfältet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"Errors can happen in different layers: client errors, network errors, or "
"service errors."
msgstr "Fel kan uppstå i olika lager: klientfel, nätverksfel eller tjänstfel."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "How to access an onion service"
msgstr "Så öppnar du en onion-tjänst"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"If you are still unable to connect to the onion service after verifying the "
"address, please try again later. There may be a temporary connection issue, "
"or the site operators may have allowed it to go offline without warning."
msgstr ""
"Om du fortfarande inte kan ansluta till Onion-tjänsten efter att du har "
"verifierat adressen, försök igen senare. Det kan vara ett tillfälligt "
"anslutningsproblem, eller så kan webbplatsens operatörer ha tillåtit att den "
"går offline utan förvarning."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"If you are trying to access a 16 character (the shorter \"V2 format\") onion "
"service, this type of address no longer works on today's Tor network."
msgstr ""
"Om du försöker nå en onion-tjänst med 16 tecken, det kortare v2-formatet, "
"fungerar adressen inte längre i dagens Tor-nätverk."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"If you can't connect to an onion site, Tor Browser will provide a specific "
"error message informing why the website is unavailable."
msgstr ""
"Om du inte kan ansluta till en Onion-webbplats kommer Tor Browser att visa "
"ett specifikt felmeddelande som informerar om varför webbplatsen inte är "
"tillgänglig."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"If you cannot reach the onion service you requested, make sure that you have "
"entered the onion address correctly: even a small mistake will stop Tor "
"Browser from being able to reach the site."
msgstr ""
"Om du inte kan nå den Onion-tjänst du begärt, se till att du har angett "
"Onion-adressen korrekt: även ett litet misstag kommer att hindra Tor Browser "
"från att nå webbplatsen."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"In order to access this service, you will need access credentials from the "
"onion service operator."
msgstr ""
"För att få åtkomst till den här tjänsten behöver du åtkomstuppgifter från "
"Onion-tjänsteoperatören."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"In this case, the icon does not provide information that you're connected to "
"the \"right site\"."
msgstr ""
"I det här fallet visar ikonen inte att du är ansluten till ”rätt webbplats”."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"Just like any other website, you will need to know the address of an onion "
"service in order to connect to it. An onion address consists of 56 letters "
"and numbers, followed by \".onion\"."
msgstr ""
"Precis som med alla andra webbplatser behöver du veta adressen till en Onion-"
"tjänst för att kunna ansluta till den. En Onion-adress består av 56 "
"bokstäver och siffror, följt av \".onion\"."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "Onion Icon"
msgstr "Onion-ikon"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "Onion Service authentication"
msgstr "Autentisering för onion-tjänster"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "Onion Services errors"
msgstr "Fel för onion-tjänster"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"Onion services offer several advantages over ordinary services on the non-"
"private web:"
msgstr ""
"Onion-tjänster har flera fördelar jämfört med vanliga tjänster på den öppna "
"webben:"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"Onion services' location and IP address are hidden, making it difficult for "
"adversaries to censor them or identify their operators."
msgstr ""
"Onion-tjänsternas plats och IP-adress är dolda, vilket gör det svårt för "
"motståndare att censurera dem eller identifiera deras operatörer."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"Some of these errors can be fixed by following the Troubleshooting section."
msgstr "Vissa av dessa fel kan åtgärdas genom att följa avsnittet Felsökning."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"That means a Certificate Authority (CA) has checked that the site really "
"belongs to the entity it claims to belong."
msgstr ""
"Det innebär att en certifikatutfärdare (CA) har kontrollerat att webbplatsen "
"verkligen tillhör den aktör som den uppger sig tillhöra."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"That means the HTTPS certificate was issued by a Certificate Authority (CA), "
"but without checking if the site really belongs to the entity it claims to "
"belong, i.e, the onion icon does not provide the information that you're on "
"the \"right site\"."
msgstr ""
"Det innebär att HTTPS-certifikatet har utfärdats av en certifikatutfärdare "
"(CA), utan att kontrollera om webbplatsen verkligen tillhör den aktör som "
"den uppger sig tillhöra. Onion-ikonen visar alltså inte att du är på ”rätt "
"webbplats”."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "The Onion Service is served over HTTP."
msgstr "Onion-tjänsten tillhandahålls via HTTP."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"The Onion Service is served over HTTPS with a Domain Validated (DV) "
"certificate."
msgstr ""
"Onion-tjänsten tillhandahålls via HTTPS med ett domänvaliderat (DV) "
"certifikat."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "The Onion Service is served over HTTPS with a Self-Signed certificate."
msgstr ""
"Onion-tjänsten tillhandahålls via HTTPS med ett självsignerat certifikat."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "The Onion Service is served over HTTPS with a wrong Domain."
msgstr "Onion-tjänsten tillhandahålls via HTTPS med fel domän."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"The Onion Service is served over HTTPS with an Extended Validation "
"certificate."
msgstr ""
"Onion-tjänsten tillhandahålls via HTTPS med ett certifikat med utökad "
"validering (EV)."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "The Onion Service is served over HTTPS with an expired Certificate."
msgstr "Onion-tjänsten tillhandahålls via HTTPS med ett utgånget certifikat."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "The Onion Service is served with a mixed form over an insecure URL."
msgstr "Onion-tjänsten tillhandahålls i blandad form via en osäker URL."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "The Onion Service is served with a script from an insecure URL."
msgstr "Onion-tjänsten tillhandahålls med ett skript från en osäker URL."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"The address of an onion service is automatically generated, so the operators "
"do not need to purchase a domain name."
msgstr ""
"Adressen till en Onion-tjänst genereras automatiskt, så operatörerna behöver "
"inte köpa ett domännamn."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"The certificate was not signed by a Certificate Authority (CA) that is "
"recognized as a \"trusted\" authority, and the certificate provides no "
"information about whether the site really belongs to the entity it claims to "
"belong."
msgstr ""
"Certifikatet är inte signerat av en certifikatutfärdare (CA) som erkänns som "
"”betrodd”, och certifikatet visar inte om webbplatsen verkligen tillhör den "
"aktör som den uppger sig tillhöra."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"The table below shows all the possible errors and which action you should "
"take to solve the issue."
msgstr ""
"Tabellen nedan visar alla möjliga fel och vilka åtgärder du bör vidta för "
"att lösa problemet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"This is not a security issue, since the Onion Service protocol is already "
"end-to-end encrypted."
msgstr ""
"Detta är inget säkerhetsproblem, eftersom Onion Services-protokollet redan "
"är krypterat från ändpunkt till ändpunkt."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"When accessing a website that uses an onion service, Tor Browser will show "
"in the URL bar an icon of an onion displaying the state of your connection: "
"secure and using an onion service."
msgstr ""
"När du besöker en webbplats som använder en Onion-tjänst visar Tor Browser "
"en ikon med en Onion i URL-fältet som visar anslutningens status: säker och "
"använder en Onion-tjänst."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"When accessing an authenticated onion service, Tor Browser will show in the "
"URL bar an icon of a little gray key, accompanied by a tooltip."
msgstr ""
"När du använder en autentiserad onion-tjänst visar Tor Browser en liten grå "
"nyckelikon med ett verktygstips i URL-fältet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"When browsing an Onion Service, Tor Browser displays different onion icons "
"in the address bar indicating the security of the current webpage."
msgstr ""
"När du besöker en onion-tjänst visar Tor Browser olika onion-ikoner i "
"adressfältet som anger den aktuella webbsidans säkerhet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"You can also test if you are able to access other onion services by "
"connecting to [DuckDuckGo's Onion Service](https://"
"duckduckgogg42xjoc72x3sjasowoarfbgcmvfimaftt6twagswzczad.onion/)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också testa om du har åtkomst till andra Onion-tjänster genom att "
"ansluta till [DuckDuckGos Onion-tjänst](https://"
"duckduckgogg42xjoc72x3sjasowoarfbgcmvfimaftt6twagswzczad.onion/)."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"You can learn more about the onion service by clicking on the [onion icon]"
"(#onion-icon) and the adjacent Circuit Display in the address bar."
msgstr ""
"Du kan läsa mer om onion-tjänsten genom att klicka på [onion-ikonen](#onion-"
"icon) och den intilliggande kretsvisningen i adressfältet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "| **Code** | **Error Title** | **Short Description** |"
msgstr "| **Kod** | **Felrubrik** | **Kort beskrivning** |"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"| 0xF0 | Onionsite Not Found | The most likely cause is that the onionsite "
"is offline. Contact the onionsite administrator. |"
msgstr ""
"| 0xF0 | Onionwebbplats hittades inte | Den troligaste orsaken är att "
"onionwebbplatsen är offline. Kontakta onionwebbplats-administratören. |"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"| 0xF1 | Onionsite Cannot Be Reached | The onionsite is unreachable due an "
"internal error. |"
msgstr ""
"| 0xF1 | Onionwebbplats kan inte nås | Onionwebbplatsen kan inte nås på "
"grund av ett internt fel. |"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"| 0xF2 | Onionsite Has Disconnected | The most likely cause is that the "
"onionsite is offline. Contact the onionsite administrator. |"
msgstr ""
"| 0xF2 | Onionwebbplats har kopplats bort | Den troligaste orsaken är att "
"onionwebbplatsen är offline. Kontakta onionwebbplats-administratören. |"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"| 0xF3 | Unable to Connect to Onionsite | The onionsite is busy or the Tor "
"network is overloaded. Try again later. |"
msgstr ""
"| 0xF3 | Det går inte att ansluta till Onionwebbplats | Onionwebbplatsen är "
"upptagen eller så är Tor-nätverket överbelastat. Försök igen senare. |"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"| 0xF4 | Onionsite Requires Authentication | Access to the onionsite "
"requires a key but none was provided. |"
msgstr ""
"| 0xF4 | Onionwebbplats kräver autentisering | Åtkomst till onionwebbplatsen "
"kräver en nyckel men ingen tillhandahölls. |"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"| 0xF5 | Onionsite Authentication Failed | The provided key is incorrect or "
"has been revoked. Contact the onionsite administrator. |"
msgstr ""
"| 0xF5 | Onionwebbplats-autentisering misslyckades | Den angivna nyckeln är "
"felaktig eller har återkallats. Kontakta onionwebbplats-administratören. |"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"| 0xF6 | Invalid Onionsite Address | The provided onionsite address is "
"invalid. Please check that you entered it correctly. |"
msgstr ""
"| 0xF6 | Ogiltig Onionwebbplatsadress | Den angivna Onionwebbplatsadressen "
"är ogiltig. Kontrollera att du angav den korrekt. |"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"| 0xF7 | Onionsite Circuit Creation Timed Out | Failed to connect to the "
"onionsite, possibly due to a poor network connection. |"
msgstr ""
"| 0xF7 | Skapandet av Onionwebbplats-kretsen har nått tidsgränsen | "
"Misslyckades med att ansluta till Onionwebbplatsen, möjligen på grund av "
"dålig nätverksanslutning. |"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "Client Authorization"
msgstr "Kundtillstånd"

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "Onion service is served over an insecure URL."
msgstr "Onion-tjänsten tillhandahålls via en osäker URL."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid "Onion service served over HTTP or HTTPS."
msgstr "Onion-tjänsten tillhandahålls via HTTP eller HTTPS."

#: content/tor-browser/features/onion-services/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/onion-services/
msgid ""
"Onion service with an expired or self-signed certificate, wrong domain or "
"served over an insecure URL."
msgstr ""
"Onion-tjänsten har ett utgånget eller självsignerat certifikat, fel domän "
"eller tillhandahålls via en osäker URL."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser includes NoScript by default to help control JavaScript, but "
"installing other plugins or add-ons is strongly discouraged because they can "
"harm your privacy, weaken security, and make you easier to track."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser innehåller NoScript som standard för att styra JavaScript, men "
"du avråds starkt från att installera andra insticksmoduler eller tillägg "
"eftersom de kan skada integriteten, försvaga säkerheten och göra dig enklare "
"att spåra."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid "Can I use plugins, add-ons, or extensions in Tor Browser?"
msgstr ""
"Kan jag använda insticksmoduler, tillägg eller utökningar i Tor Browser?"

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid "Plugins"
msgstr "Pluginer"

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid "Browser Add-ons"
msgstr "Webbläsartillägg"

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"Each browser's settings and features create what is called a \"browser "
"fingerprint\"."
msgstr ""
"Varje webbläsares inställningar och funktioner skapar ett så kallat "
"”webbläsarfingeravtryck”."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"For users who want to have JavaScript disabled on all HTTP sites by default, "
"we recommend changing your Tor Browser's [Security Levels](../security-"
"levels/) option."
msgstr ""
"För användare som vill inaktivera JavaScript som standard på alla HTTP-"
"webbplatser rekommenderar vi att ändra alternativet [Säkerhetsnivåer](../"
"security-levels/) i Tor Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"However, disabling JavaScript will prevent many websites from displaying "
"correctly, so Tor Browser's default setting is to allow all websites to run "
"scripts in \"Standard\" mode."
msgstr ""
"Att inaktivera JavaScript kommer dock att förhindra att många webbplatser "
"visas korrekt, så Tor Browsers standardinställning är att tillåta alla "
"webbplatser att köra skript i \"Standard\"-läge."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"However, the only add-ons that have been tested for use with Tor Browser are "
"those included by default. Installing any other browser add-ons may break "
"functionality in Tor Browser or cause more serious problems that affect your "
"privacy and security. It is strongly discouraged to install additional add-"
"ons, and the Tor Project will not offer support for these configurations."
msgstr ""
"Men de enda tillägg som har testats för användning med Tor Browser är de som "
"ingår som standard. Installera andra tilläggsprogram för webbläsare kan "
"bryta funktionen i Tor Browser eller orsaka allvarligare problem som "
"påverkar din integritet och säkerhet. Det är starkt avskräckt att installera "
"ytterligare tillägg, och Tor Project erbjuder inte stöd för dessa "
"konfigurationer."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"If your copy of Tor Browser has a unique fingerprint, your browsing "
"activities can be deanonymized and tracked even though you are using Tor "
"Browser."
msgstr ""
"Om ditt exemplar av Tor Browser har ett unikt fingeravtryck kan "
"surfaktiviteten avanonymiseras och spåras trots att du använder Tor Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid "In the panel, next to the Toolbar button, select 'Show'."
msgstr "I panelen, bredvid verktygsfältsknappen, välj \"Visa\"."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"Installing new add-ons may affect Tor Browser in unforeseen ways and "
"potentially make your Tor Browser fingerprint unique."
msgstr ""
"Nya tillägg kan påverka Tor Browser på oförutsedda sätt och göra "
"webbläsarens fingeravtryck unikt."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"It's accessible through \"Add-ons and themes\" on the hamburger menu (≡)."
msgstr "Det finns under ”Tillägg och teman” i hamburgermenyn (≡)."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"It's strongly discouraged to install new add-ons in Tor Browser, because "
"they can compromise your privacy and security."
msgstr ""
"Du avråds starkt från att installera nya tillägg i Tor Browser eftersom de "
"kan äventyra integriteten och säkerheten."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"JavaScript is a programming language that websites use to offer interactive "
"elements such as video, animation, audio, and status timelines. "
"Unfortunately, JavaScript can also enable attacks on the security of the "
"browser, which might lead to deanonymization."
msgstr ""
"JavaScript är ett programerings språk som används av webbplatser för att "
"skapa interaktiva delar som video, animationer, ljud och status tidslinjer. "
"Javascrupt kan tyvärr också göra det möjligt för attacker på webbläsarens "
"säkerhet, vilket kan leda till att du inte är anonym längre."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"Locate the NoScript add-on and click on it to open a panel where you can "
"customize its settings."
msgstr ""
"Leta reda på NoScript-tillägget och klicka på det för att öppna en panel där "
"du kan anpassa dess inställningar."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"Most browsers inadvertently create a unique fingerprint for each user which "
"can be tracked across the internet."
msgstr ""
"De flesta webbläsare skapar oavsiktligt ett unikt fingeravtryck för varje "
"användare som kan spåras på internet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"Most users would give up on Tor entirely if we disabled JavaScript by "
"default because it would cause so many problems for them."
msgstr ""
"De flesta användare skulle helt sluta använda Tor om JavaScript "
"inaktiverades som standard, eftersom det skulle orsaka så många problem."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"Should I install a new add-on or extension in Tor Browser, like AdBlock Plus "
"or uBlock Origin?"
msgstr ""
"Bör jag installera ett nytt tillägg eller en utökning i Tor Browser, "
"exempelvis AdBlock Plus eller uBlock Origin?"

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"The \"Standard\" level allows JavaScript, the \"Safer\" level blocks "
"JavaScript on HTTP sites and the \"Safest\" level blocks JavaScript "
"altogether."
msgstr ""
"Nivån ”Standard” tillåter JavaScript, ”Säkrare” blockerar JavaScript på HTTP-"
"webbplatser och ”Säkrast” blockerar JavaScript helt."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid "The add-on itself could even be maliciously designed to spy on you."
msgstr ""
"Tillägget kan till och med vara avsiktligt skapat för att spionera på dig."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"There's also a good chance a new add-on will increase the attack surface of "
"Tor Browser."
msgstr ""
"Det är också mycket möjligt att ett nytt tillägg ökar Tor Browsers attackyta."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"This button enables you to manage JavaScript and other scripts on web pages, "
"allowing you to control their execution individually or block them entirely."
msgstr ""
"Den här knappen låter dig hantera JavaScript och andra skript på webbsidor, "
"så att du kan kontrollera deras körning individuellt eller blockera dem helt."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"This can be done by clicking on the Security level icon (the shield right "
"next to the URL bar) and then clicking on \"Settings...\"."
msgstr ""
"Det gör du genom att klicka på ikonen för säkerhetsnivå, skölden direkt "
"bredvid URL-fältet, och sedan på ”Inställningar…”."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"This may allow sensitive data to be leaked or allow an attacker to infect "
"Tor Browser."
msgstr ""
"Det kan läcka känsliga uppgifter eller låta en angripare infektera Tor "
"Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"This means each Tor Browser user looks like many other Tor Browser users, "
"making it difficult to track any individual user."
msgstr ""
"Det innebär att varje Tor Browser-användare liknar många andra Tor Browser-"
"användare, vilket gör det svårt att spåra en enskild användare."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"This will display the NoScript button to the right of the browser address "
"bar."
msgstr "Detta visar NoScript-knappen till höger om webbläsarens adressfält."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser already comes installed with one add-on - [NoScript](https://"
"noscript.net) - and adding anything else could deanonymize you."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser levereras redan med ett tillägg, [NoScript](https://"
"noscript.net), och ytterligare tillägg kan avanonymisera dig."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser includes an add-on called [NoScript](https://noscript.net/)."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser innehåller ett tillägg som heter [NoScript](https://"
"noscript.net/)."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser is based on Firefox, and any browser add-ons or themes that are "
"compatible with Firefox can also be installed in Tor Browser."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser är baserad på Firefox, och alla webbläsartillägg eller teman som "
"är kompatibla med Firefox kan också installeras i Tor Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser is specifically engineered to have a nearly identical (we're not "
"perfect!) fingerprint across its users."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser är särskilt konstruerad för att alla användare ska ha ett nästan "
"identiskt, om än inte perfekt, fingeravtryck."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"Ultimately, we want to make Tor Browser as secure as possible while also "
"making it usable for the majority of people, so for now, that means leaving "
"JavaScript enabled by default."
msgstr ""
"Målet är att göra Tor Browser så säker som möjligt och samtidigt användbar "
"för de flesta. Det innebär för närvarande att JavaScript är aktiverat som "
"standard."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"Users who require a high degree of security in their web browsing should set "
"Tor Browser's [Security Level](../security-levels/) to \"Safer\" (which "
"disables JavaScript for non-HTTPS websites) or \"Safest\" (which does so for "
"all websites)."
msgstr ""
"Användare som behöver mycket hög webbsäkerhet bör ange Tor Browsers "
"[säkerhetsnivå](../security-levels/) till ”Säkrare”, vilket inaktiverar "
"JavaScript på webbplatser utan HTTPS, eller ”Säkrast”, vilket gör det på "
"alla webbplatser."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid ""
"We configure NoScript to allow JavaScript by default in Tor Browser because "
"many websites will not work with JavaScript disabled."
msgstr ""
"Vi konfigurerar NoScript så att JavaScript tillåts som standard i Tor "
"Browser eftersom många webbplatser inte fungerar utan JavaScript."

#: content/tor-browser/features/plugins/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/plugins/
msgid "Why does Tor Browser ship with JavaScript enabled?"
msgstr "Varför levereras Tor Browser med JavaScript aktiverat?"

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid ""
"This helps prevent eavesdropping, tampering, and man-in-the-middle attacks "
"that can occur on unencrypted HTTP connections."
msgstr ""
"Det motverkar avlyssning, manipulering och man-i-mitten-attacker som kan "
"förekomma på okrypterade HTTP-anslutningar."

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser includes HTTPS-Only Mode, which ensures your connections to "
"websites are always encrypted whenever possible."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser innehåller läget Endast HTTPS, som ser till att anslutningar "
"till webbplatser alltid krypteras när det är möjligt."

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid "Enforcing encrypted browsing with HTTPS-Only Mode"
msgstr "Tvinga fram krypterad surfning med läget Endast HTTPS"

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid "Secure connections"
msgstr "Säkra anslutningar"

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:callout_primary.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid "HTTPS and Tor work together to enhance your privacy and anonymity"
msgstr "HTTPS och Tor samverkar för att stärka integriteten och anonymiteten"

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid ""
"Click the 'Go Back' button if you want to avoid any unencrypted connections."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på knappen ”Gå tillbaka” om du vill undvika okrypterade anslutningar."

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid ""
"Clicking 'Reload Tab with a New Circuit' will attempt to load a secure "
"version of the website with a [new Tor circuit](../managing-identities/)."
msgstr ""
"Om du klickar på ”Läs in fliken igen med en ny krets” försöker Tor Browser "
"läsa in en säker version av webbplatsen med en [ny Tor-krets](../managing-"
"identities/)."

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid "Cryptocurrency safety"
msgstr "Säkerhet för kryptovalutor"

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid ""
"Enabling this mode guarantees that all of your connections to websites are "
"upgraded to use HTTPS and hence secure."
msgstr ""
"Att aktivera det här läget garanterar att alla dina anslutningar till "
"webbplatser uppgraderas till att använda HTTPS och därmed är säkra."

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid "HTTPS-Only Mode in Tor Browser"
msgstr "Endast HTTPS-läge i Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid ""
"HTTPS-Only mode forces all connections to websites to use a secure encrypted "
"connection called HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"HTTPS-only-läge tvingar alla anslutningar till webbplatser att använda en "
"säker krypterad anslutning som kallas HTTPS."

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid ""
"If you are logging into any website, you should make sure that the site "
"offers HTTPS encryption, which protects against this kind of eavesdropping. "
"You can verify this in the URL bar: if your connection is encrypted, the "
"address will begin with \"https://\", rather than \"http://\"."
msgstr ""
"När du loggar in på en webbplats bör du kontrollera att den erbjuder HTTPS-"
"kryptering, som skyddar mot sådan avlyssning. Kontrollera URL-fältet: en "
"krypterad anslutning börjar med ”https://” och inte ”http://”."

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid ""
"If you click 'Continue to HTTP Site' you accept the risk and then will visit "
"a HTTP version of the site. HTTPS-Only Mode will be turned off temporarily "
"for that site."
msgstr ""
"Om du klickar på \"Fortsätt till HTTP-webbplats\" accepterar du risken och "
"besöker sedan en HTTP-version av webbplatsen. Endast HTTPS-läge kommer att "
"stängas av tillfälligt för den webbplatsen."

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid ""
"If you click 'Dismiss' you accept the risk and the cryptocurrency address "
"will be copied to the clipboard."
msgstr ""
"Om du klickar på \"Avfärda\" accepterar du risken och kryptovalutans adress "
"kopieras till urklipp."

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid "Most websites already support HTTPS; some support both HTTP and HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"De flesta webbplatser stöder redan HTTPS, vissa stöder både HTTP och HTTPS."

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid ""
"Some websites only support HTTP and the connection cannot be upgraded. If a "
"HTTPS version of a site is not available, you will see a \"Secure Connection "
"Not Available\" page:"
msgstr ""
"Vissa webbplatser stöder endast HTTP och anslutningen kan inte uppgraderas. "
"Om en HTTPS-version av en webbplats inte är tillgänglig visas sidan \"Säker "
"anslutning inte tillgänglig\":"

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid ""
"The cryptocurrency address could have been modified and should not be "
"trusted."
msgstr "Kryptovalutaadressen kan ha ändrats och bör inte litas på."

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser presents a security prompt if a cryptocurrency address has been "
"copied from an insecure HTTP website."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser visar en säkerhetsfråga om en kryptovalutaadress har kopierats "
"från en osäker HTTP-webbplats."

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid "Cryptocurrency safety dialog"
msgstr "Dialogruta om säkerhet för kryptovalutor"

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid "HTTPS-only mode setting in Tor Browser"
msgstr "Inställning för läget Endast HTTPS i Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid ""
"Warning about Secure Connection not available when visiting HTTP website"
msgstr ""
"Varning om att en säker anslutning inte är tillgänglig när en HTTP-webbplats "
"besöks"

#: content/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/secure-connections/
msgid "HTTPS-Only"
msgstr "Endast HTTPS"

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid ""
"By default, Tor Browser protects your security by encrypting your browsing "
"data."
msgstr ""
"Som standard skyddar Tor Browser din säkerhet genom att kryptera dina "
"webbläsardata."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "To maintain usability, JavaScript is enabled by default."
msgstr "JavaScript är aktiverat som standard för att bibehålla användbarheten."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "You can do this by increasing Tor Browser's Security Level."
msgstr "Du kan göra detta genom att öka Tor Browsers säkerhetsnivå."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid ""
"You can further increase your security by choosing to disable JavaScript and "
"certain web features that can be used to compromise your security and "
"anonymity."
msgstr ""
"Du kan stärka säkerheten ytterligare genom att inaktivera JavaScript och "
"vissa webbfunktioner som kan användas för att äventyra säkerheten och "
"anonymiteten."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid ""
"Adjusting security levels in Tor Browser to balance privacy and usability"
msgstr ""
"Anpassa säkerhetsnivåerna i Tor Browser för att balansera integritet och "
"användbarhet"

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Security levels"
msgstr "Säkerhetsnivåer"

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "At this level, all Tor Browser and website features are enabled."
msgstr ""
"På den här nivån är alla Tor Browsers och webbplatsens funktioner aktiverade."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Audio and Video (HTML5 media) are click-to-play."
msgstr "Ljud och video (HTML5-media) är klickbara."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Changing the security level"
msgstr "Ändra säkerhetsnivån"

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid ""
"Increasing the Security Level in the Tor Browser Security settings will "
"disable or partially disable certain browser features to protect against "
"possible attacks."
msgstr ""
"Att öka säkerhetsnivån i Tor Browsers säkerhetsinställningar inaktiverar "
"eller delvis inaktiverar vissa webbläsarfunktioner för att skydda mot "
"eventuella attacker."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "JavaScript is disabled on all non-[HTTPS](../secure-connections) sites."
msgstr ""
"JavaScript är inaktiverat på alla webbplatser som inte använder [HTTPS](../"
"secure-connections)."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Javascript is disabled by default on all sites."
msgstr "JavaScript är inaktiverat som standard på alla webbplatser."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Safer"
msgstr "Säkrare"

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Safest"
msgstr "Säkrast"

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid ""
"Scroll down to the \"Privacy and security\" section and tap on \"Security "
"Level\"."
msgstr ""
"Scrolla ner till avsnittet \"Sekretess och säkerhet\" och tryck på "
"\"Säkerhetsnivå\"."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Security Levels"
msgstr "Säkerhetsnivåer"

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid ""
"Security levels disable certain web features that can be used to compromise "
"your security and anonymity."
msgstr ""
"Säkerhetsnivåerna inaktiverar vissa webbfunktioner som kan användas för att "
"äventyra säkerheten och anonymiteten."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Some fonts and math symbols are disabled."
msgstr "Vissa teckensnitt och matematiska symboler är inaktiverade."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Some fonts, icons, math symbols, and images are disabled."
msgstr ""
"Vissa teckensnitt, ikoner, matematiska symboler och bilder är inaktiverade."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Standard"
msgstr "Standard"

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Tap on \"Save and restart\" prompting the browser to restart."
msgstr "Tryck på \"Spara och starta om\" så startar webbläsaren om."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Tap on the \"kebab menu\" i.e. the 3 vertical dots in navigation bar."
msgstr ""
"Tryck på \"kebabmenyn\", dvs. de 3 vertikala punkterna i navigeringsfältet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "These changes affect images, media, and scripts."
msgstr "Dessa ändringar påverkar bilder, media och skript."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid ""
"This in turn might stop some web pages from functioning properly, so you "
"should weigh your security needs against the degree of usability you require."
msgstr ""
"Detta kan i sin tur hindra vissa webbsidor från att fungera korrekt, så du "
"bör väga dina säkerhetsbehov mot den grad av användbarhet du kräver."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "This level disables website features that are often dangerous."
msgstr "Den här nivån inaktiverar webbplatsfunktioner som ofta är farliga."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid ""
"This level only allows website features required for static sites and basic "
"services."
msgstr ""
"Denna nivå tillåter endast webbplatsfunktioner som krävs för statiska "
"webbplatser och grundläggande tjänster."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "This may cause some sites to lose functionality."
msgstr "Detta kan leda till att vissa webbplatser förlorar funktionalitet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser for Android provides the same three security levels that are "
"available on Tor Browser for Desktop."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser för Android erbjuder samma tre säkerhetsnivåer som finns "
"tillgängliga i Tor Browser för datorer."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser for Android, by default, is set to the \"Standard\" Security "
"Level."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser för Android är som standard inställd på säkerhetsnivån "
"\"Standard\"."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Tor Browser, by default, is set to the \"Standard\" Security Level."
msgstr "Tor Browser är som standard inställd på säkerhetsnivån \"Standard\"."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "You can modify the security level by following given steps:"
msgstr "Du kan ändra säkerhetsnivån genom att följa angivna steg:"

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "You can now select a Security Level i.e. Standard, Safer or Safest."
msgstr ""
"Du kan nu välja en säkerhetsnivå, t.ex. standard, säkrare eller säkrast."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid ""
"You can undo the changes at any time by adjusting your Security Level and "
"restarting the browser."
msgstr ""
"Du kan ångra ändringarna när som helst genom att justera din säkerhetsnivå "
"och starta om webbläsaren."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Access Security Level Settings"
msgstr "Öppna inställningarna för säkerhetsnivå"

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Change the Security Level"
msgstr "Ändra säkerhetsnivån"

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid ""
"Choose between the different Security Levels - Standard, Safer or Safest."
msgstr "Välj mellan olika säkerhetsnivåer - standard, säkrare eller säkrast."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Click on \"Change\"."
msgstr "Klicka på \"Ändra\"."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Click on \"Save and restart\" prompting the browser to restart."
msgstr "Klicka på \"Spara och starta om\" så startar webbläsaren om."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Click on \"Settings\"."
msgstr "Klicka på \"Inställningar\"."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Click on the \"Shield\" icon (🛡️) on the address bar."
msgstr "Klicka på \"Sköld\"-ikonen (🛡️) i adressfältet."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid ""
"It should redirect to the Tor Browser settings and display the current "
"Security Level the browser is set to."
msgstr ""
"Den bör omdirigera till Tor Browsers inställningar och visa den aktuella "
"säkerhetsnivån som webbläsaren är inställd på."

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "Save the settings and restart the browser"
msgstr "Spara inställningarna och starta om webbläsaren"

#: content/tor-browser/features/security-levels/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/features/security-levels/
msgid "To view and adjust your Security Level on Tor Browser:"
msgstr "Så här visar och justerar du din säkerhetsnivå i Tor Browser:"

#: content/tor-browser/general/contents.lr:section.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/
msgid "General FAQ"
msgstr "Allmänna frågor och svar"

#: content/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/
msgid "Tor Browser is an open source software and it is free."
msgstr "Tor Browser är fri programvara med öppen källkod."

#: content/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/
msgid "Are there any paid versions of Tor Browser?"
msgstr "Finns det betalversioner av Tor Browser?"

#: content/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/
msgid "Cost to use Tor Browser"
msgstr "Kostnad för att använda Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/
msgid ""
"After downloading, you can make sure that you have the official version of "
"Tor Browser by [verifying the signature](../../getting-started/verifying-tor-"
"browser/)."
msgstr ""
"Efter hämtningen kan du kontrollera att du har den officiella versionen av "
"Tor Browser genom att [verifiera signaturen](../../getting-started/verifying-"
"tor-browser/)."

#: content/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/
msgid ""
"Any browser forcing you to pay and is claiming to be Tor Browser is fake."
msgstr ""
"Alla webbläsare som kräver betalning och påstår sig vara Tor Browser är "
"falska."

#: content/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/
msgid ""
"If you are not able to access our website, then visit [downloading section]"
"(../../getting-started/downloading) to get information about alternate way "
"of downloading Tor Browser."
msgstr ""
"Om vår webbplats inte går att nå läser du [avsnittet om hämtning](../../"
"getting-started/downloading) för information om alternativa sätt att hämta "
"Tor Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/
msgid ""
"If you have paid for a fake app claiming to be Tor Browser, you can try to "
"request a refund from the Apple or Play Store, or you can contact your bank "
"to report a fraudulent transaction."
msgstr ""
"Om du har betalat för en falsk app som påstår sig vara Tor Browser kan du "
"begära återbetalning från App Store eller Play Butik, eller kontakta banken "
"och rapportera en bedräglig transaktion."

#: content/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/
msgid ""
"To make sure you are downloading the right Tor Browser visit our [download "
"page](https://www.torproject.org/download/)."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollera att du hämtar rätt Tor Browser på vår [hämtningssida](https://"
"www.torproject.org/download/)."

#: content/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/
msgid "We cannot refund you for a purchase made to another company."
msgstr "Vi kan inte återbetala ett köp som gjorts från ett annat företag."

#: content/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/
msgid "You can report fake Tor Browsers on frontdesk@torproject.org."
msgstr ""
"Du kan rapportera falska Tor Browser-appar till frontdesk@torproject.org."

#: content/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/cost-to-use-tor/
msgid "Cost to use Tor"
msgstr "Kostnad för att använda Tor"

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid ""
"Manage your bookmarks in Tor Browser by exporting, importing, backing up, or "
"restoring them on Desktop; Android does not yet support these features."
msgstr ""
"Hantera bokmärken i Tor Browser genom att exportera, importera, "
"säkerhetskopiera eller återställa dem på datorn. Android stöder ännu inte "
"funktionerna."

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "How can I export and import bookmarks in Tor Browser?"
msgstr "Hur exporterar och importerar jag bokmärken i Tor Browser?"

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "Manage bookmarks in Tor Browser"
msgstr "Hantera bokmärken i Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "**If you wish to backup**"
msgstr "**Om du vill säkerhetskopiera**"

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "**If you wish to export bookmarks**"
msgstr "**Om du vill exportera bokmärken**"

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "**If you wish to import bookmarks**"
msgstr "**Om du vill importera bokmärken**"

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "**If you wish to restore**"
msgstr "**Om du vill återställa**"

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "**Import bookmarks from another browser**"
msgstr "**Importera bokmärken från en annan webbläsare**"

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid ""
"> The bookmarks in the selected HTML file will be added to your Tor Browser "
"within the Bookmarks Menu directory."
msgstr ""
"> Bokmärkena i den valda HTML-filen läggs till i Tor Browser under katalogen "
"Bokmärkesmeny."

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "> Your bookmarks are now successfully exported from Tor Browser."
msgstr "> Bokmärkena har nu exporterats från Tor Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid ""
"A new window opens and you have to choose the location to save the file. The "
"file has a .json extension."
msgstr ""
"Ett nytt fönster öppnas där du väljer var filen ska sparas. Filen har "
"filändelsen .json."

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid ""
"After exporting the data from the browser, follow the above steps to import "
"the bookmark file into your Tor Browser."
msgstr ""
"När uppgifterna har exporterats från webbläsaren följer du stegen ovan för "
"att importera bokmärkesfilen till Tor Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid ""
"Bookmarks can be transferred from Firefox to Tor Browser. There are two ways "
"to export and import bookmarks in Firefox: [HTML file](https://"
"support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/export-firefox-bookmarks-to-backup-or-transfer) "
"or JSON file."
msgstr ""
"Bokmärken kan överföras från Firefox till Tor Browser. I Firefox finns två "
"sätt att exportera och importera bokmärken: en [HTML-fil](https://"
"support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/export-firefox-bookmarks-to-backup-or-transfer) "
"eller en JSON-fil."

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid ""
"Bookmarks in Tor Browser for Desktop can be exported, imported, backed up, "
"restored as well as imported from another browser."
msgstr ""
"Bokmärken i Tor Browser för datorer kan exporteras, importeras, "
"säkerhetskopieras och återställas samt importeras från en annan webbläsare."

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "Choose Backup"
msgstr "Välj Säkerhetskopiera"

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "Choose Export Bookmarks to HTML"
msgstr "Välj Exportera bokmärken till HTML"

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "Choose Import Bookmarks from HTML"
msgstr "Välj Importera bokmärken från HTML"

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "Choose Restore and then select the bookmark file you wish to restore."
msgstr "Välj Återställ och sedan bokmärkesfilen som du vill återställa."

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid ""
"Click okay to the pop up box that appears and hurray, you just restored your "
"backup bookmark."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på OK i popupfönstret som visas. Bokmärkessäkerhetskopian är nu "
"återställd."

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "Click the Open button. The Import Bookmarks File window will close."
msgstr "Klicka på knappen Öppna. Fönstret Importera bokmärkesfil stängs."

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "Click the Save button. The Export Bookmarks File window will close."
msgstr "Klicka på knappen Spara. Fönstret Exportera bokmärkesfil stängs."

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "Close the Library window."
msgstr "Stäng biblioteksfönstret."

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid ""
"Currently, on [Tor Browser for Android](https://www.torproject.org/download/"
"#android), there is no good way to export and import bookmarks. [Bug #31617]"
"(https://bugs.torproject.org/tpo/applications/tor-browser/31617)"
msgstr ""
"För närvarande finns inget bra sätt att exportera och importera bokmärken i "
"[Tor Browser för Android](https://www.torproject.org/download/#android). "
"[Fel #31617](https://bugs.torproject.org/tpo/applications/tor-browser/31617)"

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid ""
"From the toolbar on the Library window, click on the option to 'Import and "
"Backup'."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på alternativet ”Importera och säkerhetskopiera” i verktygsfältet i "
"biblioteksfönstret."

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "Hamburger menu >> Bookmarks >> Manage bookmarks (below the menu)"
msgstr "Hamburgermenyn >> Bokmärken >> Hantera bokmärken (längst ned i menyn)"

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "In order to manage your bookmarks in Tor Browser, go to:"
msgstr "Så hanterar du bokmärken i Tor Browser:"

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid ""
"In the Export Bookmarks File window that opens, choose a location to save "
"the file, which is named bookmarks.html by default. The desktop is usually a "
"good spot, but any place that is easy to remember will work."
msgstr ""
"Välj en plats i fönstret Exportera bokmärkesfil. Filen heter som standard "
"bookmarks.html. Skrivbordet är ofta lämpligt, men valfri plats som du lätt "
"kommer ihåg fungerar."

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid ""
"The bookmarks HTML file you saved is now ready to be imported into another "
"web browser."
msgstr ""
"Den sparade HTML-filen med bokmärken kan nu importeras till en annan "
"webbläsare."

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid "The instructions are similar on Windows, macOS and Linux."
msgstr "Anvisningarna är likartade i Windows, macOS och Linux."

#: content/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/export-and-import-bookmarks/
msgid ""
"Within the Import Bookmarks File window that opens, navigate to the "
"bookmarks HTML file you are importing and select the file."
msgstr ""
"Navigera till HTML-filen med bokmärken i fönstret Importera bokmärkesfil och "
"markera filen."

#: content/tor-browser/general/google-shows-foreign-languages/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/google-shows-foreign-languages/
msgid "Why does Google show up in foreign languages?"
msgstr "Varför visas Google på främmande språk?"

#: content/tor-browser/general/google-shows-foreign-languages/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/google-shows-foreign-languages/
msgid "Google shows foreign languages"
msgstr "Google visas på främmande språk"

#: content/tor-browser/general/google-shows-foreign-languages/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/google-shows-foreign-languages/
msgid ""
"Another method is to simply use your country code for accessing Google. This "
"can be google.be, google.de, google.us and so on."
msgstr ""
"En annan metod är att använda landskoden för Google, exempelvis google.be, "
"google.de eller google.us."

#: content/tor-browser/general/google-shows-foreign-languages/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/google-shows-foreign-languages/
msgid ""
"Google uses \"geolocation\" to determine where in the world you are, so it "
"can give you a personalized experience. This includes using the language it "
"thinks you prefer, and it also includes giving you different results on your "
"queries."
msgstr ""
"Google använder geolokalisering för att avgöra var i världen du befinner dig "
"och ge en anpassad upplevelse. Det omfattar både vilket språk Google tror "
"att du föredrar och vilka sökresultat som visas."

#: content/tor-browser/general/google-shows-foreign-languages/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/google-shows-foreign-languages/
msgid ""
"If you really want to see Google in English you can click the link that "
"provides that. But we consider this a feature with Tor, not a bug --- the "
"Internet is not flat, and it in fact does look different depending on where "
"you are. This feature reminds people of this fact."
msgstr ""
"Om du verkligen vill se Google på engelska kan du klicka på länken för det. "
"Vi ser detta som en funktion i Tor, inte ett fel. Internet är inte enhetligt "
"utan ser faktiskt olika ut beroende på var du befinner dig. Funktionen "
"påminner om det."

#: content/tor-browser/general/google-shows-foreign-languages/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/google-shows-foreign-languages/
msgid ""
"Note that Google search URLs take name/value pairs as arguments and one of "
"those names is \"hl\". If you set \"hl\" to \"en\" then Google will return "
"search results in English regardless of what Google server you have been "
"sent to. The changed link might look like this:"
msgstr ""
"Googles sök-URL:er använder namn/värde-par som argument, där ett av namnen "
"är ”hl”. Om du anger ”hl” till ”en” returnerar Google engelska sökresultat "
"oavsett vilken Google-server du skickas till. Den ändrade länken kan se ut "
"så här:"

#: content/tor-browser/general/google-shows-foreign-languages/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/google-shows-foreign-languages/
msgid "Foreign languages"
msgstr "Främmande språk"

#: content/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/
msgid ""
"While the names may imply otherwise, 'Incognito mode' and 'private tabs' do "
"not make you anonymous on the Internet."
msgstr ""
"Trots namnen gör ”inkognitoläge” och ”privata flikar” dig inte anonym på "
"internet."

#: content/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/
msgid ""
"What is the difference between using Tor Browser and Incognito mode or "
"private tabs?"
msgstr ""
"Vad är skillnaden mellan Tor Browser och inkognitoläge eller privata flikar?"

#: content/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/
msgid "Tor Browser and Incognito mode"
msgstr "Tor Browser och inkognitoläge"

#: content/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/
msgid ""
"Chrome and Firefox offer 'Incognito mode' and 'private tabs,' which erase "
"all local information from your device related to a browsing session once it "
"is closed."
msgstr ""
"Chrome och Firefox erbjuder inkognitoläge respektive privata flikar, som "
"raderar all lokal information på enheten från en surfsession när den stängs."

#: content/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/
msgid ""
"For more information regarding the limitations of Incognito mode and private "
"tabs, see Mozilla's article on [Common Myths about Private Browsing](https://"
"support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/common-myths-about-private-browsing)."
msgstr ""
"Mer information om begränsningarna i inkognitoläge och privata flikar finns "
"i Mozillas artikel om [vanliga myter kring privat surfning](https://"
"support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/common-myths-about-private-browsing)."

#: content/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/
msgid ""
"However, these modes do not provide any protection against online tracking "
"and have no measures in place to hide your activity or digital fingerprint "
"online."
msgstr ""
"Lägena skyddar dock inte mot spårning på nätet och innehåller inga åtgärder "
"för att dölja aktivitet eller digitala fingeravtryck."

#: content/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/
msgid ""
"This allows for a truly private browsing session, fully obfuscated from end-"
"to-end."
msgstr ""
"Det möjliggör en verkligt privat surfsession som är helt dold från början "
"till slut."

#: content/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/
msgid ""
"This means that an observer can collect your traffic just as easily as any "
"regular browser."
msgstr ""
"Det innebär att en observatör kan samla in trafiken lika enkelt som från en "
"vanlig webbläsare."

#: content/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tb-vs-incognito-mode/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser provides the same amnesic features as private tabs, while also "
"hiding your source IP address, browsing habits, and details about a device "
"that can be used to fingerprint activity across the web."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser har samma minneslösa funktioner som privata flikar och döljer "
"dessutom käll-IP-adressen, surfvanorna och uppgifter om enheten som kan "
"användas för fingeravtrycksspårning på webben."

#: content/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/
msgid ""
"Performance depends on network load, latency, and ongoing defenses against "
"attacks."
msgstr ""
"Prestandan beror på nätverksbelastning, latens och pågående skydd mot "
"attacker."

#: content/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser may feel slower than other browsers because traffic is routed "
"through relays around the world."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser kan kännas långsammare än andra webbläsare eftersom trafiken "
"leds genom reläer runt om i världen."

#: content/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/
msgid ""
"How can I make Tor run faster? Is Tor Browser slower than other browsers?"
msgstr ""
"Hur gör jag Tor snabbare? Är Tor Browser långsammare än andra webbläsare?"

#: content/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/
msgid "Tor Browser speed"
msgstr "Tor Browsers hastighet"

#: content/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/
msgid ""
"For the much more in-depth answer, see [Roger's blog post on the topic]"
"(https://blog.torproject.org/why-tor-slow-and-what-were-going-do-about-it/) "
"and [Tor's Open Research Topics: 2018 edition](https://blog.torproject.org/"
"tors-open-research-topics-2018-edition/) about Network Performance."
msgstr ""
"Ett mycket utförligare svar finns i [Rogers blogginlägg om ämnet](https://"
"blog.torproject.org/why-tor-slow-and-what-were-going-do-about-it/) och i "
"[Tors öppna forskningsfrågor: 2018 års utgåva](https://blog.torproject.org/"
"tors-open-research-topics-2018-edition/) om nätverksprestanda."

#: content/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/
msgid ""
"Furthermore, we have introduced a [Proof-of-Work Defense for Onion Services]"
"(https://blog.torproject.org/introducing-proof-of-work-defense-for-onion-"
"services/) to help mitigate some of these attacks."
msgstr ""
"Vi har dessutom infört ett [arbetsbevisbaserat skydd för onion-tjänster]"
"(https://blog.torproject.org/introducing-proof-of-work-defense-for-onion-"
"services/) som minskar effekten av vissa attacker."

#: content/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/
msgid ""
"That said, Tor is much faster than it used to be and you may not actually "
"notice any change in speed from other browsers."
msgstr ""
"Tor är dock mycket snabbare än tidigare, och du märker kanske ingen "
"hastighetsskillnad jämfört med andra webbläsare."

#: content/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/
msgid ""
"The Tor network has over a million daily users, and just over 6000 relays to "
"route all of their traffic, and the load on each server can sometimes cause "
"latency. And, by design, your traffic is bouncing through volunteers' "
"servers in various parts of the world, and some bottlenecks and network "
"latency will always be present."
msgstr ""
"Tor-nätverket har över en miljon dagliga användare och drygt 6 000 reläer "
"som ska transportera all trafik. Belastningen på varje server kan ibland "
"skapa latens. Trafiken studsar avsiktligt genom volontärers servrar i olika "
"delar av världen, så flaskhalsar och nätverkslatens kommer alltid att "
"förekomma."

#: content/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/
msgid "Using Tor Browser can sometimes be slower than other browsers."
msgstr "Tor Browser kan ibland vara långsammare än andra webbläsare."

#: content/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/
msgid ""
"You can also checkout our blog post [Tor Network Defense Against Ongoing "
"Attacks](https://blog.torproject.org/tor-network-ddos-attack/), which "
"discusses the Denial of Service (DoS) attacks on the Tor Network."
msgstr ""
"Läs även blogginlägget [Tor Network Defense Against Ongoing Attacks](https://"
"blog.torproject.org/tor-network-ddos-attack/), som diskuterar "
"överbelastningsattacker (DoS) mot Tor-nätverket."

#: content/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/tor-browser-speed/
msgid ""
"You can help improve the speed of the network by [running your own relay]"
"(https://community.torproject.org/relay/), or encouraging others to do so."
msgstr ""
"Du kan förbättra nätverkets hastighet genom att [driva ett eget relä]"
"(https://community.torproject.org/relay/) eller uppmuntra andra att göra det."

#: content/tor-browser/general/vpn-with-tor/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/vpn-with-tor/
msgid ""
"While it might seem like combining a VPN with Tor would increase privacy, in "
"practice it can reduce anonymity or break Tor's protections if not "
"configured correctly."
msgstr ""
"Det kan verka som om en VPN-tjänst tillsammans med Tor skulle stärka "
"integriteten, men i praktiken kan det minska anonymiteten eller bryta Tors "
"skydd om det inte konfigureras korrekt."

#: content/tor-browser/general/vpn-with-tor/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/vpn-with-tor/
msgid "Using Tor Browser with a VPN"
msgstr "Använda Tor Browser med en VPN-tjänst"

#: content/tor-browser/general/vpn-with-tor/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-browser/general/vpn-with-tor/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/vpn-with-tor/
msgid "Tor Browser with VPN"
msgstr "Tor Browser med VPN"

#: content/tor-browser/general/vpn-with-tor/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/vpn-with-tor/
msgid ""
"Generally speaking, we don't recommend using a VPN with Tor unless you're an "
"advanced user who knows how to configure both in a way that doesn't "
"compromise your privacy."
msgstr ""
"I allmänhet rekommenderar vi inte att Tor används med en VPN-tjänst, om du "
"inte är en avancerad användare som kan konfigurera båda utan att äventyra "
"integriteten."

#: content/tor-browser/general/vpn-with-tor/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/vpn-with-tor/
msgid ""
"You can find more detailed information about Tor + VPN at [our wiki](https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/legacy/trac/-/wikis/doc/TorPlusVPN)."
msgstr ""
"Utförligare information om Tor + VPN finns i [vår wiki](https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/legacy/trac/-/wikis/doc/TorPlusVPN)."

#: content/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/
msgid ""
"Sometimes websites block Tor users because they can't tell the difference "
"between the average Tor user and automated traffic."
msgstr ""
"Vissa webbplatser blockerar Tor-användare eftersom de inte kan skilja en "
"vanlig Tor-användare från automatiserad trafik."

#: content/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/
msgid "A website I am trying to reach is blocking access over Tor."
msgstr "En webbplats som jag försöker nå blockerar åtkomst via Tor."

#: content/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/
msgid "Website blocking access over Tor"
msgstr "Webbplats blockerar åtkomst via Tor"

#: content/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/
msgid ""
">\"Hi! I tried to access your site xyz.com while using Tor Browser and "
"discovered that you don't allow Tor users to access your site."
msgstr ""
">”Hej! Jag försökte besöka webbplatsen xyz.com med Tor Browser och upptäckte "
"att Tor-användare inte tillåts."

#: content/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/
msgid ""
">By blocking Tor users, you are likely blocking people in repressive "
"countries who want to use a free internet, journalists and researchers who "
"want to protect themselves from discovery, whistleblowers, activists, and "
"ordinary people who want to opt out of invasive third party tracking."
msgstr ""
">Genom att blockera Tor-användare blockerar ni sannolikt människor i "
"repressiva länder som vill använda ett fritt internet, journalister och "
"forskare som vill skydda sig från upptäckt, visselblåsare, aktivister och "
"vanliga människor som vill slippa påträngande spårning från tredje part."

#: content/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/
msgid ""
">I urge you to reconsider this decision; Tor is used by people all over the "
"world to protect their privacy and fight censorship."
msgstr ""
">Jag uppmanar er att ompröva beslutet. Människor över hela världen använder "
"Tor för att skydda sin integritet och bekämpa censur."

#: content/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/
msgid ""
">Please take a strong stance in favor of digital privacy and internet "
"freedom, and allow Tor users access to xyz.com. Thank you.\""
msgstr ""
">Ta tydlig ställning för digital integritet och internetfrihet och ge Tor-"
"användare åtkomst till xyz.com. Tack.”"

#: content/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/
msgid ""
"For example, if a bank knows you generally access their services from one "
"country, and suddenly you are connecting from an exit relay on the other "
"side of the world, your account may be locked or suspended."
msgstr ""
"Om en bank vet att du vanligtvis använder tjänsten från ett visst land och "
"du plötsligt ansluter från ett utgångsrelä på andra sidan världen kan kontot "
"låsas eller stängas av."

#: content/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/
msgid ""
"If you are unable to connect to an onion service, please follow these [steps "
"to troubleshoot](../../encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/)."
msgstr ""
"Om du inte kan ansluta till en onion-tjänst följer du dessa [felsökningssteg]"
"(../../encountering-issues/troubleshooting-onion-services/)."

#: content/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/
msgid ""
"In the case of banks, and other sensitive websites, it is also common to see "
"geography-based blocking."
msgstr ""
"Banker och andra känsliga webbplatser använder också ofta geografisk "
"blockering."

#: content/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/
msgid "Something like this might do the trick:"
msgstr "Något i den här stilen kan fungera:"

#: content/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/
msgid ""
"The Tor network is public, and websites can always detect when connections "
"are coming from Tor."
msgstr ""
"Tor-nätverket är offentligt och webbplatser kan alltid se att anslutningar "
"kommer från Tor."

#: content/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/
msgid ""
"The best success we've had in getting sites to unblock Tor users is getting "
"users to contact the site administrators directly."
msgstr ""
"Det mest framgångsrika sättet att få webbplatser att häva blockeringen av "
"Tor-användare är att användarna kontaktar webbplatsens administratörer "
"direkt."

#: content/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/general/website-blocking-tor-exits/
msgid "Blocking Tor"
msgstr "Blockering av Tor"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser is a privacy-focused web browser that routes your traffic "
"through the Tor network, hiding your real IP address, preventing tracking, "
"and protecting you against surveillance and censorship."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser är en integritetsinriktad webbläsare som leder trafiken genom "
"Tor-nätverket, döljer den riktiga IP-adressen, förhindrar spårning och "
"skyddar mot övervakning och censur."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid "Tor Browser uses the Tor network to protect your privacy and anonymity."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser använder Tor-nätverket för att skydda integriteten och "
"anonymiteten."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid "What is Tor Browser and how does it work?"
msgstr "Vad är Tor Browser och hur fungerar den?"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid "About Tor Browser"
msgstr "Om Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"By default, Tor Browser does not keep any browsing history. Cookies are only "
"valid for a single session (until Tor Browser is exited or a [New Identity]"
"(../../features/managing-identities/#new-identity) is requested)."
msgstr ""
"Som standard sparar Tor Browser ingen surfhistorik. Kakor gäller bara under "
"en session, tills Tor Browser avslutas eller du begär en [ny identitet]"
"(../../features/managing-identities/#new-identity)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"For this reason, we strongly discourage using Tor with any browser other "
"than Tor Browser."
msgstr ""
"Därför avråder vi starkt från att använda Tor med någon annan webbläsare än "
"Tor Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"It is specifically developed to resist online tracking and browser "
"fingerprinting, helping to prevent websites from identifying you based on "
"your browser configuration."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser är särskilt utvecklad för att motstå spårning på nätet och "
"webbläsarfingeravtryck och hjälper till att hindra webbplatser från att "
"identifiera dig utifrån webbläsarkonfigurationen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"Learn more about the [design of Tor Browser](https://gitlab.torproject.org/"
"tpo/applications/wiki/-/wikis/Design-Documents/Tor-Browser-Design-Doc)."
msgstr ""
"Läs mer om [Tor Browsers utformning](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/"
"applications/wiki/-/wikis/Design-Documents/Tor-Browser-Design-Doc)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid "The Tor network"
msgstr "Tor-nätverket"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"The image below illustrates a user browsing a website over Tor where the "
"traffic goes over multiple hops or relays, represented by the slices of "
"onion, and is encrypted and decrypted at each hop."
msgstr ""
"Bilden nedan visar en användare som besöker en webbplats via Tor. Trafiken "
"passerar flera hopp eller reläer, representerade av onion-skivorna, och "
"krypteras och dekrypteras vid varje hopp."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"The operators of the websites and services that you use, and anyone watching "
"them, will see a connection coming from the Tor network instead of your real "
"Internet (IP) address, and will not know who you are unless you explicitly "
"identify yourself."
msgstr ""
"Operatörerna av de webbplatser och tjänster som du använder och alla som "
"bevakar dem kommer att se en anslutning som kommer från Tor-nätverket "
"istället för din riktiga internetadress (IP) och vet inte vem du är om du "
"inte uttryckligen identifierar dig själv."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"These modifications include additional patches and [features](../../"
"features) that enhance privacy and security, making Tor Browser "
"fundamentally different from Firefox or any other browser."
msgstr ""
"Ändringarna omfattar ytterligare programfixar och [funktioner](../../"
"features) som stärker integriteten och säkerheten och gör Tor Browser "
"fundamentalt annorlunda än Firefox och andra webbläsare."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser is based on Mozilla Firefox ESR (Extended Support Release) but "
"has been heavily modified for use with the Tor network."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser bygger på Mozilla Firefox ESR (Extended Support Release) men har "
"ändrats kraftigt för användning med Tor-nätverket."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"Tor allows you to circumvent censorship by enabling access to websites and "
"online services that may be restricted or blocked in your region."
msgstr ""
"Tor låter dig kringgå censur genom att ge åtkomst till webbplatser och "
"nättjänster som är begränsade eller blockerade i din region."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"Tor is a network of virtual tunnels that allows you to improve your privacy "
"and security on the Internet. Tor works by sending your traffic through "
"three random servers (also known as *relays*) in the Tor network. The last "
"relay in the circuit (the \"exit relay\") then sends the traffic out onto "
"the public Internet."
msgstr ""
"Tor är ett nätverk av virtuella tunnlar som gör att du kan förbättra din "
"integritet och säkerhet på internet. Tor fungerar genom att skicka din "
"trafik via tre slumpmässiga servrar (även känd som *reläer*) i Tor-"
"nätverket. Det sista reläen i kretsen (\"exit relay\") skickar sedan "
"trafiken ut på det offentliga internet."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid "Using the Tor network has three main properties:"
msgstr "Att använda Tor-nätverket har tre huvudsakliga egenskaper:"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"While it is technically possible to route other browsers through Tor, doing "
"so exposes you to serious risks of deanonymization and information leakage."
msgstr ""
"Det är tekniskt möjligt att leda andra webbläsare genom Tor, men det medför "
"allvarliga risker för avanonymisering och informationsläckor."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/about-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"Your internet service provider, and anyone watching your connection locally, "
"will not be able to track your internet activity, including the names and "
"addresses of the websites you visit."
msgstr ""
"Din Internetleverantör och alla som bevakar din anslutning lokalt kommer "
"inte att kunna spåra din internetaktivitet, inklusive namn och adresser till "
"de webbplatser du besöker."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/contents.lr:section.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/
msgid "Understand the basics of Tor Browser."
msgstr "Lär dig grunderna i Tor Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid "If it's blocked, use our official mirrors or GetTor."
msgstr ""
"Om webbplatsen är blockerad använder du våra officiella speglar eller GetTor."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid "The safest way to download Tor Browser is from the official website."
msgstr ""
"Det säkraste sättet att hämta Tor Browser är från den officiella webbplatsen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid "How to download Tor Browser"
msgstr "Hur du hämtar Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid ""
"For example, to get links for downloading Tor Browser for Windows, send an "
"email to [gettor@torproject.org](mailto:gettor@torproject.org) with the word "
"\"windows\" in it."
msgstr ""
"För att till exempel få länkar för hämtning av Tor Browser för Windows, "
"skicka ett e-postmeddelande till [gettor@torproject.org]"
"(mailto:gettor@torproject.org) med ordet \"windows\" i det."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid "Get Tor Browser on Telegram"
msgstr "Hämta Tor Browser via Telegram"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid "Get Tor Browser via email"
msgstr "Hämta Tor Browser via e-post"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid ""
"GetTor is a service that automatically responds to messages with links to "
"the latest version of Tor Browser, hosted at a variety of locations, such as "
"Dropbox, Google Drive and GitHub."
msgstr ""
"GetTor är en tjänst som automatiskt svarar på meddelanden med länkar till "
"den senaste versionen av Tor Browser hos olika leverantörer, exempelvis "
"Dropbox, Google Drive och GitHub."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid ""
"GetTor will respond with an email containing links from which you can "
"download the Tor Browser package, the cryptographic signature (needed for "
"verifying the download), the fingerprint of the key used to make the "
"signature, and the package's checksum. You may be offered a choice of \"32-"
"bit\" or \"64-bit\" software: this depends on the model of the computer you "
"are using."
msgstr ""
"GetTor svarar med ett e-postmeddelande med länkar från vilka du kan hämta "
"Tor Browser-paketet, kryptografiska signaturen (behövs för att verifiera "
"hämtningen), fingeravtryck av den nyckel som används för att göra signaturen "
"och paketets kontrollsumma. Du kan erbjudas ett val av \"32-bitars\" eller "
"\"64-bitars\" programvara: detta beror på vilken modell av datorn du "
"använder."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid ""
"However, there may be times when you cannot access the Tor Project website: "
"for example, it could be blocked on your network."
msgstr ""
"Det kan dock finnas tillfällen då du inte kan komma åt Tor Projects "
"webbplats: till exempel kan den blockeras i ditt nätverk."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid ""
"If this happens, you can use one of the alternative download methods listed "
"below:"
msgstr ""
"Om detta händer kan du använda en av de alternativa hämtningsmetoderna som "
"anges nedan:"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid ""
"If you're unable to download Tor Browser from the official Tor Project "
"website, you can instead try downloading it from one of our official "
"mirrors, either through [EFF](https://tor.eff.org) or [La Cebolla](https://"
"lacebolla.net)."
msgstr ""
"Om du inte kan hämta Tor Browser från den officiella Tor Projects "
"webbplatsen kan du istället försöka hämta den från en av våra officiella "
"speglar, antingen via [EFF](https://tor.eff.org) eller [La Cebolla](https://"
"lacebolla.net)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid "Mirrors"
msgstr "Speglar"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid "Select your language."
msgstr "Välj ditt språk."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid "Send a message to [@GetTor_Bot](https://t.me/gettor_bot) on Telegram."
msgstr ""
"Skicka ett meddelande till [@GetTor_Bot](https://t.me/gettor_bot) på "
"Telegram."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid ""
"Send an email to [gettor@torproject.org](mailto:gettor@torproject.org), and "
"in the body of the message simply write \"windows\", \"osx\", \"linux\", or "
"\"android\" (without quotation marks) depending on your operating system."
msgstr ""
"Skicka ett e-postmeddelande till [gettor@torproject.org]"
"(mailto:gettor@torproject.org) och skriv endast ”windows”, ”osx”, ”linux” "
"eller ”android” i meddelandetexten, utan citattecken, beroende på "
"operativsystem."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid ""
"Tap on 'Send me Tor Browser' and choose your operating system. GetTor will "
"respond with a downloadable Tor Browser file and the signature which can be "
"used to verify the download."
msgstr ""
"Tryck på \"Skicka Tor Browser till mig\" och välj ditt operativsystem. "
"GetTor kommer att svara med en hämtningsbar Tor Browser-fil och signaturen "
"som kan användas för att verifiera hämtningen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid ""
"Tap on 'Send me other mirrors for Tor Browser' to download from one of the "
"official mirrors."
msgstr ""
"Tryck på \"Skicka mig andra speglar för Tor Browser\" för att hämta från en "
"av de officiella speglarna."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid ""
"The safest and simplest way to download Tor Browser is from the official Tor "
"Project website at https://www.torproject.org/download."
msgstr ""
"Det säkraste och enklaste sättet att hämta Tor Browser är från den "
"officiella Tor-projektwebbplatsen på https://www.torproject.org/download."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid "There are two options to download Tor Browser."
msgstr "Det finns två alternativ för att hämta Tor Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/downloading/
msgid ""
"Your connection to the site will be secured using HTTPS, which makes it much "
"harder for somebody to tamper with."
msgstr ""
"Anslutningen till webbplatsen skyddas med HTTPS, vilket gör det mycket "
"svårare för någon att manipulera den."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"Learn how to set your display language, connect to the Tor network, use "
"Connection Assist, and configure bridges or proxies when starting Tor "
"Browser for the first time."
msgstr ""
"Lär dig välja visningsspråk, ansluta till Tor-nätverket, använda "
"anslutningshjälpen och konfigurera broar eller proxyservrar när Tor Browser "
"startas första gången."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Running Tor Browser for the first time."
msgstr "Köra Tor Browser för första gången."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "First launch"
msgstr "Första starten"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"'Bridges' will display the [Circumvention](../../circumvention/) section to "
"configure a pluggable transport or to connect using [Bridges](../../"
"circumvention/using-bridges/)."
msgstr ""
"”Broar” öppnar avsnittet [Kringgå censur](../../circumvention/) där du kan "
"konfigurera en pluggbar transport eller ansluta med [broar](../../"
"circumvention/using-bridges/)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "A progress bar will appear indicating the connection progress."
msgstr "En förloppsindikator visas som anger anslutningsförloppet."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Choose display language"
msgstr "Välj visningsspråk"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Configure"
msgstr "Konfigurera"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Connect"
msgstr "Anslut"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"Connection Assist is a feature in Tor Browser for Android that when required "
"will offer to automatically apply the censorship circumvention method which "
"works best in your location."
msgstr ""
"Anslutningshjälpen är en funktion i Tor Browser för Android som vid behov "
"erbjuder sig att automatiskt använda den metod för att kringgå censur som "
"fungerar bäst där du befinner dig."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"If Connection Assist is unable to determine your location you can select "
"your region from the dropdown menu and click on 'Try a Bridge'."
msgstr ""
"Om Anslutningshjälp inte kan fastställa din plats kan du välja din region "
"från rullgardinsmenyn och klicka på \"Prova en bro\"."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"If Connection Assist is unable to determine your location you can select "
"your region from the dropdown options and then tap on 'Try a bridge'."
msgstr ""
"Om Connection Assist inte kan fastställa din plats kan du välja din region "
"från rullgardinsmenyn och sedan trycka på \"Prova en bro\"."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"If Tor is blocked in your location, trying a bridge may help. Connection "
"Assist can choose one for you using your location."
msgstr ""
"Om Tor är blockerat där du befinner dig kan det hjälpa att prova en bro. "
"Anslutningshjälp kan välja en åt dig baserat på din plats."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "If possible, ask your network administrator for guidance."
msgstr "Om möjligt, be administratören för ditt nätverk om hjälp."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"If toggled on, every time you open Tor Browser, it will try to connect with "
"your previously saved connection settings."
msgstr ""
"Om den är aktiverad kommer Tor Browser varje gång du öppnar den att försöka "
"ansluta med dina tidigare sparade anslutningsinställningar."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"If you are on a relatively fast connection, but this bar seems to get stuck "
"at a certain point, try the 'Connection Assist' or see the [Troubleshooting]"
"(../../encountering-issues/troubleshooting) page for help solving the "
"problem."
msgstr ""
"Om anslutningen är relativt snabb men förloppsindikatorn fastnar på en viss "
"punkt provar du anslutningshjälpen eller läser sidan [Felsökning](../../"
"encountering-issues/troubleshooting)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"If you know your connection is censored, or you have tried and failed to "
"connect to the Tor network and no other solutions have worked, you can "
"configure Tor Browser to use a pluggable transport."
msgstr ""
"Om du vet att din anslutning är censurerad, eller om du har försökt och "
"misslyckats med att ansluta till Tor-nätverket och inga andra lösningar har "
"fungerat, kan du konfigurera Tor Browser att använda en pluggbar transport."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "If your connection does not use a proxy, click \"Connect\"."
msgstr "Om din anslutning inte använder en proxy, klicka på ”Anslut”."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"If your connection is censored and the direct connection to the Tor network "
"fails, Connection Assist might help."
msgstr ""
"Om din anslutning är censurerad och den direkta anslutningen till Tor-"
"nätverket misslyckas kan Anslutningshjälp hjälpa till."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"If your connection uses a proxy you can configure it by clicking on "
"'Settings ...' against 'Configure how Tor Browser connects to the Internet'."
msgstr ""
"Om din anslutning använder en proxy kan du konfigurera den genom att klicka "
"på \"Inställningar ...\" intill \"Konfigurera hur Tor Browser ansluter till "
"internet\"."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"In most cases, choosing \"Connect\" will allow you to connect to the Tor "
"network without any further configuration."
msgstr ""
"I de flesta fall, om du väljer \"Anslut\" kan du ansluta till Tor-nätverket "
"utan ytterligare konfiguration."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"In most cases, this is not necessary. You will usually know if you need to "
"select this checkbox because the same settings will be used for other "
"browsers on your system."
msgstr ""
"I de flesta fall är detta inte nödvändigt. Du vet vanligtvis om du behöver "
"markera den här kryssrutan eftersom samma inställningar kommer att användas "
"för andra webbläsare på ditt system."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"In the \"Language\" settings, select your desired display language from the "
"dropdown menu."
msgstr ""
"I inställningarna för \"Språk\" väljer du önskat visningsspråk från "
"rullgardinsmenyn."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"Once clicked, a status bar will appear, showing Tor's connection progress."
msgstr ""
"När du klickar på den visas en statusfält som visar Tors anslutningsförlopp."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"Or, if you know that your connection is censored or uses a proxy, you should "
"click on \"Configure Connection\"."
msgstr ""
"Eller, om du vet att din anslutning är censurerad eller använder en proxy, "
"bör du klicka på \"Konfigurera anslutning\"."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Select your desired display language."
msgstr "Välj önskat visningsspråk."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Tap on \"Connect\" to initiate a connection to the Tor network."
msgstr "Tryck på \"Anslut\" för att initiera en anslutning till Tor-nätverket."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Tap on 'Language'."
msgstr "Tryck på \"Språk\"."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Tap on 'Settings' (⚙️)."
msgstr "Tryck på 'Inställningar' (⚙️)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Tap on 'Try a bridge'."
msgstr "Tryck på \"Prova en bro\"."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"The Connection Assist informs you about the state of your Internet "
"connection and your connection to the Tor network."
msgstr ""
"Anslutningshjälpen informerar dig om statusen för din internetanslutning och "
"din anslutning till Tor-nätverket."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "The first toggle is 'Always connect automatically'."
msgstr "Den första växlingsknappen är \"Anslut alltid automatiskt\"."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"This offers you the option to either connect directly to the Tor network, or "
"to configure Tor Browser for your connection."
msgstr ""
"Detta ger dig möjlighet att antingen ansluta direkt till Tor-nätverket eller "
"att konfigurera Tor Browser för din anslutning."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "To choose your display language:"
msgstr "Så här väljer du visningsspråk:"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"Toggle on \"Always connect automatically\" to allow Tor Browser connect to "
"the Tor network automatically with the previously saved connection settings, "
"everytime the browser is launched."
msgstr ""
"Aktivera \"Anslut alltid automatiskt\" för att tillåta att Tor Browser "
"ansluter till Tor-nätverket automatiskt med de tidigare sparade "
"anslutningsinställningarna varje gång webbläsaren startas."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser is available in multiple languages and you can change the "
"display language by clicking on \"Change Language\"."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser finns på flera språk och du kan ändra visningsspråk genom att "
"klicka på ”Ändra språk”."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Tor Browser is available in multiple languages."
msgstr "Tor Browser finns på flera språk."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Tor Browser will take you through a series of configuration options."
msgstr "Tor Browser kommer ta dig igenom en serie konfigurationsinställningar."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"When you launch Tor Browser for Android the display language is set to the "
"default language of your system."
msgstr ""
"När du startar Tor Browser för Android är visningsspråket inställt på "
"systemets standardspråk."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"When you launch Tor Browser the display language is set to the default "
"language of your system."
msgstr ""
"När du startar Tor Browser är visningsspråket inställt på systemets "
"standardspråk."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"When you run Tor Browser for the first time, you will see the option to "
"connect directly to the Tor network, or to configure Tor Browser for your "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"När du kör Tor Browser för första gången ser du alternativet att ansluta "
"direkt till Tor-nätverket eller att konfigurera Tor Browser för din "
"anslutning."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "When you start Tor Browser, you will see the Connect to Tor window."
msgstr ""
"När du startar Tor Browser kommer du att se fönstret ”Anslut till Tor”."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Change Tor Browser's display language"
msgstr "Ändra Tor Browsers visningsspråk"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Click 'Configure Connection' to adjust network settings"
msgstr ""
"Klicka på ”Konfigurera anslutningen” för att ändra nätverksinställningarna"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Configure Tor bridge"
msgstr "Konfigurera Tor-bro"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:figure.text
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Connect Automatically"
msgstr "Anslut automatiskt"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Connect to Tor Browser for Android"
msgstr "Anslut Tor Browser för Android"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Connection Assist automatic"
msgstr "Automatisk anslutningshjälp"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Connection Assist configuration"
msgstr "Konfiguration av anslutningshjälpen"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Connection Assist for Tor Browser Android"
msgstr "Anslutningshjälp för Tor Browser för Android"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Connection Test success"
msgstr "Anslutningstestet lyckades"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Connection Test unsuccessful"
msgstr "Anslutningstestet misslyckades"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Proxy settings for Tor Browser"
msgstr "Proxyinställningar för Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Select display language of Tor Browser"
msgstr "Välj visningsspråk för Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser is available for Android, Windows, macOS, and Linux. This "
"section explains the system requirements and installation steps for each "
"platform."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser finns för Android, Windows, macOS och Linux. Avsnittet beskriver "
"systemkrav och installationssteg för varje plattform."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "How to install Tor Browser"
msgstr "Så installerar du Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Installing"
msgstr "Installera"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "**Note:**"
msgstr "**Obs!**"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"**Note:** If these steps do not work, please try the following command-line "
"method."
msgstr ""
"**Obs:** Om dessa steg inte fungerar kan du prova följande kommandoradsmetod."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"**Note:** If this command fails to run, you probably need to make the file "
"executable. From within this directory run: `chmod +x start-tor-"
"browser.desktop`"
msgstr ""
"**Obs:** Om det här kommandot inte körs behöver du förmodligen göra filen "
"körbar. Kör följande från den här katalogen: `chmod +x start-tor-"
"browser.desktop`"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"**Note:** If you are unsure of the type of architecture supported by your "
"Android device, it is advised to install Tor Browser for Android only from "
"the app stores, i.e. [Google Play Store](#install-tba-play-store) or [F-"
"Droid](#install-tba-fdroid)."
msgstr ""
"**Obs!** Om du är osäker på vilken typ av arkitektur som stöds av din "
"Android-enhet rekommenderas det att du endast installerar Tor Browser för "
"Android från appbutikerna, dvs. [Google Play Store](#install-tba-play-store) "
"eller [F-Droid](#install-tba-fdroid)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"1. Navigate to the Tor Browser [download page](https://www.torproject.org/"
"download)."
msgstr ""
"1. Gå till Tor Browsers [hämtningssida](https://www.torproject.org/download)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "2. Download the Linux `.tar.xz` file."
msgstr "2. Hämta Linux `.tar.xz`-filen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "2. Download the Windows `.exe` file."
msgstr "2. Hämta `.exe`-filen för Windows."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "2. Download the macOS `.dmg` file."
msgstr "2. Hämta `.dmg`-filen för macOS."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"3. (Recommended) Verify the [file's signature](../verifying-tor-browser/)."
msgstr ""
"3. (Rekommenderas) Verifiera [filens signatur](../verifying-tor-browser/)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid ""
"32-bit Linux (on x86) is no longer widely supported by the vast majority of "
"Linux distributions, and with Firefox dropping support, it is no longer "
"feasible to maintain Tor Browser for the platform."
msgstr ""
"32-bitars Linux på x86 stöds inte längre brett av de flesta Linux-"
"distributioner. När även Firefox upphör med stödet är det inte längre "
"möjligt att underhålla Tor Browser för plattformen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "4. Now follow either the graphical or the command-line method:"
msgstr "4. Följ nu antingen den grafiska metoden eller kommandoradsmetoden:"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"4. When the download is complete, double click the `.dmg` file. Complete the "
"installation wizard process."
msgstr ""
"4. När hämtningen är klar, dubbelklicka på `.dmg`-filen. Slutför "
"installationsguiden."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"4. When the download is complete, double click the `.exe` file. Complete the "
"installation wizard process."
msgstr ""
"4. När hämtningen är klar, dubbelklicka på `.exe`-filen. Slutför "
"installationsguiden."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Aarch64, Arm, x86_64 and x86 architectures."
msgstr "Arkitekturerna Aarch64, Arm, x86_64 och x86."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"Add the official [Guardian Project App Repository](https://"
"guardianproject.info/fdroid/)."
msgstr ""
"Lägg till det officiella [apparkivet för Guardian Project](https://"
"guardianproject.info/fdroid/)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Android 5.0 or newer."
msgstr "Android 5.0 eller senare."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"By default, the installer places Tor Browser in your **Downloads** or "
"**Desktop** folder."
msgstr ""
"Installationsprogrammet placerar som standard Tor Browser i mappen "
"**Hämtningar** eller på **skrivbordet**."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Click on the `start-tor-browser.desktop` file to launch the browser."
msgstr ""
"Klicka på filen `start-tor-browser.desktop` för att starta webbläsaren."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Command-line method"
msgstr "Kommandoradsmetod"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Confirm by tapping on \"Add Repository\"."
msgstr "Bekräfta genom att trycka på \"Lägg till arkiv\"."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"Download Onion Browser from the [App Store](https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/"
"onion-browser/id519296448)."
msgstr ""
"Hämta Onion Browser från [App Store](https://itunes.apple.com/us/app/onion-"
"browser/id519296448)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/download-and-install/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/download-and-install/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/download-and-install/
msgid "Download and Install"
msgstr "Hämta och installera"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"Download the F-Droid app on your Android device from the [F-Droid website]"
"(https://f-droid.org/)."
msgstr ""
"Hämta F-Droid-appen till din Android-enhet från [F-Droids webbplats](https://"
"f-droid.org/)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"From inside the Tor Browser directory, you can launch Tor Browser by running:"
msgstr "Från Tor Browser-mappen kan du starta Tor Browser genom att köra:"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"From the navigation bar on the bottom of the screen, tap on \"Settings\" (⚙️)."
msgstr ""
"Tryck på \"Inställningar\" (⚙️) i navigeringsfältet längst ner på skärmen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Google Play"
msgstr "Google Play"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Graphical method"
msgstr "Grafisk metod"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"However, Apple requires browsers on iOS to use something called Webkit, "
"which prevents Onion Browser from having the same privacy protections as Tor "
"Browser."
msgstr ""
"Apple kräver dock att webbläsare på iOS använder något som kallas Webkit, "
"vilket förhindrar att Onion Browser har samma integritetsskydd som Tor "
"Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"However, because we have not audited the app in Chrome OS, we don't know if "
"all the privacy features of Tor Browser for Android will work well."
msgstr ""
"Eftersom vi inte har granskat appen i Chrome OS vet vi dock inte om alla "
"integritetsfunktioner i Tor Browser för Android fungerar korrekt."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "If you installed Tor Browser but cannot find it:"
msgstr "Om du har installerat Tor Browser men inte hittar programmet:"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"If you still can't locate it, try installing again and pay attention to the "
"directory path shown in the installer - choose a folder you'll remember "
"easily."
msgstr ""
"Om du fortfarande inte hittar det installerar du igen och uppmärksammar "
"sökvägen som visas i installationsprogrammet. Välj en mapp som du lätt "
"kommer ihåg."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Install the F-Droid Android package file and launch the app."
msgstr "Installera F-Droid Android-paketfilen och starta appen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"It might take a few moments for F-Droid to download the list of apps from "
"the Guardian Project App Repository."
msgstr ""
"Det kan ta en liten stund för F-Droid att hämta listan över appar från "
"apparkivet för Guardian Project."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Navigate back to F-Droid's home page."
msgstr "Gå tillbaka till F-Droids startsida."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Navigate to the Tor Browser directory."
msgstr "Gå till Tor Browser-mappen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Note about Chrome OS"
msgstr "Information om Chrome OS"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Once installed, look for the **Tor Browser** folder in that location."
msgstr ""
"När programmet har installerats letar du efter mappen **Tor Browser** på den "
"platsen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Operating Systems (32-bit and 64-bit):"
msgstr "Operativsystem (32-bitars och 64-bitars):"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "See here on how to [update Tor Browser](../updating/)."
msgstr "Se här om hur du [uppdaterar Tor Browser](../updating/)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid ""
"Support for 32-bit Linux operating systems (i686 architecture) will be "
"discontinued with the next major Tor Browser Release, Tor Browser 16.0."
msgstr ""
"Stödet för 32-bitars Linux-operativsystem med i686-arkitektur upphör i nästa "
"större Tor Browser-utgåva, Tor Browser 16.0."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "System requirements"
msgstr "Systemkrav"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Tap on \"+\" to add a new repository."
msgstr "Tryck på \"+\" för att lägga till ett nytt arkiv."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Tap on \"Search\" (🔍) and query for \"Tor Browser for Android\"."
msgstr "Tryck på \"Sök\" (🔍) och sök efter \"Tor Browser för Android\"."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"Tap on \"Tor Browser for Android\" and then tap on \"Install\" to install "
"the app."
msgstr ""
"Tryck på \"Tor Browser för Android\" och sedan på \"Installera\" för att "
"installera appen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"The Guardian Project provides Tor Browser for Android on the [Guardian "
"Project Official App Repository](https://guardianproject.info/fdroid/) for F-"
"Droid."
msgstr ""
"Guardian Project tillhandahåller Tor Browser för Android på [Guardian "
"Projects officiella apparkiv](https://guardianproject.info/fdroid/) för F-"
"Droid."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"The installer also creates a **shortcut on your Desktop**, unless you "
"deselected that option during installation."
msgstr ""
"Installationsprogrammet skapar även ett **kortkommando på skrivbordet**, om "
"du inte avmarkerade alternativet under installationen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "There is no Tor Browser for iOS."
msgstr "Det finns ingen Tor Browser för iOS."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"To install Tor Browser for Android from F-Droid please follow these steps:"
msgstr ""
"För att installera Tor Browser för Android från F-Droid, följ dessa steg:"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"To register Tor Browser as a desktop application and have it accessible from "
"the application menus run this command:"
msgstr ""
"För att registrera Tor Browser som ett skrivbordsprogram och göra det "
"tillgängligt från programmenyerna, kör följande kommando:"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser for Android is available on the Play Store, F-Droid, the Tor "
"Project website and [GetTor](../downloading)."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser för Android finns i Play Butik, F-Droid, på Tor-projektets "
"webbplats och via [GetTor](../downloading)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser for Android is based on Mozilla Firefox for Android and is "
"available for:"
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser för Android är baserad på Mozilla Firefox för Android och är "
"tillgänglig för:"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser is supported on any modern Linux-based operating system. Please "
"[reach out](../../../get-in-touch/user-support/) if you encounter any issues "
"while installing."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser stöds på alla moderna Linux-baserade operativsystem. [Kontakta "
"oss](../../../get-in-touch/user-support/) om du får problem under "
"installationen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Under the \"My Apps\" section, tap on \"Repositories\"."
msgstr "Under avsnittet \"Mina appar\" trycker du på \"Arkiv\"."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"Unfortunately, we don't yet have a version of Tor Browser for Chrome OS."
msgstr "Det finns tyvärr ännu ingen version av Tor Browser för Chrome OS."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"We recommend an iOS app called **[Onion Browser](https://"
"onionbrowser.com/)**, which is open source, uses Tor routing, and is "
"developed by someone who works closely with the Tor Project."
msgstr ""
"Vi rekommenderar iOS-appen **[Onion Browser](https://onionbrowser.com/)**. "
"Den har öppen källkod, använder Tor-dirigering och utvecklas av en person "
"som samarbetar nära med Tor-projektet."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid ""
"We strongly advise users to install Tor Browser on a 64-bit Linux operating "
"system for latest updates and access to security features provided by Tor "
"Browser."
msgstr ""
"Vi rekommenderar starkt att Tor Browser installeras på ett 64-bitars Linux-"
"operativsystem för att få de senaste uppdateringarna och "
"säkerhetsfunktionerna."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"When the download is complete, extract the archive using an archive manager."
msgstr "Packa upp arkivet med en arkivhanterare när hämtningen är klar."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"When the download is complete, extract the archive with the command `tar -xf "
"[TB archive]`."
msgstr ""
"Packa upp arkivet med kommandot `tar -xf [TB archive]` när hämtningen är "
"klar."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Where to locate Tor Browser"
msgstr "Här finns Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Windows 10"
msgstr "Windows 10"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "Windows 11"
msgstr "Windows 11"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"You can install Tor Browser for Android from [Google Play Store](https://"
"play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.torproject.torbrowser)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan installera Tor Browser för Android från [Google Play-butiken](https://"
"play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=org.torproject.torbrowser)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"You could run [Tor Browser for Android](https://www.torproject.org/download/"
"#android) on Chrome OS. Note that by using Tor Mobile on Chrome OS, you will "
"view the mobile (not desktop) versions of websites."
msgstr ""
"Du kan köra [Tor Browser för Android](https://www.torproject.org/download/"
"#android) i Chrome OS. Observera att Tor Mobile i Chrome OS visar "
"mobilversioner, inte datorversioner, av webbplatser."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid ""
"[Learn more about Onion Browser](https://blog.torproject.org/tor-heart-onion-"
"browser-and-more-ios-tor)."
msgstr ""
"[Läs mer om Onion Browser](https://blog.torproject.org/tor-heart-onion-"
"browser-and-more-ios-tor)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "macOS 10.15 and later."
msgstr "macOS 10.15 och senare."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/installing/
msgid "iOS"
msgstr "iOS"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/languages/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/languages/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser is available in many languages. You can select your preferred "
"language when installing or running Tor Browser, and you can help us add "
"more through translation."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser finns på många språk. Du kan välja önskat språk vid installation "
"eller körning och hjälpa oss att lägga till fler genom att översätta."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/languages/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/languages/
msgid "Getting Tor Browser in your preferred language"
msgstr "Hämta Tor Browser på önskat språk"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/languages/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/languages/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/languages/
msgid "Language support"
msgstr "Språkstöd"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/languages/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/languages/
msgid "Our current list of supported languages is:"
msgstr "Följande språk stöds för närvarande:"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/languages/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/languages/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser is already available in multiple languages, and we continue to "
"add more with the help of our community."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser finns redan på flera språk och vi fortsätter lägga till fler med "
"hjälp av gemenskapen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/languages/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/languages/
msgid ""
"Want to help us translate? [Become a Tor translator!](https://"
"community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/)"
msgstr ""
"Vill du hjälpa oss att översätta? [Bli Tor-översättare!](https://"
"community.torproject.org/localization/becoming-tor-translator/)"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/languages/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/languages/
msgid "We want everyone to be able to enjoy Tor Browser in their own language."
msgstr "Vi vill att alla ska kunna använda Tor Browser på sitt eget språk."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/
msgid ""
"If preferred, Tor Browser may be made portable by extracting it from its "
"archive directly onto removable media such as a USB stick or SD card."
msgstr ""
"Om så önskas kan Tor Browser göras portabel genom att extrahera den från "
"sitt arkiv direkt till flyttbara medier som ett USB-minne eller SD-kort."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/
msgid ""
"It is recommended to use writable media so that Tor Browser can be updated "
"as required."
msgstr ""
"Det rekommenderas att använda skrivbara medier så att Tor Browser kan "
"uppdateras vid behov."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/
msgid "Running Tor Browser from a USB stick or SD card"
msgstr "Köra Tor Browser från ett USB-minne eller SD-kort"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/
msgid "Making Tor Browser portable"
msgstr "Göra Tor Browser portabel"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/
msgid ""
"1. Plug in your removable media and format it. Any filesystem type will work."
msgstr ""
"1. Anslut och formatera det flyttbara lagringsmediet. Alla filsystem "
"fungerar."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/
msgid ""
"1. Plug in your removable media and format it. You *must* use Mac OS "
"Extended (Journaled) format."
msgstr ""
"1. Anslut din flyttbara media och formatera den. Du *måste* använda Mac OS "
"Extended (Journaled)-format."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/
msgid ""
"2. Navigate to the Tor Browser [download page](https://torproject.org/"
"download)."
msgstr ""
"2. Navigera till Tor Browser [hämtningssida](https://torproject.org/"
"download)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/
msgid ""
"3. Download the Linux `.tar.xz` file and save it directly to your media."
msgstr "3. Hämta Linux-filen `.tar.xz` och spara den direkt på lagringsmediet."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/
msgid "3. Download the Windows `.exe` file and save it directly to your media."
msgstr "3. Hämta Windows-filen `.exe` och spara den direkt på lagringsmediet."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/
msgid "3. Download the macOS `.dmg` file and save it directly to your media."
msgstr "3. Hämta macOS-filen `.dmg` och spara den direkt på lagringsmediet."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/
msgid ""
"4. (Recommended) Verify the [files signature](../verifying-tor-browser/)."
msgstr ""
"4. (Rekommenderas) Verifiera [filernas signatur](../verifying-tor-browser/)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/
msgid ""
"5. When the download is complete, click the `.dmg` file and begin the "
"installation process."
msgstr ""
"5. När hämtningen är klar klickar du på `.dmg`-filen och påbörjar "
"installationsprocessen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/
msgid ""
"5. When the download is complete, click the `.exe` file and begin the "
"installation process."
msgstr ""
"5. När hämtningen är klar klickar du på `.exe`-filen och påbörjar "
"installationsprocessen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/
msgid ""
"5. When the download is complete, extract the archive onto the media as well."
msgstr "5. När hämtningen är klar, extrahera även arkivet till mediet."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/making-tor-browser-portable/
msgid ""
"6. When the installer asks where to install Tor Browser, select your "
"removable media."
msgstr ""
"6. När installationsprogrammet frågar var Tor Browser ska installeras, välj "
"ditt flyttbara medium."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid ""
"Follow the instructions below to completely remove Tor Browser from your "
"device."
msgstr ""
"Följ anvisningarna nedan för att helt ta bort Tor Browser från enheten."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid ""
"Instead, removal is as simple as deleting the Tor Browser folder or "
"application and any related data."
msgstr ""
"Det räcker att ta bort Tor Browser-mappen eller appen och tillhörande data."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser does not integrate with your system's standard uninstall "
"utilities."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser integreras inte med systemets vanliga avinstallationsverktyg."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid "How to uninstall Tor Browser"
msgstr "Så avinstallerar du Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid "Uninstalling"
msgstr "Avinstallera"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/uninstall/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/update/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/uninstall/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/update/
msgid "At the top right, tap the profile icon."
msgstr "Tryck på profilikonen uppe till höger."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid "Delete the Tor Browser folder or application."
msgstr "Ta bort Tor Browser-mappen eller appen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid "Delete the Tor Browser folder."
msgstr "Ta bort Tor Browser-mappen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid ""
"Depending on your mobile device's brand, navigate to Settings > Apps, then "
"select Tor Browser and tap on the \"Uninstall\" button."
msgstr ""
"Beroende på din mobila enhets märke, gå till Inställningar > Appar, välj "
"sedan Tor Browser och tryck på knappen \"Avinstallera\"."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid "Empty your Trash."
msgstr "Töm din papperskorg."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid "Go to your `~/Library/Application Support/` folder."
msgstr "Gå till din mapp `~/Library/Application Support/`."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid ""
"Launch a terminal window in the Tor Browser folder and run this command to "
"unregister Tor Browser as a desktop application: `./start-tor-"
"browser.desktop --unregister-app`"
msgstr ""
"Starta ett terminalfönster i Tor Browser-mappen och kör följande kommando "
"för att avregistrera Tor Browser som ett skrivbordsprogram: `./start-tor-"
"browser.desktop --unregister-app`"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid "Locate the TorBrowser-Data folder and move it to Trash."
msgstr "Leta reda på mappen TorBrowser-Data och flytta den till papperskorgen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid ""
"Locate your Tor Browser application. The default location is the "
"Applications folder."
msgstr "Leta reda på Tor Browser-appen. Standardplatsen är mappen Program."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid ""
"Locate your Tor Browser folder or application. The default location is the "
"Desktop."
msgstr ""
"Leta reda på din Tor Browser-mapp eller ditt program. Standardplatsen är "
"skrivbordet."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid ""
"Locate your Tor Browser folder. On Linux, there is no default location, "
"however the folder will be named \"tor-browser\"."
msgstr ""
"Leta reda på din Tor Browser-mapp. På Linux finns det ingen standardplats, "
"men mappen kommer att heta \"tor-browser\"."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid "Move the Tor Browser application to Trash."
msgstr "Flytta Tor Browser-appen till papperskorgen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid ""
"Note that if you did not install Tor Browser in the default location (the "
"Applications folder), then the TorBrowser-Data folder is not located in the "
"`~/Library/Application Support/` folder, but in the same folder where you "
"installed Tor Browser."
msgstr ""
"Observera att om du inte installerade Tor Browser på standardplatsen (mappen "
"Program), så finns inte mappen TorBrowser-Data i mappen `~/Library/"
"Application Support/`, utan i samma mapp där du installerade Tor Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid ""
"Note that your operating system's standard \"Uninstall\" utility is not used."
msgstr ""
"Observera att ditt operativsystems standardverktyg \"Avinstallera\" inte "
"används."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid ""
"Note the Library folder is hidden on newer versions of macOS. To navigate to "
"this folder in Finder, select \"Go to Folder...\" in the \"Go\" menu."
msgstr ""
"Observera att mappen Bibliotek är dold i nyare versioner av macOS. För att "
"navigera till den här mappen i Finder, välj \"Gå till mapp...\" i \"Gå\"-"
"menyn."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid ""
"On the next screen, select Tor Browser and then tap on the \"Uninstall\" "
"button."
msgstr ""
"På nästa skärm väljer du Tor Browser och trycker sedan på knappen "
"\"Avinstallera\"."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/uninstall/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/update/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/uninstall/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/update/
msgid "Open the Google Play Store app."
msgstr "Öppna Google Play Butik-appen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/uninstall/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/update/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/uninstall/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/update/
msgid "Tap on \"Settings\", then go to \"Manage installed apps\"."
msgstr ""
"Tryck på \"Inställningar\" och gå sedan till \"Hantera installerade appar\"."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/uninstall/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/update/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/uninstall/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/update/
msgid "Tap on 'Manage apps and devices'."
msgstr "Tryck på \"Hantera appar och enheter\"."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/uninstall/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/uninstall/
msgid "Tap on 'Uninstall'."
msgstr "Tryck på 'Avinstallera'."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid ""
"Tap on Tor Browser for Android from the list of apps installed on your "
"device."
msgstr ""
"Tryck på Tor Browser för Android i listan över appar som är installerade på "
"din enhet."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/uninstall/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/update/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/uninstall/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/update/
msgid "Tap on the 'Manage' tab."
msgstr "Tryck på fliken 'Hantera'."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid "Then type `~/Library/Application Support/` in the window and click Go."
msgstr ""
"Skriv sedan `~/Library/Application Support/` i fönstret och klicka på Gå."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser for Android can be uninstalled directly from F-Droid, Google "
"Play or from your mobile device's app settings."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser för Android kan avinstalleras direkt från F-Droid, Google Play "
"eller från din mobila enhets appinställningar."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid "Uninstall from F-Droid store"
msgstr "Avinstallera från F-Droid"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid "Uninstall from the Google Play store"
msgstr "Avinstallera från Google Play Butik"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid "Uninstalling from the device settings"
msgstr "Avinstallera via enhetens inställningar"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid "Go to folder menu option"
msgstr "Menyalternativet Gå till mapp"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid "Go to folder window"
msgstr "Fönstret Gå till mapp"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid "Uninstalling Tor Browser for Android on F-Droid"
msgstr "Avinstallera Tor Browser för Android från F-Droid"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid "Uninstalling Tor Browser for Android on Google Play"
msgstr "Avinstallera Tor Browser för Android från Google Play"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/uninstalling/
msgid "Uninstalling Tor Browser for Android using device app settings"
msgstr "Avinstallera Tor Browser för Android via enhetens appinställningar"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid "Keep Tor Browser updated to protect your privacy and security."
msgstr ""
"Håll Tor Browser uppdaterad för att skydda integriteten och säkerheten."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid ""
"Using an outdated Tor Browser puts you at risk of serious vulnerabilities "
"and deanonymization."
msgstr ""
"En föråldrad Tor Browser utsätter dig för allvarliga sårbarheter och risk "
"för avanonymisering."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid "How to keep Tor Browser up to date"
msgstr "Så håller du Tor Browser uppdaterad"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid "Updating"
msgstr "Uppdatera"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid ""
"1. Download the latest Tor Browser Android package (`apk`) file from the "
"[Tor Project website](https://www.torproject.org/download/#android), one of "
"the official Mirror sites or GetTor."
msgstr ""
"1. Hämta den senaste Android-paketfilen (`apk`) för Tor Browser från [Tor-"
"projektets webbplats](https://www.torproject.org/download/#android), en "
"officiell spegelwebbplats eller GetTor."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid "2. Install the `apk` file."
msgstr "2. Installera `apk`-filen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid ""
"3. In most cases, this latest version of Tor Browser for Android will "
"install over the older version, thereby upgrading the browser."
msgstr ""
"3. I de flesta fall installeras den senaste versionen av Tor Browser för "
"Android ovanpå den äldre och uppgraderar webbläsaren."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid ""
"4. If doing this fails to update the browser, you may have to [uninstall](../"
"uninstalling/#android) Tor Browser before reinstalling it."
msgstr ""
"4. Om webbläsaren inte uppdateras kan du behöva [avinstallera](../"
"uninstalling/#android) Tor Browser innan du installerar om den."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid ""
"On the next screen, select Tor Browser and then tap on the \"Update\" button."
msgstr ""
"På nästa skärm väljer du Tor Browser och trycker sedan på knappen "
"\"Uppdatera\"."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid ""
"Remove Tor Browser from your system by deleting the folder that contains it "
"(see the [Uninstalling](../uninstalling) section for more information)."
msgstr ""
"Ta bort Tor Browser från ditt system genom att ta bort mappen som innehåller "
"den (se avsnittet [Avinstallera](../uninstalling) för mer information)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/update/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/update/
msgid "Tap on 'Update'."
msgstr "Tryck på 'Uppdatera'."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/update/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/update/
msgid "Tap on 'Updates available'"
msgstr "Tryck på \"Tillgängliga uppdateringar\""

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid ""
"Tap on Tor Browser for Android from the list of apps that need to be updated."
msgstr ""
"Tryck på Tor Browser för Android i listan över appar som behöver uppdateras."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser must be kept updated at all times. If you continue to use an "
"outdated version of the software, you may be vulnerable to serious security "
"flaws that compromise your privacy and anonymity."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser måste alltid hållas uppdaterad. Om du fortsätter använda en "
"föråldrad version kan allvarliga säkerhetsbrister äventyra integriteten och "
"anonymiteten."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser will prompt you to update the software once a new version has "
"been released: the main menu (≡) will display a green circle with an upwards "
"facing arrow in it, and you may see a written update indicator when Tor "
"Browser opens. You can update either automatically or manually."
msgstr ""
"När en ny version ges ut uppmanar Tor Browser dig att uppdatera. Huvudmenyn "
"(≡) visar en grön cirkel med en uppåtriktad pil, och en "
"uppdateringsindikator kan visas när Tor Browser öppnas. Du kan uppdatera "
"automatiskt eller manuellt."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid "UPDATING TOR BROWSER AUTOMATICALLY"
msgstr "AUTOMATISK UPPDATERING AV TOR BROWSER"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid "UPDATING TOR BROWSER MANUALLY"
msgstr "UPPDATERA TOR BROWSER MANUELLT"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid "Update from F-Droid store"
msgstr "Uppdatera från F-Droid"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid "Update from the Google Play Store"
msgstr "Uppdatera från Google Play Butik"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid "Update from the website, Tor mirror site or GetTor"
msgstr "Uppdatera från webbplatsen, en Tor-spegel eller GetTor"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid ""
"Visit https://www.torproject.org/download/ and download a copy of the latest "
"Tor Browser release, then install it as before."
msgstr ""
"Besök https://www.torproject.org/download/, hämta den senaste utgåvan av Tor "
"Browser och installera den på samma sätt som tidigare."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid ""
"Wait for the update to download and install, then Tor Browser will restart "
"itself. You will now be running the latest version."
msgstr ""
"Vänta tills uppdateringen har hämtats och installerats. Tor Browser startas "
"sedan om och kör den senaste versionen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid ""
"When you are prompted to update Tor Browser, click on the main menu (≡), "
"then select \"Update available - restart now\"."
msgstr ""
"När du uppmanas att uppdatera Tor Browser klickar du på huvudmenyn (≡) och "
"väljer sedan \"Uppdatering tillgänglig - starta om nu\"."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid ""
"When you are prompted to update Tor Browser, finish the browsing session and "
"close the program."
msgstr ""
"Avsluta surfsessionen och stäng programmet när du uppmanas att uppdatera Tor "
"Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid ""
"You can either update Tor Browser for Android from the app stores or "
"manually from the Tor Project website."
msgstr ""
"Du kan uppdatera Tor Browser för Android via appbutikerna eller manuellt "
"från Tor-projektets webbplats."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid "Prompt to update Tor Browser Desktop"
msgstr "Uppmaning att uppdatera Tor Browser för datorer"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid "Update progress bar"
msgstr "Förloppsindikator för uppdatering"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid "Updating Tor Browser for Android on F-Droid"
msgstr "Uppdatera Tor Browser för Android via F-Droid"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/updating/
msgid "Updating Tor Browser for Android on Google Play"
msgstr "Uppdatera Tor Browser för Android via Google Play"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"A digital signature is a process that ensures a package was generated by its "
"developers and has not been tampered with."
msgstr ""
"En digital signatur garanterar att ett paket skapades av utvecklarna och "
"inte har manipulerats."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"Below we explain why it is important and how to verify that the Tor Browser "
"you download is the one we created and has not been modified by an attacker."
msgstr ""
"Nedan förklarar vi varför detta är viktigt och hur du kontrollerar att den "
"hämtade Tor Browser är den som vi skapade och inte har ändrats av en "
"angripare."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid "How to verify Tor Browser's signature"
msgstr "Så verifierar du Tor Browsers signatur"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid "Verify Tor Browser's signature"
msgstr "Verifiera Tor Browsers signatur"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"Each file on our [download page](https://www.torproject.org/download/) is "
"accompanied by a file labelled \"signature\" with the same name as the "
"package and the extension \".asc\". These .asc files are OpenPGP signatures."
msgstr ""
"Varje fil på [hämtningssidan](https://www.torproject.org/download/) åtföljs "
"av en fil märkt ”signature” med samma namn som paketet och "
"filändelsen ”.asc”. Dessa .asc-filer är OpenPGP-signaturer."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"For GNU/Linux users (change x86_64 to i686 if you have the 32-bit package):"
msgstr ""
"För GNU/Linux-användare (ändra x86_64 till i686 om du har 32-bitarspaketet):"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"For Windows users (change x86_64 to i686 if you have the 32-bit package):"
msgstr ""
"För Windows-användare (ändra x86_64 till i686 om du har 32-bitarspaketet):"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"For example, `tor-browser-linux-x86_64-14.5.6.tar.xz` is accompanied by `tor-"
"browser-linux-x86_64-14.5.6.tar.xz.asc`."
msgstr ""
"Exempelvis åtföljs `tor-browser-linux-x86_64-14.5.6.tar.xz` av `tor-browser-"
"linux-x86_64-14.5.6.tar.xz.asc`."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"For example, `tor-browser-macos-14.5.6.dmg` is accompanied by `tor-browser-"
"macos-14.5.6.dmg.asc`."
msgstr ""
"Exempelvis åtföljs `tor-browser-macos-14.5.6.dmg` av `tor-browser-"
"macos-14.5.6.dmg.asc`."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"For example, `tor-browser-windows-x86_64-portable-13.0.1.exe` is accompanied "
"by `tor-browser-windows-x86_64-portable-13.0.1.exe.asc`."
msgstr ""
"Exempelvis åtföljs `tor-browser-windows-x86_64-portable-13.0.1.exe` av `tor-"
"browser-windows-x86_64-portable-13.0.1.exe.asc`."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"If you encounter errors you cannot fix, feel free to [download and use this "
"public key](https://openpgpkey.torproject.org/.well-known/openpgpkey/"
"torproject.org/hu/kounek7zrdx745qydx6p59t9mqjpuhdf) instead. Alternatively, "
"you may use the following command:"
msgstr ""
"Om du får fel som du inte kan lösa kan du [hämta och använda den här "
"offentliga nyckeln](https://openpgpkey.torproject.org/.well-known/openpgpkey/"
"torproject.org/hu/kounek7zrdx745qydx6p59t9mqjpuhdf). Du kan också använda "
"följande kommando:"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"If you get an error message, something has gone wrong and you cannot "
"continue until you've figured out why this didn't work. You might be able to "
"import the key using the **Workaround (using a public key)** section instead."
msgstr ""
"Om du får ett felmeddelande har något gått fel och du kan inte fortsätta "
"förrän orsaken är utredd. Du kan eventuellt importera nyckeln enligt "
"avsnittet **Alternativ metod (med en offentlig nyckel)**."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"Import the Tor Browser Developers signing key "
"(0xEF6E286DDA85EA2A4BA7DE684E2C6E8793298290):"
msgstr ""
"Importera Tor Browser-utvecklarnas signeringsnyckel "
"(0xEF6E286DDA85EA2A4BA7DE684E2C6E8793298290):"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"In order to verify the signature you will need to type a few commands in a "
"terminal window. How to do this will vary depending on your distribution."
msgstr ""
"För att verifiera signaturen måste du skriva några kommandon i ett "
"terminalfönster. Hur det görs varierar mellan distributioner."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"In order to verify the signature you will need to type a few commands in the "
"Terminal (under \"Applications\")."
msgstr ""
"För att verifiera signaturen måste du skriva några kommandon i Terminal "
"under ”Program”."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"NOTE: Your output may deviate somewhat from the above (eg. expiration "
"dates), however you should see the key correctly imported."
msgstr ""
"OBS! Utdata kan skilja sig något från exemplet ovan, exempelvis när det "
"gäller utgångsdatum, men nyckeln ska visas som korrekt importerad."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"Note that these commands use example file names and yours will be different: "
"you will need to replace the example file names with exact names of the "
"files you have downloaded."
msgstr ""
"Kommandona använder exempelfilnamn. Dina filnamn skiljer sig och du måste "
"ersätta exemplen med de exakta namnen på de hämtade filerna."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid "Refreshing the PGP key"
msgstr "Uppdatera PGP-nyckeln"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"Run the following command to refresh the Tor Browser Developers signing key "
"in your local keyring from the keyserver. This will also fetch the new "
"subkeys."
msgstr ""
"Kör följande kommando för att uppdatera Tor Browser-utvecklarnas "
"signeringsnyckel i den lokala nyckelringen från nyckelservern. Även de nya "
"undernycklarna hämtas."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid "The Tor Browser team signs Tor Browser releases."
msgstr "Tor Browser-teamet signerar Tor Browser-utgåvor."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid "The key can also be fetched by running the following command:"
msgstr "Nyckeln kan även hämtas med följande kommando:"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid "The result of the command should contain:"
msgstr "Kommandots resultat ska innehålla:"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"They allow you to verify the file you've downloaded is exactly the one that "
"we intended you to get."
msgstr ""
"Signaturerna låter dig verifiera att den hämtade filen är exakt den som vi "
"avsåg att du skulle få."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid "This should show you something like:"
msgstr "Det bör visa ungefär följande:"

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"This will vary by web browser, but generally you can download this file by "
"right-clicking the \"signature\" link and selecting the \"save file as\" "
"option."
msgstr ""
"Det varierar mellan webbläsare, men i allmänhet kan filen hämtas genom att "
"högerklicka på länken ”signature” och välja ”Spara fil som”."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"To verify the signature of the package you downloaded, you will need to "
"download the corresponding \".asc\" signature file as well as the installer "
"file itself, and verify it with a command that asks GnuPG to verify the file "
"that you downloaded."
msgstr ""
"För att verifiera det hämtade paketets signatur måste du hämta motsvarande "
"signaturfil ”.asc” tillsammans med installationsfilen och använda ett "
"kommando som ber GnuPG verifiera den hämtade filen."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser Developers key is also available on [keys.openpgp.org](https://"
"keys.openpgp.org/) and can be downloaded from [https://keys.openpgp.org/vks/"
"v1/by-fingerprint/EF6E286DDA85EA2A4BA7DE684E2C6E8793298290](https://"
"keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/"
"EF6E286DDA85EA2A4BA7DE684E2C6E8793298290)."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser-utvecklarnas nyckel finns även på [keys.openpgp.org](https://"
"keys.openpgp.org/) och kan hämtas från [https://keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-"
"fingerprint/EF6E286DDA85EA2A4BA7DE684E2C6E8793298290](https://"
"keys.openpgp.org/vks/v1/by-fingerprint/"
"EF6E286DDA85EA2A4BA7DE684E2C6E8793298290)."

#: content/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/getting-started/verifying-tor-browser/
msgid "Workaround (using a public key)"
msgstr "Alternativ metod (med en offentlig nyckel)"

#: content/tor-browser/security/contents.lr:section.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/
msgid ""
"This section contains common questions regarding safety and reliability of "
"Tor Browser"
msgstr ""
"Avsnittet innehåller vanliga frågor om Tor Browsers säkerhet och "
"tillförlitlighet"

#: content/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/
msgid ""
"This guard usually remains the same for several months to protect you from "
"certain anonymity-breaking attacks."
msgstr ""
"Vakten förblir vanligtvis densamma i flera månader för att skydda mot vissa "
"attacker som bryter anonymiteten."

#: content/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/
msgid ""
"Tor selects a stable and trusted \"guard relay\" to be the first hop in your "
"circuit."
msgstr ""
"Tor väljer ett stabilt och betrott ”vaktrelä” som första hopp i kretsen."

#: content/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/
msgid "Why does the first IP address in my Tor circuit always stay the same?"
msgstr "Varför är den första IP-adressen i min Tor-krets alltid densamma?"

#: content/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/
msgid "Understanding guard relays"
msgstr "Förstå vaktreläer"

#: content/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/
msgid ""
"For more information on how guard relays work, see this [blog post](https://"
"blog.torproject.org/improving-tors-anonymity-changing-guard-parameters) and "
"[paper](https://www-users.cse.umn.edu/~hoppernj/single_guard.pdf) on entry "
"guards."
msgstr ""
"Mer information om vaktreläer finns i det här [blogginlägget](https://"
"blog.torproject.org/improving-tors-anonymity-changing-guard-parameters) och "
"den här [forskningsartikeln](https://www-users.cse.umn.edu/~hoppernj/"
"single_guard.pdf) om ingångsvakter."

#: content/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/
msgid ""
"It is a fast and stable relay that remains the first one in your circuit for "
"2-3 months in order to protect against a known anonymity-breaking attack."
msgstr ""
"Det är ett snabbt och stabilt relä som förblir först i kretsen i två till "
"tre månader för att skydda mot en känd attack som bryter anonymiteten."

#: content/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/
msgid "That is normal Tor behavior."
msgstr "Det är normalt beteende i Tor."

#: content/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/
msgid ""
"The first relay in your circuit is called an \"entry guard\" or \"guard\"."
msgstr "Det första reläet i kretsen kallas ”ingångsvakt” eller ”vakt”."

#: content/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/
msgid ""
"The rest of your circuit changes with every new website you visit, and all "
"together these relays provide the full privacy protections of Tor."
msgstr ""
"Resten av kretsen ändras för varje ny webbplats du besöker. Tillsammans ger "
"reläerna Tors fullständiga integritetsskydd."

#: content/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/guard-relay/
msgid "Guard relay"
msgstr "Vaktrelä"

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid ""
"Legacy unsupported operating systems receive no security updates and may "
"have known security vulnerabilities."
msgstr ""
"Äldre operativsystem som inte längre stöds får inga säkerhetsuppdateringar "
"och kan ha kända sårbarheter."

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid ""
"They also lack the new features and functionalities required by Tor Browser."
msgstr "De saknar också nya funktioner som Tor Browser behöver."

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid "Why did Tor Browser drop support for legacy operating systems?"
msgstr "Varför upphörde Tor Browser med stöd för äldre operativsystem?"

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid "Tor Browser legacy OS support"
msgstr "Stöd för äldre operativsystem i Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid ""
"**Linux**: most recent distributions that use glibc 2.17 or higher are "
"compatible. Note Tor Browser 16.0 (the current alpha and the next stable "
"version, scheduled for mid 2026) drops support for 32-bit x86 platforms."
msgstr ""
"**Linux**: De flesta aktuella distributioner som använder glibc 2.17 eller "
"senare är kompatibla. Observera att Tor Browser 16.0, den aktuella "
"alfaversionen och nästa stabila version som planeras till mitten av 2026, "
"upphör med stöd för 32-bitars x86-plattformar."

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid "**Windows**: users are recommended to upgrade to Windows 10 or 11."
msgstr ""
"**Windows**: Användare rekommenderas att uppgradera till Windows 10 eller 11."

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid ""
"**macOS**: users are recommended to upgrade to macOS 10.15 (Catalina) or "
"later."
msgstr ""
"**macOS**: Användare rekommenderas att uppgradera till macOS 10.15 "
"(Catalina) eller senare."

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid "32-bit Linux operating systems"
msgstr "32-bitars Linux-operativsystem"

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid ""
"For instance, Microsoft ended official support for Windows 7, 8, and 8.1 in "
"January 2023."
msgstr ""
"Microsoft avslutade exempelvis det officiella stödet för Windows 7, 8 och "
"8.1 i januari 2023."

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid ""
"However, due to the maintenance burden on the team as well as the growing "
"incompatibilities between legacy Firefox ESR 115 and latest, Tor developers "
"have decided to end support as of March 2026 with Tor Browser version "
"13.5.29."
msgstr ""
"På grund av underhållsbördan för teamet och de ökande inkompatibiliteterna "
"mellan äldre Firefox ESR 115 och den senaste versionen beslutade Tor-"
"utvecklarna att avsluta stödet i mars 2026 med Tor Browser 13.5.29."

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid ""
"In some cases, newer hardware may be required to support the newer operating "
"system."
msgstr ""
"I vissa fall kan nyare maskinvara krävas för att stödja det nyare "
"operativsystemet."

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid "Legacy operating systems are unsupported versions of operating systems."
msgstr "Äldre operativsystem är versioner som inte längre stöds."

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid ""
"Over the past several years we have maintained Tor Browser 13.5 and "
"backported security patches from Mozilla."
msgstr ""
"Under de senaste åren har vi underhållit Tor Browser 13.5 och bakåtporterat "
"säkerhetskorrigeringar från Mozilla."

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid ""
"Please refer to the [Tor Browser installation page](../../getting-started/"
"installing/) for a complete and up-to-date list of requirements."
msgstr ""
"En fullständig och aktuell lista över krav finns på [installationssidan för "
"Tor Browser](../../getting-started/installing/)."

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid ""
"Support for Windows 8.1 or lower and macOS 10.14 or lower has been "
"discontinued with the release of Tor Browser 14 (based on Firefox 128 ESR)."
msgstr ""
"Stödet för Windows 8.1 eller äldre och macOS 10.14 eller äldre upphörde med "
"Tor Browser 14, som bygger på Firefox 128 ESR."

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid ""
"They no longer receive security updates and may have known security "
"vulnerabilities."
msgstr ""
"De får inte längre säkerhetsuppdateringar och kan innehålla kända "
"sårbarheter."

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid ""
"Users on Windows 7, 8, 8.1, and macOS 10.12 through 10.14 remained on Tor "
"Browser 13.5, based on Firefox 115 ESR."
msgstr ""
"Användare av Windows 7, 8 och 8.1 samt macOS 10.12–10.14 blev kvar på Tor "
"Browser 13.5, som bygger på Firefox 115 ESR."

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid ""
"Users on legacy operating systems are strongly advised to upgrade their "
"operating system to obtain the latest stable version of Tor Browser with all "
"the security fixes and new features."
msgstr ""
"Användare av äldre operativsystem rekommenderas starkt att uppgradera för "
"att få den senaste stabila versionen av Tor Browser med alla "
"säkerhetskorrigeringar och nya funktioner."

#: content/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/legacy-os/
msgid "Windows 7, 8, 8.1 and macOS 10.12, 10.13, 10.14"
msgstr "Windows 7, 8 och 8.1 samt macOS 10.12, 10.13 och 10.14"

#: content/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/
msgid ""
"However, all tracking components are disabled by default, and plans are "
"underway to completely remove the remaining code."
msgstr ""
"Alla spårningskomponenter är dock inaktiverade som standard, och det finns "
"planer på att helt ta bort den återstående koden."

#: content/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/
msgid ""
"Some privacy-scanning tools list trackers in Tor Browser for Android because "
"the app is based on Firefox for Android."
msgstr ""
"Vissa integritetsgranskningsverktyg listar spårare i Tor Browser för Android "
"eftersom appen bygger på Firefox för Android."

#: content/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/
msgid "Why Tor Browser for Android is being reported to have trackers?"
msgstr "Varför rapporteras spårare i Tor Browser för Android?"

#: content/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/
msgid "Tracker warnings in Tor Browser for Android"
msgstr "Spårningsvarningar i Tor Browser för Android"

#: content/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/
msgid ""
"Additionally, a complete removal of the tracking code is [planned](https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/applications/tor-browser/-/work_items/41295)."
msgstr ""
"Dessutom [planeras](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/applications/tor-"
"browser/-/work_items/41295) en fullständig borttagning av spårningskoden."

#: content/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/
msgid ""
"All of the tracking code is [disabled by default](https://"
"bugs.torproject.org/tpo/applications/fenix/40009) in Tor Browser for Android."
msgstr ""
"All spårningskod är [inaktiverad som standard](https://bugs.torproject.org/"
"tpo/applications/fenix/40009) i Tor Browser för Android."

#: content/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/
msgid ""
"Privacy-scanning tools like [Exodus Privacy](https://reports.exodus-"
"privacy.eu.org/en/reports/org.torproject.torbrowser/latest/) detect these "
"libraries through static analysis, but this only shows that the code exists "
"in the app package, not whether it's active."
msgstr ""
"Integritetsgranskningsverktyg som [Exodus Privacy](https://reports.exodus-"
"privacy.eu.org/en/reports/org.torproject.torbrowser/latest/) hittar "
"biblioteken genom statisk analys, men det visar bara att koden finns i "
"appaketet, inte att den är aktiv."

#: content/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/
msgid ""
"The tracking code being reported is carried over from Firefox for Android as "
"Tor Browser is based on Firefox."
msgstr ""
"Den rapporterade spårningskoden kommer från Firefox för Android, som Tor "
"Browser bygger på."

#: content/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/tor-browser-for-android-no-trackers/
msgid "Tor Browser for Android"
msgstr "Tor Browser för Android"

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid "Follow these best practices to reduce risks and stay safer online."
msgstr ""
"Följ dessa rekommendationer för att minska riskerna och vara säkrare på "
"nätet."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser includes many privacy protections, but it cannot guarantee "
"perfect anonymity."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser innehåller många integritetsskydd men kan inte garantera "
"fullständig anonymitet."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid "Am I totally anonymous if I use Tor Browser?"
msgstr "Är jag helt anonym när jag använder Tor Browser?"

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid "Tor Browser best practices"
msgstr "Bästa praxis för Tor Browser"

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid "**DO NOT IGNORE THIS WARNING**."
msgstr "**IGNORERA INTE DEN HÄR VARNINGEN**."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"Also see EFF's interactive graphic explaining [how Tor and HTTPS relate]"
"(../../../about-tor/security/https-encryption-and-tor/)."
msgstr ""
"Se även EFF:s interaktiva grafik som förklarar [hur Tor och HTTPS samverkar]"
"(../../../about-tor/security/https-encryption-and-tor/)."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid "Be smart and learn more."
msgstr "Var eftertänksam och lär dig mer."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid "Control what information you provide through web forms"
msgstr "Styr vilka uppgifter du lämnar i webbformulär"

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid "Convince other people to use Tor, too!"
msgstr "Övertyga även andra om att använda Tor!"

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid "Don't enable or install browser plugins"
msgstr "Aktivera eller installera inte webbläsarinsticksmoduler"

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid "Don't open documents downloaded through Tor while online"
msgstr "Öppna inte dokument som hämtats via Tor medan du är ansluten"

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid "Don't torrent over Tor"
msgstr "Använd inte torrenttrafik via Tor"

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"Even if your torrent application connects only through Tor, you will often "
"send out your real IP address in the tracker GET request, because that's how "
"torrents work."
msgstr ""
"Även om torrentprogrammet endast ansluter via Tor skickas ofta din riktiga "
"IP-adress i spårarens GET-begäran, eftersom torrentprotokoll fungerar så."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid "Find company"
msgstr "Hitta företag"

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"Further, if you provide: name, email, address, phone number, or any other "
"personal information, you are no longer anonymous to that website."
msgstr ""
"Om du anger namn, e-postadress, adress, telefonnummer eller andra "
"personuppgifter är du inte längre anonym för webbplatsen."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid "Generally it is impossible to have perfect anonymity, even with Tor."
msgstr "Fullständig anonymitet är i allmänhet omöjlig, även med Tor."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"However, by default, it does not prevent somebody watching your Internet "
"traffic from learning that you're using Tor."
msgstr ""
"Som standard hindrar Tor dock inte någon som övervakar internettrafiken från "
"att se att du använder Tor."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"However, you should still watch the browser URL bar to ensure that websites "
"you provide sensitive information to display a [padlock](https://"
"support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/how-do-i-tell-if-my-connection-is-secure) or "
"[onion icon](../../features/onion-services/#onion-icon) in the address bar, "
"include **https://** in the URL, and display the proper expected name for "
"the website."
msgstr ""
"Kontrollera ändå webbläsarens URL-fält och se till att webbplatser där du "
"lämnar känsliga uppgifter visar ett [hänglås](https://support.mozilla.org/en-"
"US/kb/how-do-i-tell-if-my-connection-is-secure) eller en [onion-ikon](../../"
"features/onion-services/#onion-icon), att URL:en innehåller **https://** och "
"att rätt förväntat webbplatsnamn visas."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"If this matters to you, you can reduce this risk by configuring Tor to use a "
"bridge rather than connecting directly to the Tor network."
msgstr ""
"Om detta är viktigt kan du minska risken genom att konfigurera Tor att "
"använda en bro i stället för att ansluta direkt till Tor-nätverket."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"If you must work with files downloaded via Tor, we strongly recommend either "
"using a disconnected computer, or using [dangerzone](https://github.com/"
"firstlookmedia/dangerzone) to create safe PDF files that you can open."
msgstr ""
"Om du måste arbeta med filer som hämtats via Tor rekommenderar vi starkt en "
"frånkopplad dator eller [Dangerzone](https://github.com/firstlookmedia/"
"dangerzone), som skapar säkra PDF-filer att öppna."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"If you sign in to that website, they still don't know your location but they "
"know who you are."
msgstr ""
"Om du loggar in på webbplatsen känner den fortfarande inte till din plats, "
"men vet vem du är."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"If you visit a website using Tor Browser, they don't know who you are or "
"your true location."
msgstr ""
"När du besöker en webbplats med Tor Browser känner den inte till vem du är "
"eller din verkliga plats."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"Not only do you [deanonymize your torrent traffic and your other "
"simultaneous Tor web traffic](https://blog.torproject.org/blog/bittorrent-"
"over-tor-isnt-good-idea) this way, you also slow down the entire Tor network "
"for everyone else."
msgstr ""
"På det sättet [avanonymiserar du både torrenttrafiken och annan samtidig "
"webbtrafik via Tor](https://blog.torproject.org/blog/bittorrent-over-tor-"
"isnt-good-idea), samtidigt som du gör hela Tor-nätverket långsammare för "
"alla andra."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"Similarly, we do not recommend installing additional addons or plugins into "
"Tor Browser, as these may bypass Tor or otherwise harm your anonymity and "
"privacy."
msgstr ""
"Vi avråder också från att installera fler tillägg eller insticksmoduler i "
"Tor Browser, eftersom de kan kringgå Tor eller på annat sätt skada "
"anonymiteten och integriteten."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"The best defense is to be vigilant and extremely cautious when filling out "
"web forms."
msgstr ""
"Det bästa skyddet är att vara vaksam och mycket försiktig när du fyller i "
"webbformulär."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"This list of pitfalls isn't complete, and we need your help [identifying and "
"documenting all the issues](https://community.torproject.org/)."
msgstr ""
"Listan över fallgropar är inte fullständig, och vi behöver din hjälp med att "
"[identifiera och dokumentera alla problem](https://"
"community.torproject.org/)."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid "This will reveal your non-Tor IP address."
msgstr "Det avslöjar din IP-adress utanför Tor."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"Though there are some things you can practice to improve your anonymity "
"while using Tor and offline."
msgstr ""
"Det finns dock åtgärder du kan vidta för att stärka anonymiteten både när du "
"använder Tor och när du är frånkopplad."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"To help ensure private encryption to websites, Tor Browser includes [HTTPS-"
"Only Mode](../../features/secure-connections/) to force the use of HTTPS "
"encryption with websites that support it."
msgstr ""
"För att skydda krypteringen till webbplatser innehåller Tor Browser [läget "
"Endast HTTPS](../../features/secure-connections/), som tvingar webbplatser "
"som stöder det att använda HTTPS-kryptering."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser will block browser plugins such as Flash, RealPlayer, Quicktime, "
"and others: they can be manipulated into revealing your IP address."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser blockerar webbläsarinsticksmoduler som Flash, RealPlayer och "
"QuickTime eftersom de kan manipuleras till att avslöja IP-adressen."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser will warn you before automatically opening documents that are "
"handled by external applications."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser varnar innan dokument som hanteras av externa program öppnas "
"automatiskt."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"Tor does not protect all of your computer's Internet traffic when you run it."
msgstr ""
"Tor skyddar inte all internettrafik från datorn bara för att programmet körs."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"Tor only protects applications that are properly configured to send their "
"Internet traffic through Tor."
msgstr ""
"Tor skyddar endast program som är korrekt konfigurerade att skicka sin "
"internettrafik genom Tor."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"Tor tries to prevent attackers from learning what destination websites you "
"connect to."
msgstr ""
"Tor försöker hindra angripare från att ta reda på vilka målwebbplatser du "
"ansluter till."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"Tor will encrypt your traffic to and within the Tor network, but the "
"encryption of your traffic to the final destination website depends on that "
"website."
msgstr ""
"Tor krypterar trafiken till och inom Tor-nätverket, men krypteringen från "
"nätverket till den slutliga webbplatsen beror på webbplatsen."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"Torrent file-sharing applications have been observed to ignore proxy "
"settings and make direct connections even when they are told to use Tor."
msgstr ""
"Torrentprogram har observerats ignorera proxyinställningar och skapa "
"direktanslutningar trots att de har konfigurerats att använda Tor."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"Ultimately the best protection is a social approach: the more Tor users "
"there are near you and the more diverse their interests, the less dangerous "
"it will be that you are one of them."
msgstr ""
"I slutänden är det bästa skyddet socialt: ju fler Tor-användare som finns "
"nära dig och ju mer varierade deras intressen är, desto mindre riskfyllt är "
"det att du är en av dem."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"Under no circumstances is it safe to use [BitTorrent and Tor](https://"
"blog.torproject.org/blog/bittorrent-over-tor-isnt-good-idea) together, "
"however."
msgstr ""
"Det är dock under inga omständigheter säkert att använda [BitTorrent och Tor]"
"(https://blog.torproject.org/blog/bittorrent-over-tor-isnt-good-idea) "
"tillsammans."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid "Understand what Tor does and does not offer."
msgstr "Förstå vad Tor erbjuder och inte erbjuder."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"Unfortunately many sites ask for more personal information than they need "
"through web forms."
msgstr ""
"Tyvärr begär många webbplatser fler personuppgifter än de behöver via "
"webbformulär."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid "Use HTTPS versions of websites"
msgstr "Använd HTTPS-versioner av webbplatser"

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid "Use Tor Browser and software specifically configured for Tor"
msgstr "Använd Tor Browser och program som är särskilt konfigurerade för Tor"

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tb-safely/
msgid ""
"You should be very careful when downloading documents via Tor (especially "
"DOC and PDF files, unless you use the PDF viewer that's built into Tor "
"Browser) as these documents can contain Internet resources that will be "
"downloaded outside of Tor by the application that opens them."
msgstr ""
"Var mycket försiktig när du hämtar dokument via Tor, särskilt DOC- och PDF-"
"filer om du inte använder PDF-visaren i Tor Browser. Dokumenten kan "
"innehålla internetresurser som programmet som öppnar dem hämtar utanför Tor."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/
msgid ""
"We strongly recommend against using Tor in any browser other than Tor "
"Browser."
msgstr ""
"Vi avråder starkt från att använda Tor i någon annan webbläsare än Tor "
"Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/
msgid "Can I use Tor with a browser besides Tor Browser?"
msgstr "Kan jag använda Tor med en annan webbläsare än Tor Browser?"

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/contents.lr:article.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/
msgid "Using Tor with other browsers"
msgstr "Använda Tor med andra webbläsare"

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/
msgid ""
"Even if you manage to connect them through the Tor network, they can still "
"reveal identifying information such as:"
msgstr ""
"Även om du lyckas ansluta dem genom Tor-nätverket kan de fortfarande avslöja "
"identifierande uppgifter som:"

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/
msgid ""
"However, be aware that when using Tor and another browser at the same time, "
"your Tor activity could be linked to your non-Tor (real) IP from the other "
"browser, simply by moving your mouse from one browser into the other."
msgstr ""
"Observera att om Tor och en annan webbläsare används samtidigt kan Tor-"
"aktiviteten kopplas till den verkliga IP-adressen från den andra "
"webbläsaren, exempelvis genom att muspekaren flyttas mellan dem."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/
msgid ""
"If you run Tor Browser and another browser at the same time, it won't affect "
"Tor's performance or privacy properties."
msgstr ""
"Att köra Tor Browser och en annan webbläsare samtidigt påverkar inte Tors "
"prestanda eller integritetsegenskaper."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/
msgid "Is it safe to run Tor Browser and another browser at the same time?"
msgstr "Är det säkert att köra Tor Browser och en annan webbläsare samtidigt?"

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/
msgid ""
"Or you may simply forget and accidentally use that non-private browser to do "
"something that you intended to do in Tor Browser instead."
msgstr ""
"Du kan också glömma dig och av misstag använda den oskyddade webbläsaren "
"till något som du tänkte göra i Tor Browser."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/
msgid ""
"Other browsers lack these defenses, so using them with Tor can make you "
"easier to identify and track."
msgstr ""
"Andra webbläsare saknar skydden, så om de används med Tor kan du bli lättare "
"att identifiera och spåra."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/
msgid ""
"Tor Browser is carefully developed and modified to prevent these kinds of "
"leaks and to make Tor users look alike, which greatly improves anonymity."
msgstr ""
"Tor Browser är noggrant utvecklad och ändrad för att förhindra sådana läckor "
"och få Tor-användare att likna varandra, vilket kraftigt stärker "
"anonymiteten."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/
msgid "Tracking cookies and cache that remain after browsing sessions."
msgstr "Spårningskakor och cachedata som finns kvar efter surfsessioner."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/
msgid ""
"Using Tor in another browser can leave you vulnerable without the privacy "
"protections of Tor Browser."
msgstr ""
"Om Tor används i en annan webbläsare kan du sakna Tor Browsers "
"integritetsskydd."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/
msgid ""
"Using Tor in another browser is unsafe because those browsers are not "
"designed with Tor's privacy protections in mind."
msgstr ""
"Det är osäkert att använda Tor i en annan webbläsare eftersom andra "
"webbläsare inte är utformade med Tors integritetsskydd."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/
msgid ""
"Your operating system details, fonts, and plugins, which can be used for "
"fingerprinting."
msgstr ""
"Uppgifter om operativsystemet, teckensnitt och insticksmoduler som kan "
"användas för fingeravtryck."

#: content/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-browser/security/using-tor-with-other-browsers/
msgid "Your real IP address, through DNS leaks or WebRTC."
msgstr "Din verkliga IP-adress genom DNS-läckor eller WebRTC."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/contents.lr:section.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/
msgid "Understand how to circumvent internet censorship with Tor VPN"
msgstr "Förstå hur du kringgår internetcensur med Tor VPN"

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"When this happens, Tor VPN can be used with censorship circumvention tools "
"known as Bridges."
msgstr ""
"När detta inträffar kan Tor VPN användas med kringgåendeverktyg som kallas "
"broar."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:figure.text
#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Configure Tor VPN to use bridges"
msgstr "Konfigurera Tor VPN att använda broar"

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"**Snowflake**: Snowflake routes your connection through volunteer-operated "
"proxies to make it look like you're placing a video call instead of using "
"Tor."
msgstr ""
"**Snowflake**: Snowflake leder anslutningen genom volontärdrivna "
"proxyservrar så att det ser ut som om du ringer ett videosamtal i stället "
"för att använda Tor."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"**WebTunnel**: WebTunnel masks your Tor connection, making it appear as if "
"you're accessing a website via HTTPS."
msgstr ""
"**WebTunnel**: WebTunnel maskerar Tor-anslutningen så att den ser ut som "
"åtkomst till en webbplats via HTTPS."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"**obfs4**: obfs4 makes Tor traffic look like random data, and also prevents "
"censors from finding bridges by Internet scanning."
msgstr ""
"**obfs4**: obfs4 får Tor-trafiken att likna slumpmässiga data och hindrar "
"censuraktörer från att hitta broar genom internetskanning."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"After exhausting common troubleshooting steps, if Tor VPN fails to initiate "
"a connection to the Tor network, it is possible that your connection to Tor "
"is censored."
msgstr ""
"Om Tor VPN fortfarande inte kan upprätta en anslutning till Tor-nätverket "
"efter vanlig felsökning kan Tor-anslutningen vara censurerad."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"After the bridge bot fetches the bridge addresses, tap on \"Save bridges\"."
msgstr "När broboten har hämtat bro-adresserna trycker du på ”Spara broar”."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"Depending on where you are, one type of bridge may work better than the "
"other."
msgstr ""
"Beroende på var du befinner dig kan en brotyp fungera bättre än en annan."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Entering Bridge Addresses"
msgstr "Ange bro-adresser"

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"If using the built-in, obfs4 and Snowflake, censorship circumvention methods "
"do not work, you will have to request other bridges."
msgstr ""
"Om de inbyggda metoderna obfs4 och Snowflake inte kringgår censuren måste du "
"begära andra broar."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"If you have obtained bridges via Email or the Bridges website, you will have "
"to manually add the bridges."
msgstr ""
"Om du har fått broar via e-post eller webbplatsen för broar måste du lägga "
"till dem manuellt."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"In that case, connecting with one of the built-in censorship circumvention "
"methods might help."
msgstr ""
"I så fall kan någon av de inbyggda metoderna för att kringgå censur hjälpa."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Obtain bridges via the Telegram Bot"
msgstr "Hämta broar via Telegram-boten"

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"Or when launching Tor VPN, tap on \"Configure\" and then tap on \"Bridges\"."
msgstr ""
"När Tor VPN startas kan du också trycka på ”Konfigurera” och sedan på "
"”Broar”."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Paste the copied bridge addresses."
msgstr "Klistra in de kopierade bro-adresserna."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid ""
"Since bridge addresses are not public, you will need to request them "
"yourself directly from the app:"
msgstr ""
"Eftersom bro-adresser inte är offentliga måste du begära dem direkt från "
"appen:"

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Tap on \"Add new bridges\"."
msgstr "Tryck på ”Lägg till nya broar”."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Tap on \"Connection\"."
msgstr "Tryck på ”Anslutning”."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Tap on \"Get Bridges\"."
msgstr "Tryck på ”Hämta broar”."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Tap on \"Give me new bridges\"."
msgstr "Tryck på ”Ge mig nya broar”."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Tap on \"Request bridges\"."
msgstr "Tryck på ”Begär broar”."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Tap on \"Save\"."
msgstr "Tryck på ”Spara”."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Then tap on \"Just give me bridges!\" and copy the bridge lines."
msgstr "Tryck sedan på ”Just give me bridges!” och kopiera broraderna."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "To use bridges, tap on \"Connection\"."
msgstr "Tryck på ”Anslutning” för att använda broar."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "To use bridges:"
msgstr "Så använder du broar:"

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Toggle on \"Use a bridge\"."
msgstr "Aktivera ”Använd en bro”."

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Tor VPN supports the following types of bridges:"
msgstr "Tor VPN stöder följande typer av broar:"

#: content/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/circumvention/using-bridges/
msgid "Visit our [bridges website](https://bridges.torproject.org/)."
msgstr "Besök vår [webbplats för broar](https://bridges.torproject.org/)."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/contents.lr:section.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/
msgid ""
"Troubleshoot common issues and ways to contact support when encountering "
"issues"
msgstr "Felsök vanliga problem och se hur du kontaktar supporten"

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/contents.lr:section.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/
msgid "Encountering Issues"
msgstr "Problem som kan uppstå"

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid "How to contact support, report a bug or give feedback."
msgstr ""
"Så kontaktar du supporten, rapporterar ett fel eller lämnar återkoppling."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid "Feedback and User Support"
msgstr "Återkoppling och användarsupport"

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid "Feedback and Support"
msgstr "Återkoppling och support"

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid "1. Android version."
msgstr "1. Android-version."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid "2. Tor VPN version."
msgstr "2. Tor VPN-version."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid "3. Step by step of how you got to the issue, so we can reproduce it."
msgstr ""
"3. En stegvis beskrivning av hur problemet uppstod så att vi kan återskapa "
"det."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid "4. A screenshot of the problem."
msgstr "4. En skärmbild av problemet."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid "5. Tor logs."
msgstr "5. Tor-loggar."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid "6. Country or region you are connecting to Tor from."
msgstr "6. Landet eller regionen som du ansluter till Tor från."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"7. If you know or suspect Tor is censored in your region or network, please "
"mention that."
msgstr ""
"7. Nämn om du vet eller misstänker att Tor censureras i regionen eller "
"nätverket."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"All of our support channels are available in English, Russian and Farsi."
msgstr "Alla våra supportkanaler finns på engelska, ryska och persiska."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid "Contact Support"
msgstr "Kontakta supporten"

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid "Feedback and reporting a bug"
msgstr "Återkoppling och felrapportering"

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"File the bug report in the [Tor VPN repository](https://"
"gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/applications/vpn/-/work_items/new)."
msgstr ""
"Skapa felrapporten i [Tor VPN-projektet](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/"
"applications/vpn/-/work_items/new)."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"From Friday to Sunday, the helpline is closed but please rest assured our "
"team will get back to your messages."
msgstr ""
"Hjälplinjen är stängd från fredag till söndag, men teamet återkommer till "
"dina meddelanden."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"If none of these languages work for you, please write in any language you "
"feel comfortable with, but keep in mind it will take us a bit longer to "
"answer as we will need help with translation to understand it."
msgstr ""
"Om inget av språken fungerar för dig kan du skriva på ett språk som du "
"känner dig bekväm med. Svaret kan dock dröja något eftersom vi behöver "
"översättningshjälp."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"If that does not work, please file a bug report or contact our support team."
msgstr ""
"Om det inte fungerar skapar du en felrapport eller kontaktar supportteamet."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"If you encounter an issue that's not answered by our documentation, please "
"try the [Troubleshooting](../troubleshooting/) steps."
msgstr ""
"Om dokumentationen inte besvarar problemet provar du stegen under "
"[Felsökning](../troubleshooting/)."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"In the subject line of your email, please tell us what you are reporting."
msgstr "Ange i e-postmeddelandets ämnesrad vad du rapporterar."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"On [Tor Forum](https://forum.torproject.org/), create an account to submit a "
"new topic."
msgstr ""
"Skapa ett konto på [Tor Forum](https://forum.torproject.org/) för att "
"publicera ett nytt ämne."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"Our support channels on Telegram, WhatsApp and Signal are only available "
"over text messages; videos or calls are not supported."
msgstr ""
"Våra supportkanaler på Telegram, WhatsApp och Signal stöder endast "
"textmeddelanden, inte video eller samtal."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"Our user support channels via Email, Telegram, WhatsApp, and Signal are "
"operational through Monday to Thursday."
msgstr ""
"Vår användarsupport via e-post, Telegram, WhatsApp och Signal är öppen "
"måndag till torsdag."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"Please review our [discussion guidelines](https://forum.torproject.org/t/"
"welcome-to-the-tor-project-forum/) and check the existing topics before "
"posting."
msgstr ""
"Läs våra [diskussionsriktlinjer](https://forum.torproject.org/t/welcome-to-"
"the-tor-project-forum/) och kontrollera befintliga ämnen innan du publicerar."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid "Send us a message on [+17787431312](https://signal.me/#p/+17787431312)."
msgstr ""
"Skicka ett meddelande till [+17787431312](https://signal.me/#p/+17787431312)."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid "Send us a message on [+447421000612](https://wa.me/447421000612)."
msgstr ""
"Skicka ett meddelande till [+447421000612](https://wa.me/447421000612)."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"Send us a message on [@TorProjectSupportBot](https://t.me/"
"TorProjectSupportBot)."
msgstr ""
"Skicka ett meddelande till [@TorProjectSupportBot](https://t.me/"
"TorProjectSupportBot)."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"Sometimes when we receive emails without subject lines, they're marked as "
"spam."
msgstr "E-postmeddelanden utan ämnesrad markeras ibland som skräppost."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"The more specific your subject line is, the easier it will be for us to "
"understand and follow up."
msgstr ""
"Ju mer specifik ämnesraden är, desto enklare blir det för oss att förstå och "
"följa upp."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"To create a new bug report, please request a [new account](https://"
"anonticket.torproject.org/user/gitlab-account/create/) to access Tor "
"Project's GitLab instance or alternatively use the [Anon-Ticket portal]"
"(https://anonticket.torproject.org/)."
msgstr ""
"För att skapa ett nytt felärende kan du [begära ett nytt konto](https://"
"anonticket.torproject.org/user/gitlab-account/create/) för att få åtkomst "
"till Tor Projects GitLab-instans eller använda [Anon-Ticket-portalen]"
"(https://anonticket.torproject.org/)."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"To search and view all bug reports related to Tor VPN, please navigate to "
"the [Tor VPN repository](https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/applications/"
"vpn/-/work_items/)."
msgstr ""
"Du kan söka och visa alla felrapporter om Tor VPN i [Tor VPN-projektet]"
"(https://gitlab.torproject.org/tpo/applications/vpn/-/work_items/)."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid "Tor GitLab"
msgstr "Tor GitLab"

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/feedback-and-support/
msgid ""
"When reporting a bug, please check if the bug has already been reported."
msgstr ""
"När du rapporterar ett fel bör du kontrollera om det redan har rapporterats."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Troubleshooting common errors when running Tor VPN."
msgstr "Felsök vanliga fel i Tor VPN."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"Android does not permit the use of multiple VPN applications at the same "
"time."
msgstr "Android tillåter inte att flera VPN-appar används samtidigt."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Change Private DNS settings"
msgstr "Ändra inställningarna för privat DNS"

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Check Android settings"
msgstr "Kontrollera Android-inställningarna"

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Check on the Tor VPN application"
msgstr "Kontrollera Tor VPN-appen"

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Ensure you do not have another VPN app running."
msgstr "Kontrollera att ingen annan VPN-app körs."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Error #1: Check Internet Connectivity"
msgstr "Fel 1: Kontrollera internetanslutningen"

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Error #2: Check if Tor is censored in your network."
msgstr "Fel 2: Kontrollera om Tor censureras i nätverket"

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"Firewall application usually use a VPN connection and if running, will "
"prohibit Tor VPN from making any connections."
msgstr ""
"Brandväggsappar använder vanligen en VPN-anslutning och hindrar Tor VPN från "
"att ansluta om de körs."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "If Tor VPN is unable to connect, you might see a error message:"
msgstr "Om Tor VPN inte kan ansluta kan följande felmeddelande visas:"

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"If you have configured a DNS hostname on your Android's Network settings, "
"you can change them following this steps:"
msgstr ""
"Om du har konfigurerat ett DNS-värdnamn i Android-enhetens "
"nätverksinställningar kan du ändra det så här:"

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"In this case, trying one of the [censorship circumvention](../../"
"circumvention/using-bridges) methods might work."
msgstr ""
"I så fall kan någon av metoderna för att [kringgå censur](../../"
"circumvention/using-bridges) fungera."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Navigate to your Android device's Network and Internet settings."
msgstr "Gå till nätverks- och internetinställningarna på Android-enheten."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Please ensure a network firewall application is not running."
msgstr "Kontrollera att ingen nätverksbrandväggsapp körs."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Scroll to the \"Advanced\" section of the Tor VPN settings."
msgstr "Rulla till avsnittet ”Avancerat” i Tor VPN-inställningarna."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Set it to either 'Off' or 'Automatic'."
msgstr "Ställ in den på antingen ”Av” eller ”Automatisk”."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"Taking a look at the Tor VPN logs can be helpful in diagnosing the issue."
msgstr "Tor VPN-loggarna kan hjälpa till att diagnostisera problemet."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Tap on \"Configure\"."
msgstr "Tryck på ”Konfigurera”."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Tap on \"Tor logs\"."
msgstr "Tryck på ”Tor-loggar”."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"Tap on \"View Tor logs\" from the error message or from the \"Connect\" "
"screen."
msgstr "Tryck på ”Visa Tor-loggar” i felmeddelandet eller på skärmen ”Anslut”."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Tap on 'Private DNS'."
msgstr "Tryck på ”Privat DNS”."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "To fetch the Tor VPN logs:"
msgstr "Så hämtar du Tor VPN-loggarna:"

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "To troubleshoot, try each of the following:"
msgstr "Prova var och en av följande felsökningsåtgärder:"

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"Tor VPN does not support setting the DNS provider hostname manually, as "
"doing so bypasses Tor and reveals the sites you visit to the DNS provider."
msgstr ""
"Tor VPN stödjer inte att ange DNS-leverantörens värdnamn manuellt, eftersom "
"det kringgår Tor och avslöjar de webbplatser du besöker för DNS-leverantören."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid ""
"When using Tor VPN, DNS resolution is done by the Tor exit relay in your Tor "
"circuit."
msgstr ""
"När du använder Tor VPN utförs DNS-uppslagningen av Tor-utgångsreläet i din "
"Tor-krets."

#: content/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/encountering-issues/troubleshooting/
msgid "Connection Error on Tor VPN."
msgstr "Anslutningsfel i Tor VPN"

#: content/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/
msgid "Configure how the Tor VPN app appears on your phone."
msgstr "Konfigurera hur Tor VPN-appen visas på telefonen."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: content/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/
msgid "App Appearance"
msgstr "Appens utseende"

#: content/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/
msgid "After launching Tor VPN, tap on \"Configure\"."
msgstr "Starta Tor VPN och tryck på ”Konfigurera”."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/
msgid "App icon and name"
msgstr "Appikon och namn"

#: content/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/
msgid "Select from the choices."
msgstr "Välj bland alternativen."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/
msgid "Tap on \"App icon\"."
msgstr "Tryck på ”Appikon”."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/
msgid "To change the appearance of the App icon and name of the application:"
msgstr "Så ändrar du appikonens och appnamnets utseende:"

#: content/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/
msgid ""
"Tor VPN will still be visible on the home screen, from the notifications, "
"search, the App Library and the App store page."
msgstr ""
"Tor VPN är fortfarande synlig på startskärmen, i aviseringar, i sökningar, i "
"appbiblioteket och på appbutikssidan."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/app-appearance/
msgid "Configuring the how Tor VPN appears on your device."
msgstr "Konfigurera hur Tor VPN visas på enheten."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/
msgid ""
"By default all applications installed on your phone are configured to route "
"through Tor VPN, except any of the Tor powered apps, like the Tor Browser "
"for Android and Orbot."
msgstr ""
"Som standard leds alla installerade appar på telefonen genom Tor VPN, "
"förutom Tor-baserade appar som Tor Browser för Android och Orbot."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/
msgid "Configuring apps to use Tor VPN"
msgstr "Konfigurera appar att använda Tor VPN"

#: content/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/
msgid "Configure apps to use Tor VPN"
msgstr "Konfigurera appar för Tor VPN"

#: content/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/
msgid "How to configure Tor connection settings for specific applications"
msgstr "Så konfigurerar du Tor-anslutningsinställningar för vissa appar"

#: content/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/
msgid ""
"It is also possible to permit only certain apps to use Tor VPN and route "
"them through the Tor network."
msgstr ""
"Det går även att endast tillåta vissa appar att använda Tor VPN och leda dem "
"genom Tor-nätverket."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/
msgid ""
"Or when launching Tor VPN, tap on \"Configure\" and then tap on \"Apps\"."
msgstr ""
"När Tor VPN startas kan du också trycka på ”Konfigurera” och sedan på "
"”Appar”."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/
msgid "Tap on the \"Apps\" option."
msgstr "Tryck på alternativet ”Appar”."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/
msgid "Toggle off \"Protect all apps\"."
msgstr "Inaktivera ”Skydda alla appar”."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/
msgid "Toggle on the option to use Tor VPN for each individual app."
msgstr "Aktivera alternativet att använda Tor VPN för varje enskild app."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/config-apps/
msgid "Configuring applications to use Tor VPN"
msgstr "Konfigurera appar att använda Tor VPN"

#: content/tor-vpn/features/contents.lr:section.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/
msgid "Features of Tor VPN."
msgstr "Funktioner i Tor VPN."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/
msgid "Exit relay is the final hop in each of your Tor circuits."
msgstr "Utgångsreläet är det sista hoppet i var och en av Tor-kretsarna."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/
msgid ""
"You can configure Tor VPN to only choose exit relays from one particular "
"country."
msgstr ""
"Du kan konfigurera Tor VPN att endast välja utgångsreläer från ett visst "
"land."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/
msgid "Exit location of the Tor connections"
msgstr "Tor-anslutningarnas utgångsplats"

#: content/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/
msgid "Configure Exit location of the Tor connections"
msgstr "Konfigurera Tor-anslutningarnas utgångsplats"

#: content/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/
msgid "By default, the option is set to \"Random per circuit\"."
msgstr ""
"Alternativet är som standard inställt på ”Slumpmässig för varje krets”."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/
msgid ""
"Or when launching Tor VPN, tap on \"Configure\" and then tap on \"Exit "
"location\"."
msgstr ""
"När Tor VPN startas kan du också trycka på ”Konfigurera” och sedan på "
"”Utgångsplats”."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/
msgid "Tap and select the country from the list."
msgstr "Tryck och välj land i listan."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/
msgid "Tap on the \"Globe\" icon from the \"Connect\" screen."
msgstr "Tryck på jordglobsikonen på skärmen ”Anslut”."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/
msgid "To configure the exit location of the Tor connections:"
msgstr "Så konfigurerar du Tor-anslutningarnas utgångsplats:"

#: content/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/
msgid ""
"When connecting with the Tor network, websites and apps will think you are "
"connecting from the same country as your Tor exit relay."
msgstr ""
"När du ansluter till Tor-nätverket tror webbplatser och appar att du "
"ansluter från samma land som Tor-utgångsreläet."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/
msgid ""
"With this option checked, each application configured gets a random Tor "
"circuit."
msgstr ""
"När alternativet är markerat får varje konfigurerad app en slumpmässig Tor-"
"krets."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/exit-location/
msgid "Configure exit location of the Tor connections"
msgstr "Konfigurera Tor-anslutningarnas utgångsplats"

#: content/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/
msgid ""
"The 'Kill switch' can be used to block apps from connecting to the internet "
"if the Tor network cannot be reached."
msgstr ""
"Nödstoppet kan blockera appar från att ansluta till internet om Tor-"
"nätverket inte går att nå."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: content/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/
msgid "Kill Switch"
msgstr "Nödstopp"

#: content/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/
msgid "'Always-on VPN' should still be enabled, in that case."
msgstr "”Alltid aktiv VPN” bör fortfarande vara aktiverat i så fall."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/
msgid ""
"If you want some apps to connect to the internet without going through Tor, "
"you will need to leave 'Block connections without VPN' disabled."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill att vissa appar ska ansluta till internet utan att gå via Tor "
"måste du låta ”Blockera anslutningar utan VPN” vara inaktiverat."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/
msgid "Launch the Tor VPN app and tap on 'Configure'."
msgstr "Starta Tor VPN-appen och tryck på ”Konfigurera”."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/
msgid ""
"Note that at the moment, enabling the 'Kill switch' while Tor VPN is set to "
"only protect some apps will result in unprotected apps not being able to "
"connect to the internet at all."
msgstr ""
"Observera att om du aktiverar ”Nödstopp” när Tor VPN endast skyddar vissa "
"appar kan oskyddade appar för närvarande inte ansluta till internet alls."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/
msgid "Tap on 'Kill switch'."
msgstr "Tryck på ”Nödstopp”."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/
msgid "Tap on Tor VPN settings (⚙️)."
msgstr "Tryck på Tor VPN-inställningar (⚙️)."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/
msgid "To activate the 'Kill switch':"
msgstr "Så aktiverar du nödstoppet:"

#: content/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/
msgid "Toggle on 'Always-on VPN'."
msgstr "Aktivera ”Alltid aktiv VPN”."

#: content/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/features/kill-switch/
msgid "Toggle on 'Block connections without VPN'."
msgstr "Aktivera ”Blockera anslutningar utan VPN”."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid ""
"Tor VPN benefits from the privacy features of using Tor, hides your real IP "
"address and protects you against surveillance and censorship."
msgstr ""
"Tor VPN drar nytta av Tors integritetsegenskaper, döljer din verkliga IP-"
"adress och skyddar mot övervakning och censur."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid ""
"Tor VPN is a Tor-powered app which routes other apps on users' device "
"through the Tor Network."
msgstr ""
"Tor VPN är en Tor-baserad app som leder andra appar på användarens enhet "
"genom Tor-nätverket."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid "About Tor VPN"
msgstr "Om Tor VPN"

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid "**Access to Onion services**."
msgstr "**Åtkomst till onion-tjänster**."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid "**Censorship resistance**."
msgstr "**Motståndskraft mot censur**."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid "**Privacy**."
msgstr "**Integritet**."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid "**Stumps surveillance**."
msgstr "**Motverkar övervakning**."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid ""
"It conceals the destination of the traffic (i.e. names and addresses of "
"websites you visit) from your Internet Service Provider (ISP) and anyone "
"watching your connection locally and the operators of the websites and "
"services that you access and anyone watching them will see a connection "
"coming from the Tor network instead of your real Internet (IP) address."
msgstr ""
"Tor VPN döljer trafikens destination, exempelvis namn och adresser till "
"webbplatser som du besöker, för internetleverantören och andra som övervakar "
"den lokala anslutningen. Webbplatserna och tjänsterna som du använder, och "
"de som övervakar dem, ser en anslutning från Tor-nätverket i stället för din "
"verkliga IP-adress."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid ""
"Onion services allow people to browse and to publish anonymously, and are "
"also relied on for metadata-free chat and file sharing like [OnionShare]"
"(https://onionshare.org/), safer interaction between journalists and their "
"sources like with [SecureDrop](https://securedrop.org/), [safer software "
"updates](https://blog.torproject.org/debian-and-tor-services-available-onion-"
"services/), and [more secure](https://community.torproject.org/onion-"
"services/overview/) ways to reach [popular websites](https://"
"community.torproject.org/onion-services/#featured-onions)."
msgstr ""
"Onion-tjänster låter människor surfa och publicera anonymt och används även "
"för chatt och fildelning utan metadata, exempelvis [OnionShare](https://"
"onionshare.org/), säkrare kontakter mellan journalister och källor via "
"[SecureDrop](https://securedrop.org/), [säkrare programuppdateringar]"
"(https://blog.torproject.org/debian-and-tor-services-available-onion-"
"services/) och [säkrare sätt](https://community.torproject.org/onion-"
"services/overview/) att nå [populära webbplatser](https://"
"community.torproject.org/onion-services/#featured-onions)."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid "Some major uses and advantages of using Tor VPN:"
msgstr "Några viktiga användningsområden och fördelar med Tor VPN:"

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid ""
"The Tor network can be understood as a network of virtual tunnels that "
"allows you to improve your privacy and security on the Internet."
msgstr ""
"Tor-nätverket kan beskrivas som ett nätverk av virtuella tunnlar som stärker "
"integriteten och säkerheten på internet."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid ""
"The last relay in the circuit (the \"exit relay\") then sends the traffic "
"out onto the public Internet."
msgstr ""
"Det sista reläet i kretsen, ”utgångsreläet”, skickar sedan trafiken ut på "
"det offentliga internet."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid ""
"The operators of the websites and services that you access, and anyone "
"watching them, will see a connection coming from the Tor network instead of "
"your real Internet (IP) address and geographic location, and will not know "
"who you are unless you explicitly identify yourself."
msgstr ""
"Operatörerna för webbplatserna och tjänsterna som du använder, och de som "
"övervakar dem, ser en anslutning från Tor-nätverket i stället för din "
"verkliga IP-adress och geografiska plats och vet inte vem du är om du inte "
"uttryckligen identifierar dig."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid ""
"Tor VPN allows you to access websites and apps in places where they might be "
"blocked and access the free internet in places where government or Internet "
"Service Provider (ISP) has implemented some form of Internet censorship or "
"filtering."
msgstr ""
"Tor VPN låter dig använda webbplatser och appar där de annars är blockerade "
"och nå det fria internet på platser där staten eller internetleverantören "
"har infört censur eller filtrering."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid ""
"Tor VPN leverages the use of the Tor network routing the traffic through "
"relays in the Tor network."
msgstr ""
"Tor VPN använder Tor-nätverket och leder trafiken genom reläer i nätverket."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid ""
"Tor VPN, a free and open source software developed by the [Tor Project]"
"(https://www.torproject.org/), is a Tor-powered app which can be used to "
"route other apps on users' device through the Tor network."
msgstr ""
"Tor VPN är fri programvara med öppen källkod som utvecklas av [Tor-projektet]"
"(https://www.torproject.org/) och kan leda andra appar på användarens enhet "
"genom Tor-nätverket."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid ""
"Tor works by sending your traffic through three random servers (also known "
"as relays) in the Tor network."
msgstr ""
"Tor skickar trafiken genom tre slumpmässiga servrar, även kallade reläer, i "
"Tor-nätverket."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid ""
"Using the Tor network, makes it difficult to track a user's internet "
"activity by preventing any single point on the network from being able to "
"view both where the traffic originated from and where it is ultimately going "
"to."
msgstr ""
"Tor-nätverket gör det svårt att spåra en användares internetaktivitet genom "
"att hindra en enskild punkt i nätverket från att se både var trafiken kommer "
"från och vart den slutligen går."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid ""
"Your internet service provider (ISP) or anyone monitoring the network will "
"not be able to track your internet activity."
msgstr ""
"Internetleverantören eller någon annan som övervakar nätverket kan inte "
"spåra din internetaktivitet."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid ""
"[Onion services](https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/) are "
"services that can only be accessed over the Tor network."
msgstr ""
"[Onion-tjänster](https://community.torproject.org/onion-services/) är "
"tjänster som endast går att nå via Tor-nätverket."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/about-tor-vpn/
msgid "⚠️  **WARNING**: Tor VPN is beta software."
msgstr "⚠️ **VARNING**: Tor VPN är en betaversion."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/contents.lr:section.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/
msgid "Understand the basics of Tor VPN."
msgstr "Lär dig grunderna i Tor VPN."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/download-and-install/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/download-and-install/
msgid "Tor VPN is only available on Android."
msgstr "Tor VPN finns endast för Android."

