msgstr "Android 7.0 eller senare."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/download-and-install/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/download-and-install/
msgid "Android Tablets and Chromebooks are not supported."
msgstr "Android-surfplattor och Chromebook-enheter stöds inte."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/download-and-install/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/download-and-install/
msgid "Android device supporting Aarch64, Arm, x86_64 or x86 architecture."
msgstr ""
"Android-enhet med stöd för arkitekturen Aarch64, Arm, x86_64 eller x86."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/download-and-install/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/download-and-install/
msgid "Free, both as in libre software, and, available free of charge."
msgstr "Fritt både i betydelsen fri programvara och kostnadsfritt."

