"Tor VPN can be downloaded and installed from [F-Droid](https://f-droid.org/"
"packages/org.torproject.vpn/)."
msgstr ""
"Tor VPN kan hämtas och installeras från [F-Droid](https://f-droid.org/"
"packages/org.torproject.vpn/)."

