#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"On the \"Connect\" screen, by default, all applications installed on the "
"phone are configured to route through Tor VPN with the option \"All apps "
"protected\" toggled on."
msgstr ""
"På skärmen ”Anslut” är alla installerade appar på telefonen som standard "
"konfigurerade att ledas genom Tor VPN, med alternativet ”Alla appar skyddas” "
"aktiverat."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"Once installed, you can launch Tor VPN from the Play Store by clicking on "
"\"Open\" or from the list of applications installed on your phone."
msgstr ""
"När Tor VPN har installerats kan du starta appen från Play Butik genom att "
"klicka på ”Öppna” eller från listan över installerade appar."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Getting started with Tor VPN"
msgstr "Komma igång med Tor VPN"

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/
