msgstr "Första starten"

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"A \"Connection request\" prompt will open up for Tor VPN to establish a VPN "
"connection."
msgstr ""
"En dialogruta med en anslutningsbegäran öppnas så att Tor VPN kan upprätta "
"en VPN-anslutning."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Tap on \"Connect\" to initiate the connection."
msgstr "Tryck på ”Anslut” för att starta anslutningen."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Tap on \"OK\"."
msgstr "Tryck på ”OK”."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Toggle on \"Connect automatically\"."
msgstr "Aktivera ”Anslut automatiskt”."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "When launching Tor VPN, tap on \"Configure\"."
msgstr "Tryck på ”Konfigurera” när Tor VPN startas."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid ""
"You can configure Tor VPN to connect to the Tor network automatically with "
"the previously saved connection settings, every time the app is launched."
msgstr ""
"Du kan konfigurera Tor VPN att automatiskt ansluta till Tor-nätverket med de "
"senast sparade anslutningsinställningarna varje gång appen startas."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Configuring Tor VPN to connect automatically on every launch."
msgstr "Konfigurera Tor VPN att ansluta automatiskt vid varje start."

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/contents.lr:figure.text
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/first-launch/
msgid "Screen sequence from first launch to Tor VPN connection established"
msgstr ""
"Skärmsekvens från första starten tills Tor VPN-anslutningen har upprättats"

#: content/tor-vpn/getting-started/uninstall/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/getting-started/uninstall/
msgid ""
"Tor VPN can be uninstalled directly from Google Play Store, F-Droid or from "
"your mobile device's application settings."
msgstr ""
"Tor VPN kan avinstalleras direkt från Google Play Butik, F-Droid eller "
"enhetens appinställningar."

