#: content/tor-vpn/security/threat-model/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/security/threat-model/
msgid ""
"The intended audience for this threat model document includes developers, UX "
"designers, documentation writers, technical trainers, and technical users."
msgstr ""
"Målgruppen för hotmodellokumentet omfattar utvecklare, UX-formgivare, "
"dokumentationsskribenter, tekniska utbildare och tekniska användare."

#: content/tor-vpn/security/threat-model/contents.lr:article.description
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/security/threat-model/
msgid ""
"This document provides insights into the security characteristics of Tor "
"VPN, describes the nature of the benefits that Tor VPN provides and when "
"they apply."
msgstr ""
"Dokumentet beskriver Tor VPN:s säkerhetsegenskaper, vilka slags fördelar Tor "
"VPN erbjuder och när de gäller."

#: content/tor-vpn/security/threat-model/contents.lr:article.longer_title
#: content/tor-vpn/security/threat-model/contents.lr:article.title
#: content/tor-vpn/security/threat-model/contents.lr:tab.title
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/security/threat-model/
msgid "Tor VPN Threat Model"
msgstr "Hotmodell för Tor VPN"

#: content/tor-vpn/security/threat-model/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/security/threat-model/
msgid ""
"**Recommendation**: Similar to how GrapheneOS proxies the Location APIs, "
"this API should be proxied to [return a random or zeroed number](https://"
"github.com/GrapheneOS/os-issue-tracker/issues/5313), because this API is an "
"extremely invasive source of linkability that [enables aggregation of "
"location and usage data across apps](https://krebsonsecurity.com/2024/10/the-"
"global-surveillance-free-for-all-in-mobile-ad-data/)."
msgstr ""
"**Rekommendation**: På samma sätt som GrapheneOS agerar proxy för plats-"
"API:erna bör detta API agera proxy och [returnera ett slumpmässigt eller "
"nollställt tal](https://github.com/GrapheneOS/os-issue-tracker/issues/5313), "
"eftersom API:et är en mycket inkräktande källa till länkbarhet som [gör det "
"möjligt att sammanställa plats- och användningsdata mellan appar](https://"
"krebsonsecurity.com/2024/10/the-global-surveillance-free-for-all-in-mobile-"
"ad-data/)."

#: content/tor-vpn/security/threat-model/contents.lr:content.content
#: https://support.torproject.org/tor-vpn/security/threat-model/
msgid ""
"The [ConnectivityManager APIs of Android 10 and above](<https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/net/"
"ConnectivityManager#getConnectionOwnerUid(int,%20java.net.InetSocketAddress,"
"%20java.net.InetSocketAddress)>) provide this property."
msgstr ""
"[ConnectivityManager-API:erna i Android 10 och senare](<https://"
"developer.android.com/reference/android/net/"
"ConnectivityManager#getConnectionOwnerUid(int,%20java.net.InetSocketAddress,"
"%20java.net.InetSocketAddress)>) tillhandahåller den här egenskapen."

